LINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvMjJiYmNmZWEtZTYzMy00ZDk3LWFkZDMtMTk4ZWVhZTZjMzE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211006eha6000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/6: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,826 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is leading a sharp recovery in the crypto sector today with a strong up-move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-1t-asset-as-btc-price-blasts-to-55k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 skyrocketed above the $1 trillion market capitalization }}}\uc2  today, pulling the total crypto market capitalization close to $2.3 trillion. This marks a complete 100% recovery from the June 22 lows when the total crypto market capitalization had plunged to about $1.15 trillion.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 Chainalysis\uc2  , the Central and Southern Asia and Oceania region has seen a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-transactions-surge-706-in-asia-as-institutional-adoption-grows-chainalysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massive increase of 706% in crypto transactions }}}\uc2  between July 2020 and June 2021. The total transaction value was $572.5 billion, accounting for 14% of the global transaction value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/3b0d41b9-6e64-40e1-b658-3c230aa041fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bank of America Corporation\uc2  (BoA) subsidiary, BofA Securities published a report on Oct. 4 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bank-of-america-offers-bullish-outlook-for-defi-and-nfts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 projected a \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  long-term picture for cryptocurrencies }}}\uc2 . The report estimated that by June 2021, about 221 million users had either traded cryptocurrencies or used a blockchain application, a massive increase from 66 million users in May 2020.\par \par \uc2 The BofA report said that the crypto sector was \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo large to ignore\u8221\'20\'1D and it comprised \u8220\'20\'1Cso much more\u8221\'20\'1D than just Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin pick up momentum and challenge the all-time high? Will this boost interest in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above $48,843.20 on Oct. 4, which was the first sign that the correction may be over. This may have attracted short-covering by the bears, resulting in a rally on Oct. 5 and today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/07b88173-193e-474d-b771-de6f8c18dbee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have thrust the price above $52,920, which invalidates the head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. The 20-day exponential movi