yptocurrency meme culture. Token holders often joke they will be forced to work in food delivery whenever the market crashes, leading to the meme below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miro.medium.com/max/1200/0*PjPSW9oTilUtRfeD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Great Crypto Meme War. There will be a great crypto meme war | by MAO DAO | Jul, 2021 | Medium}}}\par \par \uc2 Meituan\u8217\'20\'19s iconic delivery drivers are the source of many crypto-related {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://maodaonft.medium.com/the-great-crypto-meme-war-97a8d40fa23"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memes}}}\uc2  during a market crash.\par \par \uc2 At the end of March, Meituan {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/meituan-announces-financial-results-for-the-three-months-ended-march-31-2021-301301600.html#:~:text=Meituan%20has%20569.3%20million%20Annual,cities%20and%20counties%20in%20China."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  it had around 570 million users. Other financial apps, including banking apps, have already integrated the wallet services into their products.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/MAG-our-man-in-shanghai-5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210917eh9h00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/15: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOT, DOGE, UNI, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,877 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers continue to scoop up Bitcoin and altcoins on dips, a signal that there is strong demand at lower levels and that \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is building.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is leading the recovery in the crypto sector and the cryptocurrency briefly rallied to $48,429 on Sept. 15, before pulling back to test the underlying support levels.\par \par \uc2 While speaking during a live stream at the SALT conference, Ark Invest CEO Cathie Wood said that Bitcoin is the default currency of the crypto space and could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ark-invest-to-hold-60-bitcoin-40-ether-as-confidence-in-eth-grows-dramatically"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rise tenfold in the next five years}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Her projection is based on the presumption that Bitcoin will find a place in the balance sheets of many companies and institutional investors will increase their allocation to Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies to about 5%.\par \par \uc2 Several legacy finance companies have realized the growing demand for digital assets and are increasing their crypto offerings to fulfill that demand. \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  recently set up a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/morgan-stanley-launches-cryptocurrency-research-team"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new crypto-focused research division}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cin recognition of the growing significance of cryptocurrencies and other digital assets in global markets\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f400c83c-53f9-4604-a4c1-7191c5a77cf4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Additional positive news came from \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2  executives who apparently met several \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  officials and stressed the importance of why a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-lobbies-sec-to-approve-bitcoin-etf-in-private-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin exchange-traded fund should be approved}}}\uc2 . The executives pointed to the increasing rate of Bitcoin adoption, the approvals of similar funds in other countries and the growing demand for digital assets.\par \par \uc2 Can Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the current rebound? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Sept. 13 candlestick shows that bulls were aggressively buying on dips close to the critical support at $42,451.67. Sustained buying by the bulls and possible short-covering by short-term bears has propelled Bitcoin above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($47,195) on Sept. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e1bef2e1-d5dc-43c4-9c53-2641a35d4f74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone of $50,500 to $52,920.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has jumped back into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA has flattened out, signaling a minor advantage to buyers. A breakout and close above the overhead zone will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, bears are unlikely to throw the towel easily. They will attempt to stall the up-move at the overhead zone. If the price turns down from the resistance, the pair could consolidate in a large range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $42,451.67 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Sept. 13 candlestick shows that bulls are aggressively defending the 50-day simple moving average ($3,189). The buyers pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,430) on Sept. 15, but may face stiff resistance at $3,567.06.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/b0beae7b-ef10-49b3-a119-aa2ebf8571a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls overcome the overhead hurdle, the ETH/USDT pair could again attempt to rise to $4,000. Alternatively, if the price turns down from $3,567.06, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Such a move will suggest that the pair could remain range-bound for a few days. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint indicate a slight advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the critical support at $3,000 to signal the start of a possible down move.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) plunged below the breakout level at $2.47 on Sept. 13, but the bears could not pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($2.21). This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/726fb200-8f75-4d8e-a9a6-9134b7f8c042.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Sept. 14, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the upside on Sept. 15 and buyers are attempting to clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($2.55).\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone at $2.97 to $3.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair to the 50-day SMA. A break and close below this support will suggest a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears could not capitalize on the break and close below the 50-day SMA ($414) on Sept. 13, which suggests buying at lower levels. The bulls are currently attempting to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($436).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/a9c143d8-9085-4f52-9441-2846da8bdd3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls succeed in sustaining the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the correction might be over. The BNB/USDT pair could then move up to the overhead resistance at $518.90. A break and close above this level will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are selling on relief rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the pair to the next support at $340.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($1.05) on Sept. 13, suggesting that bulls are defending this level. The altcoin could now rise to the 20-day EMA ($1.13) where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/198ab583-bd25-4814-a39d-69d5540c8c75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down gradually and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage to the bears. A break and close below the 50-day SMA will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls. The selling could intensify if bears sink the price below the Sept. 7 intraday low at $0.95.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the correction could be over. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance zone at $1.35 to $1.41.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) Sept. 13\u8211\'20\'1314 candlestick shows that bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($145) but the negative sign is that bears are not allowing the rebound to sustain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6de8b806-c7d7-4312-b4c2-794aada3d52d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The inside-day candlestick pattern on Sept. 15 indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the uncertainty resolves to the downside and the SOL/USDT pair plummets below the 20-day EMA, the correction could extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $123.42.\par \par \uc2 The deeper the correction, the longer it may take for the next leg of the uptrend to begin. On the other hand, if the price turns up and rises above $171.83, the pair could rally to $197.41 and then retest the all-time high at $216.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has continued its northward journey but the bulls have not been able to clear the hurdle at the resistance line. The RSI has turned down from the downtrend line and the negative divergence is intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/2dae0731-761d-40aa-b8de-25868afde90b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust and close the price above the resistance line, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum. The pair could then rally to $41.40 and if this level is crossed, the next stop could be the all-time high at $49.78.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($31.45). A strong bounce off this support will suggest that bulls are aggressively buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that bears have made a strong comeback.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-s-bitcoin-treasury-exceeds-cash-held-by-80-of-s-p-500-non-financial-companies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin treasury exceeds cash held by 80% of S&P 500 non-financial companies}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the moving averages and the support level at $0.21. Although bulls are attempting to defend the $0.21 support, the bounce lacks strength. This suggests weak demand at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/46251028-fd8a-4436-96ac-42a46e7f419a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI continues to trade in the negative territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $0.21, the DOGE/USDT pair could plummet to the next major support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close above the moving averages will be the first sign that bulls are back in the game. The pair could pick up momentum above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears repeatedly failed to pull Uniswap (UNI) below the Sept. 7 intraday low at $21 in the past few days. This shows buying at lower levels. The bulls pushed the price above $25 on Sept. 14 but are facing stiff resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e5f4892a-d971-4f2c-8017-cbb5838cfe5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $25, the UNI/USDT pair could again drop toward $23.45 and then $21. This is an important level to watch out for because a break below it could signal a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $25 or from $23.45, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. A break and close above the moving averages could open the doors for a possible rise to $31.41.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token bounced off the 20-day EMA ($33.50) on Sept. 13, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This suggests that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f016e5cc-11a6-4c29-a44c-1160f943de81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LUNA/USDT pair formed an inside candlestick pattern on Sept. 14, indicating indecision among bulls and bears. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal advantage to the bears. The pair could then correct to the 50-day SMA ($25.25).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above $38, the pair could again resume its up-move toward the all-time high at $45.01. A break and close above this resistance could propel the pair to the psychological level at $50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvODY2MTYzZjUtOTlkYy00YmIxLWI0MmYtNzYzYmMzNjQzMzY3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210915eh9f000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Uniswap\par \b \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) price jumps by 15% in DeFi, cryptocurrency market rebounds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 783 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) was among the best performers among the top-cap cryptocurrency tokens in the previous 24 hours, logging better gains than its rivals Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and Binance Coin (BNB).\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) was among the best performers among the top cryptocurrency tokens by market capitalization in the previous 24 hours, logging better gains than other top cryptocurrencies, namely Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the UNI/USD exchange rate jumped 13.26% to hit a seven-day high of $25.68. Traders continued to bid higher on the pair entering Wednesday, pushing its value higher to $26.07 at one point, up more than 15% from the previous session\u8217\'20\'19s open of $22.66.\par \par \uc2 Market-wide recovery behind UNI gains?\par \par \uc2 The majority of UNI\u8217\'20\'19s gains in the previous 24 hours seems to have surfaced in the wake of a market-wide recovery.\par \par \uc2 For instance, the said timeframe witnessed Bitcoin, the benchmark cryptocurrency that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bloomberg-strategist-explains-why-30-year-us-bonds-have-bullish-implications-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enjoys heavy influence}}}\uc2  on the rest of the crypto tokens, climbed above $47,000 following a 4.85% upside move on Tuesday. Meanwhile, Ethereum saw its native asset, ETH, rallying toward $3,500 in a 4.57% price jump.\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere in the crypto market, BNB, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), Terra (LUNA) and Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK also rose. In contrast, smart contracts platform Solana\u8217\'20\'19s native asset, SOL, fell 6.47% following a denial-of-service disruption on its network.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), one of Solana\u8217\'20\'19s top rivals, dropped by more than 1%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/a6eb6c21-4274-4e66-af93-88d4c897da98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The performance of the top 15 cryptocurrencies in the past 24 hours. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At first, the gains among the top tokens, including Uniswap, looked to have been helped by capital rotations out of SOL and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 In detail, Solana\u8217\'20\'19s market cap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-traders-flock-to-solana-as-demand-for-eth-and-btc-flattens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged by more than 400% quarter-to-date}}}\uc2  following its foray into the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptopunks-floor-price-slips-below-80-eth-as-nft-trading-volume-deflates-by-50"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 booming nonfungible token}}}\uc2  (NFT) sector, providing traders a decent opportunity to lock interim profits. Additionally, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-and-arbitrum-knocked-offline-while-ethereum-evades-attack"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 network outage accelerated}}}\uc2  the profit-taking scenario.\par \par \uc2 Solana mainnet-beta is experiencing intermittent instability. This began approximately 45 minutes ago, and engineers are investigating the issue.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Solana Status (@SolanaStatus) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SolanaStatus/status/1437757547235131396?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 14, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-launches-smart-contracts-after-successful-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attracted speculation because of its Alonzo upgrade}}}\uc2 , which made it a smart contracts platform for the first time since its launch. In addition, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 2,500% year-to-date performance gave traders adequate opportunities to \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-the-news-ada-price-drops-10-following-cardano-s-long-awaited-smart-contracts-rollout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sell the news}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D and secure gains.\par \par \uc2 UNI holders are masters of 9.15 million MIR tokens\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s superior performance in the previous 24 hours also took cues from speculation that holding UNI could grant them access to airdrop tokens.\par \par \uc2 In a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.flipsidecrypto.com/mir-airdrops-uni-luna/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 note}}}\uc2 , Brendan Murray, content marketing manager at Boston-based blockchain analysis firm Flipside Crypto, cited \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user Jr3225\u8217\'20\'19s research. The study cited many UNI holders failed to realize that they could claim 9.15 million of the synthetic asset platform Mirror Protocol\u8217\'20\'19s MIR tokens via a December 2020 airdrop.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, LUNA stakers could claim more free {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mirror-protocol-silently-rallies-30-overnight-despite-crypto-market-slump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MIR tokens}}}\uc2  than UNI ones \u8212\'20\'14 MIR/USD has surged 200% this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/33c6232a-026e-4d8c-ae34-69ad83911d51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total MIR claimed on the y-axis, airdrop-type on the x-axis. Source: \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user Jr3225\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kiwi-paradox-650.notion.site/55-Hard-Terra-UNI-Airdrop-Recipients-f079bac86b044e0192ed44ec0118f190"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , published Tuesday, coincided with the UNI price pump.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap technical outlook\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s latest rally had it test a support confluence made up of falling trendline resistance and the 38.2% Fib line (~$26.093) of a Fibonacci retracement graph (drawn from a $42.89 swing high to $15.70 swing low).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6bf53e77-6abe-4190-b956-e03d9d874482.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers took control near the confluence, prompting UNI/USD to correct by 4.59% to an intraday low of $24.50. Its next support target is \u8212\'20\'14 again \u8212\'20\'14 a confluence of 23.6% Fib line ($22.12) and the ascending trendline that overall constitutes a rising channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investors-dominated-the-defi-scene-in-q2-chainalysis-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutional investors dominated the DeFi scene in Q2: Chainalysis report}}}\par \par \uc2 An interim \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook entails UNI/USD breaking above $26.09 and stepping toward the next Fib levels ($29.30, $32.51, and so on) unless the pair reaches the rising channel\u8217\'20\'19s upper trendline near $42.89.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could see UNI/USD break below the $22.12 Fib line and the channel support to target $15.70.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZTM4MmE5NDAtMGE5NS00ZGY0LWJhN2EtNjcwOTIxZDJlMGUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210915eh9f0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional traders flock to Solana as demand for ETH and BTC flattens\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 448 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 So-called \u8216\'20\'18Ethereum killer\u8217\'20\'19 Solana seems to have institutional traders convinced, with SOL-tracking products attracting nearly $50 million while Ether instruments saw outflows last week.\par \par \uc2 Institutional traders have flocked to Solana (SOL) as demand for Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exposure has flattened, with SOL investment products representing a whopping 86.6% of total weekly inflows to crypto investment products last week.\par \par \uc2 According to Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s issue of \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly,\u8221\'20\'1D SOL investment products {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinshares/vol-46-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-bccdbbeaff99"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saw}}}\uc2  inflows of $49.4 million between Sept. 6 and Friday. The combined total inflows for crypto investment products equated to $57 million for the week, with SOL seeing a 275% week-over-week increase to represent 86.6% of total inflow.\par \par \uc2 The surging inflows to Solana products coincided with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-rally-mimicking-ethereum-why-a-500-sol-price-target-could-be-conservative"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price of SOL gaining}}}\uc2  36% over the same period. The report concluded:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA combination of price appreciation and inflows now brings Solana\u8217\'20\'19s assets under management to $97 million, the 5th largest of all investment products.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  products have now seen inflows for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-exposure-to-altcoin-products-retests-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth consecutive week}}}\uc2 , with demand for altcoins significantly outweighing the appetite for BTC products, which saw minimal inflows of $200,000.\par \par \uc2 The inflows were also partially offset by institutional investors offloading $6.3 million worth Ether exposure as the underlying asset\u8217\'20\'19s price dropped 10% during the week.\par \par \uc2 Despite Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s highly anticipated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-launches-smart-contracts-after-successful-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduction of smart contracts}}}\uc2  on Monday, institutional flows into Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  -tracking products saw a 46% decrease compared to the previous week.\par \par \uc2 Multi-asset products, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT and Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) also saw inflows of $3.2 million, $3.1 million, $1.7 million and $600,000, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/finance-redefined-defi-s-4m-lobsters-and-solana-gaming-sept-6-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Finance Redefined: DeFi\u8217\'20\'19s $4M lobsters and Solana gaming, Sept. 6\u8211\'20\'1310}}}\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 estimates, institutional asset managers currently represent total assets under management (AUM) of $56.3 billion \u8212\'20\'14 marking a decrease of 9% compared to the week before, as the broader crypto markets experienced a pullback across the board.\par \par \uc2 Flows were mixed between asset managers, with \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  XBT and Purpose funds shedding $24.7 million and $45.5 million, respectively, while \uc2 21Shares\uc2 , \uc2 ETC Group\uc2  and \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  saw inflows of $75 million, $13 million and $6.1 million, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Top institutional manager Grayscale remained dominant, representing 74% of sectors AUM with $41.8 billion.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2021/09/13/2295767/0/en/Grayscale-Investments-and-iCapital-Network-Partner-to-Provide-Advisors-with-Access-to-Digital-Currency-Investing.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  a partnership with alternative asset fintech provider \uc2 iCapital Network\uc2  on Monday. The deal will enable iCapital\u8217\'20\'19s advisors to offer the firm\u8217\'20\'19s high-net-worth clients access to Grayscales\u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  services via a diversified market-cap-weighted investment strategy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZDBlMjNlNmQtOTNkZS00NmU2LWFmNDktZGE0YTVlMDY5NGZmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210914eh9e0005z\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional traders flock to Solana as demand for ETH and BTC flattens\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 451 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 So-called \u8216\'20\'18Ethereum killer\u8217\'20\'19 Solana seems to have institutional traders convinced, with SOL-tracking products attracting nearly $50 million while Ether instruments saw outflows last week.\par \par \uc2 Institutional traders have flocked to Solana (SOL) as demand for Ether (ETH) and Bitcoin (BTC) exposure has flattened, with SOL investment products representing a whopping 86.6% of total weekly inflows crypto investment products last week.\par \par \uc2 According to the Sept. 14 issue of \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly, Solana (SOL) investment products {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinshares/vol-46-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-bccdbbeaff99"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saw}}}\uc2  inflows of $49.4 million between Sept. 6 and Sept.10. The combined total inflows for crypto investment products equated to $57 million for the week, with SOL seeing a 275% week-over-week increase to represent 86.6% of total inflow.\par \par \uc2 The surging inflows to Solana products coincided with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-rally-mimicking-ethereum-why-a-500-sol-price-target-could-be-conservative"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price of SOL gaining}}}\uc2  36% over the same period. The report concluded:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA combination of price appreciation and inflows now brings Solana\u8217\'20\'19s assets under management to $97 million, the 5th largest of all investment products.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  products have now seen inflows for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-exposure-to-altcoin-products-retests-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth consecutive week}}}\uc2 , with demand for altcoins significantly outweighing the appetite for BTC products which saw minimal inflows of $200,000.\par \par \uc2 The inflows were also partially offset by institutional investors offloading $6.3 million worth Ether exposure as the underlying asset\u8217\'20\'19s price dropped 10% during the week.\par \par \uc2 Despite Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\u8217\'20\'19s highly anticipated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-launches-smart-contracts-after-successful-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduction of smart contracts}}}\uc2  on Sept. 13, institutional flows \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -tracking products saw a 46% decrease in inflows compared to the previous week.\par \par \uc2 Multi-asset products, Ripple (XRP), Polkadot (DOT) and Bitcoin Cash (BCH) also saw inflows of $3.2 million, $3.1 million, $1.7 million and $600,000 respectively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/finance-redefined-defi-s-4m-lobsters-and-solana-gaming-sept-6-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Finance Redefined: DeFi\u8217\'20\'19s $4M lobsters and Solana gaming, Sept. 6\u8211\'20\'1310}}}\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  estimates, institutional asset managers currently represent a total AUM of $56.3 billion combined \u8212\'20\'14 marking a decrease of 9% compared to the week before as the broader crypto markets experienced a pullback across the board.\par \par \uc2 Flows were mixed between asset managers, with \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  XBT and Purpose funds shedding $24.7 million and $45.5 million respectively while \uc2 21Shares\uc2 , \uc2 ETC Group\uc2  and \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  saw inflows of $75 million, $13 million and $6.1 million respectively.\par \par \uc2 Top Institutional manager Grayscale remained dominant, representing 74% of sectors AUM with $41.8 billion.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2021/09/13/2295767/0/en/Grayscale-Investments-and-iCapital-Network-Partner-to-Provide-Advisors-with-Access-to-Digital-Currency-Investing.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  a partnership with alternative asset fintech provider \uc2 iCapital Network\uc2  on Sept. 13. The deal will enable iCapital's advisors to offer the firm\u8217\'20\'19s high-net-worth clients access to Grayscales\u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  services via a diversified market-cap-weighted investment strategy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZDBlMjNlNmQtOTNkZS00NmU2LWFmNDktZGE0YTVlMDY5NGZmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210914eh9e00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/13: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,831 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s quick dip below $44,000 sent altcoin prices into a freefall and has some traders worried that the correction could deepen.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to make a strong recovery in the past few days has resulted in profit-booking in most major altcoins, threatening to pull the total crypto market capitalization back below $2 trillion.\par \par \uc2 The United States equity markets witnessed profit-booking and the S&P 500 dropped by 1.69% last week, suggesting the development of a risk-off sentiment. Charles Edwards, CEO of investment manager Capriole, pointed out that \u8220\'20\'1Calmost every Bitcoin correction in 2021\u8221\'20\'1D has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bearish-pennant-breakdown-confirmed-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 corresponded with a 2% or more drop}}}\uc2  in the S&P 500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/bb306c15-4eb0-4981-b5d6-d6a5b3f6ebca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Irrespective of the near-term weakness in Bitcoin, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has continued to build its holdings. The company\u8217\'20\'19s CEO \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-doles-out-240m-on-additional-bitcoin-purchase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed a purchase of 5,050 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  bought at an average price of $48,099 per coin. This has increased the company\u8217\'20\'19s stockpile to 114,042 Bitcoin, bought at an average cost of about $27,713 per coin.\par \par \uc2 Is Bitcoin in a firm bear grip and could this result in a sell-off in major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin once again turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($47,061) today, indicating that the short-term sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/bfbff65b-04ad-47d9-9e64-92fe9a7b748a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 43 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 The onus is now on the bulls to defend the critical level at $42,451.67 because if this support cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the $37,332.70 to $36,670 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could dim the chances of a strong recovery, keeping the pair stuck in a range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $42,451.67, the bulls will make one more attempt to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above $47,400 could open the doors for a retest of the overhead resistance zone of $50,500 to $52,920.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been sandwiched between the moving averages for the past few days. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,129) and bears are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA ($3,413).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/224ed1f9-efbc-4ddb-981e-99829ca6ddd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping down and the RSI has dropped below 46, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If bears pull the price below the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could witness further selling, resulting in a decline to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 This is an important support for the bulls to defend because a break below it could result in panic selling.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. A breakout and close above $3,567.06 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The buyers will then try to push the price to $4,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($2.16) on Sept. 7 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($2.57) on Sept. 11. However, higher levels attracted profit-booking as seen from the long wick on the Sept. 11 and 12 candlesticks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6cbdb6dc-cfac-4a7f-8455-e6efcc6d2cc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price back below the breakout level at $2.47 today. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 If sellers pull the price below the 50-day SMA, the correction could deepen to the next support at $1.94. Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level or rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price toward the overhead resistance zone at $2.97 to $3.10.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day SMA ($410) on Sept. 10 but bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA on Sept. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/c6c8dbe8-cddd-4a19-a697-a6dc3079f34f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle at $433 may have attracted a fresh round of selling today. If the price sustains below $393.20, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $369 and then to $340.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($438) and the RSI below 40 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $433 to suggest that the correction could be over.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck between the moving averages. The failure of the bulls to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.13) has attracted profit-booking from short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/241d277e-e704-4389-83b8-d8d4450a0dca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has turned down and the RSI has dipped below 45, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. If sellers