2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin loses moving averages and BTC price action heads to $44,000 ahead of golden cross.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell further at the start of the new week as a lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum sparked new lows near $44,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e4d58d1a-d365-490a-85b8-9f152bde587f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin threatens loss of $44,000 \u8220\'20\'1Cdemand zone\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD testing levels that analysts demand should stay as support.\par \par \uc2 After a weekly close below both the key 50-day and 200-day moving averages, the pair looked increasingly less likely to reclaim them on shorter timeframes.\par \par \uc2 For Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-are-the-btc-price-levels-to-watch-as-38k-emerges-as-bulls-line-in-the-sand"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  crossover}}}\uc2  of the two averages, known as a \u8220\'20\'1Cgolden cross,\u8221\'20\'1D was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y6kKYw-GmUg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 still on the cards}}}\uc2 . There was, however, \u8220\'20\'1Cno guarantee\u8221\'20\'1D that \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  behavior would result from the event taking place.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think we\u8217\'20\'19re going to have a top of this cycle\u8230\'20\'26 next year, in April\u8211\'20\'13May,\u8221\'20\'1D he forecast, giving a new, further-reaching timetable for BTC/USD to see its cycle top.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, $44,000 and $47,000 form the support and resistance levels to watch for a continuation up and down, he added.\par \par \uc2 For fellow trader and analyst Rekt Capital, $44,000 was equally important, forming the lower boundary of a \u8220\'20\'1Cdemand area\u8221\'20\'1D among buyers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe recent BTC Weekly Close wasn\u8217\'20\'19t technically bad as it occurred above the orange demand area. However, BTC is now dipping deeper into the demand area,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1437339762944319488/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on an accompanying chart Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat said, this demand area still hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been lost. As long as the demand area holds, BTC won\u8217\'20\'19t see $40K.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/3554d489-5e50-4321-9925-749e1084a333.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week annotated candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ). Source: Rekt Capital/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cardano 10% losses lead fresh altcoin rout\par \par \uc2 Altcoins fared worse than Bitcoin overnight, with the top 10 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-the-news-ada-price-drops-10-following-cardano-s-long-awaited-smart-contracts-rollout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led by 11% 24-hour losses on Cardano}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which fell to $2.41.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bearish-pennant-breakdown-confirmed-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Bearish\b0 \highlight22  pennant breakdown confirmed? 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 The largest altcoin, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), shed 6%, while the sole saving grace for investors was Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT, which at the time of writing was clinging to 4% upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/7c638946-0521-4d73-a9db-fa7f6dd9ec9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMany Altcoins have performed favourable Weekly Closes, indicating that retests should follow,\u8221\'20\'1D Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1437374202105978880"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  about the latest moves.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAt this time, the retests are failing, coins threatening to lose key supports. But it\u8217\'20\'19s early in the week. Could easily turn out to be normal retest \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trader Scott Melker, meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1437031267862818823"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soft-peddled}}}\uc2  concerns about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failing market dominance, arguing that new altcoins were artificially diluting its stance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvNDkyNDZkYWQtZmEyMS00YmQwLWEzMGMtZmM2ZDk3YTBlM2M1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210913eh9d0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Sell the news?  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price drops 10% following Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s long-awaited smart contracts rollout\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 692 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The so-called "Alonzo" upgrade did little in protecting Cardano from falling in tandem with the rest of the cryptocurrency market. But technical indicators point to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation trend ahead.\par \par \uc2 The price of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) fell on Monday in line with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bearish-pennant-breakdown-confirmed-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 other top cryptocurrencies}}}\uc2  despite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-launches-smart-contracts-after-successful-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the completion of its hard fork upgrade}}}\uc2  dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CAlonzo,\u8221\'20\'1D which introduced smart contract functionality.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate dropped 10.67% to reach its intraday low of $2.30, partly due to profit-taking sentiment among traders following the pair\u8217\'20\'19s 1,200%-plus price rally this year. Additionally, the intraday sell-off also surfaced in the period of an overall crypto market decline, with top tokens Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) falling 4% and 6.97%, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/33eb30ac-53ae-4766-b994-29e59c9d1bc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrency tokens and their performance in the last 24 hours. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s drop appeared when its core foundation rolled out a long-awaited smart contracts feature on its public blockchain for the first time. The launch expects to tap the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investors-dominated-the-defi-scene-in-q2-chainalysis-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 booming decentralized finance}}}\uc2  (DeFi) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nft-space-is-an-exciting-challenge-to-remain-competitive-says-sean-kelly"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nonfungible token}}}\uc2  (NFT) sector as they grapple with slower and costlier transaction fees on the leading smart contracts platform Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 As a result, anticipation for an extended upside boom in the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets was high, with The Value Trend, a financial analyst at Seeking Alpha, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://seekingalpha.com/article/4452830-ethereum-vs-cardano-the-race-to-the-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expecting}}}\uc2  the Cardano native token to hit $10 should it flip Ethereum to become the leading smart contracts platform.\par \par \uc2 Overall, the belief helped \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD deliver strong profits in the days approaching the Alonzo upgrade. On July 20, the pair was trading for as low as $1. Later, on Sept. 2, its value rose to a record high of $3.16, a 200% rebound.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation signals persist\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets tend to consolidate sideways or lower following a strong move upside as some traders decide to secure their profits. At the same time, investors with a long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook buy the asset from weak hands to build long-term investment strategies.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano chart below hints at a similar consolidation phase after \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  delivering a strong 200%-plus bull run. As a result, the probability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate continuing its uptrend remains high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/bd1c05c4-6f03-467c-9049-d84db5723acc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring Bull Flag formation. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rectangle pattern appears like a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bull-flag-breakout-pushes-avalanche-toward-80-as-avax-price-hits-another-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull flag}}}\uc2 . And, as a general rule, the profit target for bulls in a bull flag scenario is the same as the length of the previous uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/770947f2-e5f5-4a10-809c-9ae37c92437f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring Bull Flag target. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break above the upper bull flag trendline (at $2.93) could put \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD en route toward $4.50.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the Cardano token would need to maintain its foothold above its 50-day exponential moving average (50-day EMA; the velvet wave) near $2.27 to keep its interim \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias intact. A drop below the bull flag support and 50-day EMA floor would risk sending \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $1.92, its support line from mid-August.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-exposure-to-altcoin-products-retests-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutional exposure to altcoin products retests all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts shared deeper price targets, with a pseudonymous Twitterati spotting a \u8220\'20\'1CDouble Bottom\u8221\'20\'1D scenario, adding that traders are selling the news.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\uc2  smart contract upgrade so far going as I have predicted: Sell the news.\par \par \uc2 The price also formed a double top and now forming a lower low. If $2.25 is breached then down we go even more.\par \par \uc2 $1.20 soon? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/riFirqmCgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/riFirqmCgz}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rautakansleri (@rautakansleri_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rautakansleri_/status/1437363836395401222?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 13, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Cerbul, another market analyst, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CerbulBTC/status/1437334546425516034"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ongoing plunge was not due to the \u8220\'20\'1Csell the news\u8221\'20\'1D sentiment, adding that more capital would flow into the Cardano ecosystem from the DeFi sector.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAccumulate,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZGM1ZDgyNWMtODg3MC00ZTY5LTljNWItYTA2YmIwOGFkYzIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par