*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/33eb30ac-53ae-4766-b994-29e59c9d1bc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrency tokens and their performance in the last 24 hours. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 Cardano's drop appeared when its core foundation rolled out a long-awaited smart contracts feature on its public blockchain for the first time. The launch expects to tap the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investors-dominated-the-defi-scene-in-q2-chainalysis-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 booming decentralized finance}}}\uc2  (DeFi) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nft-space-is-an-exciting-challenge-to-remain-competitive-says-sean-kelly"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nonfungible token}}}\uc2  (NFT) sector as they grapple with slower and costlier transaction fees on the leading smart contracts platform, Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 As a result, anticipations for an extended upside boom in the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets were high, with the Value Trend, a financial analyst at Seeking Alpha, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://seekingalpha.com/article/4452830-ethereum-vs-cardano-the-race-to-the-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expecting the Cardano native token to hit $10}}}\uc2  should it flip Ethereum to become the leading smart contracts platform.\par \par \uc2 Overall, the belief helped \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD deliver strong profits in the days approaching the Alonzo upgrade. On July 20, the pair was trading for as low as $1. Later, on Sept. 2, its value has risen to a record high of $3.16, a 200% rebound.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation signals persist\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets tend to consolidate sideways or lower following a strong move upside, majorly as some traders decide to secure their profits. At the same time, investors with a long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook buy the asset from weak hands to build long-term investment strategies.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano chart below hints at undergoing a similar consolidation phase after delivering a strong 200%-plus bull run. As a result, the probability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate continuing its uptrend remains high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/bd1c05c4-6f03-467c-9049-d84db5723acc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring Bull Flag formation. Source: TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 The rectangle pattern appears like a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bull-flag-breakout-pushes-avalanche-toward-80-as-avax-price-hits-another-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bull Flag}}}\uc2 . And, as a general rule, the profit target for bulls in a Bull Flag scenario is the same as the length of the previous uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/770947f2-e5f5-4a10-809c-9ae37c92437f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring Bull Flag target. Source: TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 A break above the upper Bull Flag trendline (at $2.93) could put \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD en route toward $4.5.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the Cardano token would need to maintain its foothold above its 50-day exponential moving average (50-day EMA; the velvet wave) near $2.27 to keep its interim \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias intact. A drop below the Bull Flag support and 50-day EMA floor would risk sending \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $1.92, its support line from mid-August.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-exposure-to-altcoin-products-retests-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutional exposure to altcoin products retests all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts shared deeper price targets, with a pseudonymous Twitterati spotting a "Double Bottom" scenario, adding that traders are selling the news.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\uc2  smart contract upgrade so far going as I have predicted: Sell the news.\par \par \uc2 The price also formed a double top and now forming a lower low. If $2.25 is breached then down we go even more.\par \par \uc2 $1.20 soon? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/riFirqmCgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/riFirqmCgz}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rautakansleri (@rautakansleri_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rautakansleri_/status/1437363836395401222?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 13, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Cerbul, another market analyst, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CerbulBTC/status/1437334546425516034"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ongoing plunge was not due to the "sell the news" sentiment, adding that more capital would flow into the Cardano ecosystem from the DeFi sector.\par \par \uc2 "Accumulate," he said.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZGM1ZDgyNWMtODg3MC00ZTY5LTljNWItYTA2YmIwOGFkYzIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210913eh9d0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Here are the BTC price levels to watch as $38K emerges as bulls' line in the sand\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin weekly close in focus as BTC price action risks losing key moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) needs to retain two key moving averages in order to stay \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but is failing, fresh analysis shows.\par \par \uc2 In its latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://decentrader.com/market_updates/market-update-the-return-of-the-bull/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market update}}}\uc2  on Sept. 10, trading platform Decentrader warned that bulls do not have the upper hand much above current price levels.\par \par \uc2 A "golden cross" like any other?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has drifted lower into the weekend, at the time of writing sitting near $45,500. This is below the significant 200-day moving average (MA) and barely above the 50-day MA.\par \par \uc2 For Decentrader\u8217\'20\'19s Filbfilb, these would need to be reclaimed in order to fuel continuation of the bull run.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFor Bitcoin to remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , these two moving averages will need to be maintained, with any price action lower being intraweek \u8211\'20\'13 a weekly close below the 50 DMA would not be attractive, particularly if the 20 Week moving average is also lost (yellow line currently around $42k),\u8221\'20\'1D he summarized.\par \par \uc2 The 50 and 200 DMA were on the way to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-golden-cross-due-in-days-as-bears-draw-a-line-at-47k-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 printing}}}\uc2  a \u8220\'20\'1Cgolden cross,\u8221\'20\'1D traditionally a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal, but this week\u8217\'20\'19s dramatic sell-off may yet derail the process.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe selloff came amidst a pending \u8216\'20\'18Golden Cross\u8217\'20\'19 where the 50 DMA crosses above the 200 DMA,\u8221\'20\'1D Filbfilb continued.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is often seen as being a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign for the market and typically for Bitcoin, we see dumps into \u8216\'20\'18Golden Crosses\u8217\'20\'19 and pumps into \u8216\'20\'18Death Crosses\u8217\'20\'19, So on this basis alone, the pullback wasn\u8217\'20\'19t too much of a surprise.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0931658a-cc4d-44df-a069-795bb974b41f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with 50 and 200 DMA. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Should bulls need more impetus to enter, $38,000 \u8212\'20\'14 the site of the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level from $64,500 all-time highs \u8212\'20\'14 may yet provide the ultimate line in the sand in the case of a more intense BTC price correction.\par \par \uc2 $60,000 coming "early in Q4"\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-bitcoin-metric-that-flipped-green-just-before-50k-btc-price-bull-run-is-back"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , longer-term bullishness among analysts has changed little despite this week\u8217\'20\'19s events.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-10-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-dot-luna-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/10: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LUNA, UNI}}}\par \par \uc2 September is already tipped to be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-a-bitcoin-bull-run-not-in-september-btc-price-data-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lackluster month}}}\uc2  based on historical patterns, but beginning next month, BTC price action is widely anticipated to change dramatically.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are anticipating the $60k level to be retested sometime early in Q4, which will likely provide another correction with a final push to all-time highs towards the end of the year,\u8221\'20\'1D Filbfilb added.\par \par \uc2 These all-time highs could focus on the $100,000 mark, in line with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 end-of-year targets}}}\uc2  from other sources.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvOTNkNDZhOGYtNmYzOC00MGNmLWE5YjEtNWRhM2NkNGY5NTM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210911eh9b0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/10: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,785 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are still flashing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals but Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s steady slide toward its swing low could put a damper on the market\u8217\'20\'19s positive sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent plunge does not seem to have shaken the investors and data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-reserves-near-record-low-with-traders-eyeing-43k-btc-price-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchange reserves were down}}}\uc2  to 2.399 million Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which is close to the May all-time low at 2.390 million Bitcoin. Ki Young Ju, CEO of on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant, said this could result in a \u8220\'20\'1Csell-side liquidity crisis on Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin has outperformed gold by a huge margin in 2021, Omega Advisors chairman and CEO Lee Cooperman remains averse to investing in it because he said that he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-does-not-make-a-great-deal-of-sense-according-to-billionaire-lee-cooperman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not understand}}}\uc2  Bitcoin. The billionaire investor still considers gold to be a better store of value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e2cf9d7b-6a2b-4b50-9ee8-8dfb10d60b83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A new poll from research and data analytics firm YouGov showed that 43% of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/yougov-poll-finds-27-support-for-making-bitcoin-legal-tender-in-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 baby boomers strongly oppose the idea}}}\uc2  of Bitcoin being used as legal tender in the United States. However, 44% of respondents in the 25\u8211\'20\'1334 years age group were supportive of Bitcoin as legal tender.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to stage a strong recovery attract further selling and will this drag altcoin prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading between the moving averages for the past two days. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips near the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($44,934) but bears are not willing to give up and are selling near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($47,774).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/70082333-6aeb-4bb3-a645-031395c806cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) has dipped into the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $42,451.67. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could retest the overhead zone of $50,500 to $52,920. A breakout and close above this zone will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls defended the $3,377.89 level for the past three days on a closing basis, they could not sustain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,464). This suggests selling by bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6aed1980-3e6e-48c2-8a7c-68deb9bab5d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers have pulled the price below $3,377.89 on Sept. 10, increasing the possibility of a drop to the critical support at $3,000. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped below 48, indicating a slight advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USDT pair rebounds off $3,000, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then remain range-bound for a few days. The bulls will have to propel the price above $3,567.06 to start the journey to $4,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Sept. 8 candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls successfully defended the $2.47 support for the past two days but could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2.59).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f1876557-ff72-4c87-896e-20dc2d1bc71a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This attracted strong selling today, pulling the price below $2.47. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now drift down toward the 50-day SMA ($2.08). The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 46 suggest that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may then gradually move toward the overhead resistance zone at $2.97 to $3.10.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $433 on Sept. 9\u8211\'20\'1310, which suggests that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ee32e6af-6c29-43a8-b109-5856016ce084.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($405). If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the next major support at $340. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($450) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the positive momentum could pick up and the pair may rally to $518.90.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1.16) today but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/63736b83-edc7-417b-852e-ae06068cfc06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1). The 20-day EMA has turned down and the RSI has slipped into the negative territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to $0.75. Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will try to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair may rise to the $1.35 to $1.41 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) remains in a strong uptrend. The bulls pushed the price above the psychological resistance at $200 on Sept. 9 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/7a638bc3-9998-4ae1-8917-3aa339c21b32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the trendline, which is near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $158.78. A strong rebound off this support will suggest that traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par \uc2 They will then try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $216. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears pull the price below the trendline, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($131).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to push and sustain \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($0.26) in the past two days, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/5aff7fce-643b-4fd3-b014-62ee1a9c8482.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to the critical support at $0.21. Repeated retests of a support level within short intervals tend to weaken it. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.27) and the RSI below 39 suggest advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 If the $0.21 support cracks, the DOGE/USDT pair could extend its decline to the next support at $0.15. Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.21 and breaks above the moving averages, the pair may start its journey to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($23.44) on Sept. 7 and bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($28.88) on Sept. 9. This suggests strong accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9a04a6d6-05f0-4975-bd0c-433d8d00726a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $35.68 but the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the climb may not be easy. The bears are likely to defend the zone between $32.50 and $35.68 aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $28.60 and then to the 50-day SMA. On the contrary, if bulls thrust the price above $35.68, the pair could resume the uptrend toward $41.40 and then to $46.83.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vortecs-spotlight-fantom-s-500-rally-was-signalled-by-this-key-trading-metric"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Spotlight: Fantom\u8217\'20\'19s 500%+ rally was signaled by this key trading metric}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token bounced off from $22.95 on Sept. 7. This suggests that bulls flipped the previous resistance into support, which is a positive sign. The price rose above the 20-day EMA ($30.63) on Sept. 9, indicating strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/80c79ee5-d8ec-4131-bf9d-787a7e3b5757.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying today pushed the price above the previous all-time high at $36.89. This suggests strong demand at higher levels. The 20-day EMA has turned up and the RSI has risen above 68, indicating that bulls have made a strong comeback.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $36.80, the LUNA/USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The next target on the upside is $50. Conversely, if bears pull the price back below $36.89, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears flipped the $25 level into resistance and did not allow the price to rise above it on Sept. 8\u8211\'20\'139. Today, the sellers are attempting to sink Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) below the Sept. 7 intraday low at $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/aee60c76-e60a-47b8-8ede-64acec6e2cbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has dipped below 36, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the $21 level cracks, the UNI/USDT pair could slide to $18.69 where buyers may attempt to stall the decline.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off $21, it will suggest that bears are accumulating on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above $25. If they succeed, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may then rally to $31.41.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMjZmZGYwYzItMDFkZi00MmQ2LWE5MDQtMDdlNTQxMzY0YTY4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210910eh9a000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/10: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are still flashing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals but Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s steady slide toward its swing low could put a damper on the market\u8217\'20\'19s positive sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent plunge does not seem to have shaken the investors and data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-reserves-near-record-low-with-traders-eyeing-43k-btc-price-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchange reserves were down}}}\uc2  to 2.399 million ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which is close to the May all-time low at 2.390 million Bitcoin. Ki Young Ju, CEO of on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant, said this could result in a \u8220\'20\'1Csell-side liquidity crisis on Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin has outperformed gold by a huge margin in 2021, Omega Advisors chairman and CEO Lee Cooperman remains averse to investing in it because he said that he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-does-not-make-a-great-deal-of-sense-according-to-billionaire-lee-cooperman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not understand}}}\uc2  Bitcoin. The billionaire investor still considers gold to be a better store of value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e2cf9d7b-6a2b-4b50-9ee8-8dfb10d60b83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A new poll from research and data analytics firm YouGov showed that 43% of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/yougov-poll-finds-27-support-for-making-bitcoin-legal-tender-in-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 baby boomers strongly oppose the idea}}}\uc2  of Bitcoin being used as legal tender in the United States. However, 44% of respondents in the 25-34 years age group were supportive of Bitcoin as legal tender.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to stage a strong recovery attract further selling and will this drag altcoin prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading between the moving averages for the past two days. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips near the 50-day simple moving average ($44,934) but bears are not willing to give up and are selling near the 20-day exponential moving average ($47,774).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/70082333-6aeb-4bb3-a645-031395c806cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) has dipped into the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $42,451.67. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could retest the overhead zone of $50,500 to $52,920. A breakout and close above this zone will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls defended the $3,377.89 level for the past three days on a closing basis, they could not sustain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,464). This suggests selling by bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6aed1980-3e6e-48c2-8a7c-68deb9bab5d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers have pulled the price below $3,377.89 today, increasing the possibility of a drop to the critical support at $3,000. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped below 48, indicating a slight advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USDT pair rebounds off $3,000, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then remain range-bound for a few days. The bulls will have to propel the price above $3,567.06 to start the journey to $4,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Sep. 8 candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls successfully defended the $2.47 support for the past two days but could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2.59).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f1876557-ff72-4c87-896e-20dc2d1bc71a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This attracted strong selling today, pulling the price below $2.47. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now drift down toward the 50-day SMA ($2.08). The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 46 suggest that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may then gradually move toward the overhead resistance zone at $2.97 to $3.10.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $433 on Sep. 9 and today, which suggests that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ee32e6af-6c29-43a8-b109-5856016ce084.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($405). If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the next major support at $340. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($450) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the positive momentum could pick up and the pair may rally to $518.90.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($1.16) today but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/63736b83-edc7-417b-852e-ae06068cfc06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1). The 20-day EMA has turned down and the RSI has slipped into the negative territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to $0.75. Conversely, if the price rebo