ears.\par \par \uc2 If the $0.21 support cracks, the DOGE/USDT pair could extend its decline to the next support at $0.15. Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.21 and breaks above the moving averages, the pair may start its journey to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($23.44) on Sep. 7 and bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($28.88) on Sep. 9. This suggests strong accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9a04a6d6-05f0-4975-bd0c-433d8d00726a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $35.68 but the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the climb may not be easy. The bears are likely to defend the zone between $32.50 and $35.68 aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $28.60 and then to the 50-day SMA. On the contrary, if bulls thrust the price above $35.68, the pair could resume the uptrend toward $41.40 and then to $46.83.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vortecs-spotlight-fantom-s-500-rally-was-signalled-by-this-key-trading-metric"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Spotlight: Fantom\u8217\'20\'19s 500%+ rally was signaled by this key trading metric}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token bounced off from $22.95 on Sep. 7. This suggests that bulls flipped the previous resistance into support, which is a positive sign. The price rose above the 20-day EMA ($30.63) on Sep. 9, indicating strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/80c79ee5-d8ec-4131-bf9d-787a7e3b5757.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying today pushed the price above the previous all-time high at $36.89. This suggests strong demand at higher levels. The 20-day EMA has turned up and the RSI has risen above 68, indicating that bulls have made a strong comeback.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $36.80, the LUNA/USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The next target on the upside is $50. Conversely, if bears pull the price back below $36.89, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears flipped the $25 level into resistance and did not allow the price to rise above it on Sep. 8 and 9. Today, the sellers are attempting to sink Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) below the Sep. 7 intraday low at $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/aee60c76-e60a-47b8-8ede-64acec6e2cbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has dipped below 36, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the $21 level cracks, the UNI/USDT pair could slide to $18.69 where buyers may attempt to stall the decline.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off $21, it will suggest that bears are accumulating on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above $25. If they succeed, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may then rally to $31.41.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMjZmZGYwYzItMDFkZi00MmQ2LWE5MDQtMDdlNTQxMzY0YTY4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210910eh9a000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Solana rally mimicking Ethereum? Why a $500 SOL price target could be \u8216\'20\'18conservative\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 613 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A flying Solana (SOL) refused to land even in the face of a brutal sell-off in the cryptocurrency market on Tuesday. Then, two days later, the blockchain asset yielded another record high.\par \par \uc2 A high-flying Solana (SOL) refused to land even in the face of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-sharp-fall-from-50k-linked-to-stronger-us-dollar-gold-correlation-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brutal sell-off in the cryptocurrency market}}}\uc2  on Tuesday. Two days later, the price of SOL rebounded to another new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USD exchange rate averted a big pullback over the previous 48 hours and reached $217 for the first time in history.\par \par \uc2 The pair\u8217\'20\'19s ability to sustain \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure underscored investors\u8217\'20\'19 growing interest in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s blockchain as an emerging rival to Ethereum, a public ledger currently leading the decentralized finance (DeFi) and nonfungible token (NFT) sector boom.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0de3105c-8dc6-4d7b-ada8-58a4a7b174a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe SOL outperformance in the market recently is more or less the continuation of its growth run in recent times,\u8221\'20\'1D said Petr Kozyakov, co-founder and CEO at payment service firm Mercuryo.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith more than two different NFT project launches and minting going on in the ecosystem per day, there is an unending demand for SOL from retail buyers. As a result, it has kept the price up more than 50% this week despite a market-wide crash.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In detail, Solana hosted the launch of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sol-burn-solana-price-hits-100-for-the-first-time-after-mysterious-ignition-event-revealed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFT Degenerate Ape Academy}}}\uc2  on Aug. 15, which featured a collection of 10,000 cartoon apes. They were sold out in just eight minutes and involved 96,000 SOL or about $5.9 million.\par \par \uc2 Solana continued its foray into the NFT space by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sol-price-nears-200-after-ftx-s-solana-enabled-nft-marketplace-goes-live"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enabling an FTX-backed digital collectibles marketplace}}}\uc2  earlier this week. FTX, a crypto derivatives platform, revealed that its new NFT venture would enable NFT creators and owners to trade their digital arts cross-chain using Solana and Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 Solana beats top rivals\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market wiped more than $200 billion off its valuation following a sudden sell-off Tuesday. The leading \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  by market capitalization, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), saw its prices plunge from over $52,000 to almost $42,000 within minutes, which analysts largely blame on cascading {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/who-was-selling-not-hodlers-new-data-hints-at-bitcoin-crash-culprit-amid-leverage-wipe-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long liquidations}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Alternative cryptocurrencies, or altcoins, which more or less tail the Bitcoin trend, dropped in tandem, with the second-largest, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-8-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-dot-uni-bch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunging by up to 23.41%}}}\uc2 , and its runner-up \u8212\'20\'14 another smart contract rival \u8212\'20\'14 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/more-countries-to-follow-el-salvador-s-bitcoin-move-cardano-creator-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropping by 30.89%}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/32267bfc-6a94-4744-83e1-75e7bf6eca54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana's top rivals Ethereum and Cardano price performance. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, Solana was an exception in the sea of red. While the SOL/USD wobbled violently between gains and losses, it eventually closed the day 5.45% higher and followed it with extended upside moves in the sessions ahead.\par \par \uc2 The pair has surged almost 890% after bottoming out on July 20 at $21.96. At the same time, the total value locked inside Solana-based DeFi projects has crossed $7.81 billion, per {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://solanaproject.com/#/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  provided by SolanaProject.com.\par \par \uc2 Greg Waisman, co-founder and chief operating officer of Mercuryo, told Cointelegraph that he anticipates SOL to have reached $500 by the end of 2021. He noted:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSolana\u8217\'20\'19s growth runs appear to be mimicking that of Ethereum (ETH) and Binance Coin (BNB), and the $500 projection may turn out to be a conservative one for the coin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZjhmZDcxMDAtMmU0YS00Yzg4LThhNzQtZTYwMDA3NTY2YTMxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh990005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price in line for \u8216\'20\'18impulsive bounce\u8217\'20\'19 as Solana (SOL) leads altcoin surge\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 410 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is approaching fresh \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says a BTC price analyst as altcoins stage a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is again overdue, and one analyst is favoring an \u8220\'20\'1Cimpulsive\u8221\'20\'1D move toward $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/81326db7-62fa-44d1-9410-7d40d3aabe0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Trader: \u8220\'20\'1CChill and wait\u8221\'20\'1D for Bitcoin breakout\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD continuing to circle $46,000 on Thursd as an eerie calm lingered over the market.\par \par \uc2 Tuesday saw mass upheaval as a cascade of unwound positions sparked a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-plunges-below-43k-in-minutes-in-crypto-market-rout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 huge $9,000 daily loss}}}\uc2  for Bitcoin, something analysts have since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/who-was-selling-not-hodlers-new-data-hints-at-bitcoin-crash-culprit-amid-leverage-wipe-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pinned}}}\uc2  on overleveraged traders.\par \par \uc2 While the event\u8217\'20\'19s lows of $42,800 have not been retested, a breakdown is not off the cards, popular trader Crypto Ed says.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLooks like a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pennant to me...Impulsive bounce followed by consolidation,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  alongside an updated chart Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CChill and wait for the break out. Wrong when it breaks down.\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016/photo/1}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/d3d9de57-7a2a-4fb6-af23-c6f11e512559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD scenario. Source: Crypto Ed/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 With expectations thus skewed to the upside, fellow trader and analyst Rekt Capital eyed an ongoing retest of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 50-day exponential moving average (EMA) as a potential game-changer.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is the first time that BTC is retesting the blue 50-day EMA as support, after having reclaimed it as support in late July,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1435714522476687363"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe 50-day EMA is useful for understanding \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum as it tends to support established uptrends.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ab8733f3-ceb9-47dd-8c22-9f152642f483.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with 50-day EMA. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Altcoins recover as Solana passes $200\par \par \uc2 Improved performance across major altcoins, meanwhile, is giving hope to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  short-term case for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-8-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-dot-uni-bch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/8: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH}}}\par \par \uc2 While BTC/USD has stayed broadly flat overnight, all of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization have posted solid gains of at least 4%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) added 4.5% to circle $3,470 at the time of writing, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovered above $2.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sol-price-nears-200-after-ftx-s-solana-enabled-nft-marketplace-goes-live"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Still outshining}}}\uc2  the pack, however, is Solana (SOL), now trading above $200 on 32% gains in just 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0b43fbd0-b302-47ab-811b-5780a3e7ea6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD 1-hour candle chart (FTX). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMGM2NmI5ZWUtMDg3NS00ZWNhLWE5NjQtNjNlZDVkNTNjMDVlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh990005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Stablecoin\par \b \uc2 Which stablecoins were actually \u8216\'20\'18stable\u8217\'20\'19 during this week\u8217\'20\'19s sudden Bitcoin price crash?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 734 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto traders flocked to the safety of stablecoins during the Sep 7 market crash, largely ignoring warnings from regulators about their potential to not always maintaining a 1:1 US dollar peg.\par \par \uc2 A sharp sell-off across the cryptocurrency market on Tuesday \u8212\'20\'14 that saw top tokens Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana (SOL) fall by double-digital percentages \u8212\'20\'14 created a venue for stablecoins to prove their worth.\par \par \uc2 The fixed-price cryptocurrencies offered interim protection to traders from the notorious crypto price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They did so by almost maintaining their one dollar-peg and offering sufficient liquidity to traders who looked for a safety net during the market decline.\par \par \uc2 Blockchain analytics service CryptoQuant reported dramatic spikes in stablecoin transfers as the cryptocurrency market capitalizati fell from $2.38 trillion to $2.103 trillion on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ), the leading stablecoin by volume, processed $10.51 billion worth of transactions on Tuesday compared to $4.02 billion on Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/dbb272bf-0999-452f-9c50-066b4ba7f95c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The mean of all stablecoins transfer. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the second-largest stablecoin USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ), backed by Circle, reported $5.728 billion worth of transfers on Tuesday versus $3.27 billion in the previous session, logging a 74% spike.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the net stablecoin supply in circulation remained relatively idle, around $67 billion, showcasing adequate liquidity against demand even in the face of a brutal crypto market decline. As a result, many top stablecoins maintained their one-to-on dollar peg despite logging minor price drifts.\par \par \uc2 Centralized stablecoin more dependable\par \par \uc2 Among the top 10 stablecoins that showed minimal average deviation from their one dollar peg included six centralized, two mixed and two algorithmic projects.\par \par \uc2 USDC demand pushed its average valuation by about $0.00196 above a dollar, closely followed by Paxos (PAX), which traded $0.00203 above the same peg.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/66a6a976-4566-4d37-b3c7-935d64e73e96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 stablecoins ranked according to their average deviation from the U.S. dollar. Source: Larry Engineer's stablecoin tracker\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Binance exchange\u8217\'20\'19s native stablecoin, Binance USD (BUSD), and MakerDAO\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/makerdao-to-dissolve-foundation-and-become-truly-decentralized-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dai}}}\uc2  maintained their stability via a dynamic system of collateralized debt positions, autonomous feedback mechanisms, and a variety of user incentive structures.\par \par \uc2 Tether\u8217\'20\'19s wider demand across the cryptocurrency spectrum also pushed its average deviation up by $0.00244.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-promises-an-audit-in-months-as-paxos-claims-usdt-is-not-a-real-stablecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tether promises an audit in \u8216\'20\'18months\u8217\'20\'19 as Paxos claims USDT is not a real stablecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, TrustToken\u8217\'20\'19s TUSD, Stable Universal\u8217\'20\'19s HUSD and Terra\u8217\'20\'19s UST drifted $0.00249\u8211\'20\'130.00385 from their dollar valuation. FRAX and FEI posted a decoupling from their dollar peg by jumping $0.00404 and $0.00474 above it, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The data snapshot was taken 24 hours after Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market crash.\par \par \uc2 Is a stablecoin collapse good for Bitcoin?\par \par \uc2 But potential stablecoin risks have also attracted the attention of top United States officials, including Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen and Federal Reserve Bank of Boston President Eric Rosengren.\par \par \uc2 In July, Yellen \u8220\'20\'1Cunderscored the need to act quickly to ensure there is an appropriate U.S. regulatory framework in place\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/treasury-secretary-yellen-urges-lawmakers-to-quickly-introduce-stablecoin-guidelines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a meeting}}}\uc2  with the heads of the Federal Reserve, the Securities and Exchange Commission, the \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission\uc2 , the \uc2 Office of the Comptroller of the Currency\uc2  and the \uc2 Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-growth-could-affect-credit-markets-rating-agency-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stablecoin growth could affect credit markets, rating agency warns}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Rosengren {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/federal-reserve-official-stablecoin-growth-is-exponential-deserves-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  Tether a potential challenge to financial stability.\par \par \uc2 In July, a paper released by \uc2 Fitch Ratings\uc2  also noted that collateralized stablecoins could trigger short-term credit market contagion:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA sudden mass redemption of [tether] could affect the stability of short-term credit markets [...] particularly if associated with wider redemptions of other stablecoins that hold reserves in similar assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But what could a stablecoin market collapse mean for Bitcoin and similar digital assets? Mike McGlone, the senior commodity strategist at Bloomberg Intelligence, said it would benefit Bitcoin, in particular.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf the whole market collapse, there is only one safe store of value left: Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 For more about the potential risk of stablecoins, check out {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoins-crypto-house-of-cards?utm_source=Telegram&utm_medium=social"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s latest video report}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYTE3NDQ5YWUtODk0Mi00ZDA1LWI2ZjYtM2QwZjlmYjg4ZGEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh990005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Stablecoin\par \b \uc2 Which stablecoins were actually 'stable' during this week's sudden Bitcoin price crash?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 737 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto traders flocked to the safety of stablecoins during the Sep 7 market crash, largely ignoring warnings from regulators about their potential to not always maintaining a 1:1 US dollar peg.\par \par \uc2 A sharp sell-off across the cryptocurrency market Tuesday\u8212\'20\'14that saw top tokens like Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), and Solana (SOL) fall by double-digital percentages\u8212\'20\'14created a venue for stablecoins to prove their worth.\par \par \uc2 The fixed-price cryptocurrencies offered interim protection to traders from the notorious crypto price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They did so by almost maintaining their one dollar-peg and offering sufficient liquidity to traders that looked for a safety net during the market decline.\par \par \uc2 Blockchain analytics service CryptoQuant reported dramatic spikes in the stablecoin transfers as the cryptocurrency market cap fell from $2.38 trillion to $2.103 trillion on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Tether, the leading stablecoin by volume, processed $10.51 billion worth of transactions on Tuesday compared to $4.02 billion on Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/dbb272bf-0999-452f-9c50-066b4ba7f95c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The mean of all stablecoins transfer. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the second-largest stablecoin USDC, backed by Circle, reported $5.728 billion worth of transfers on Tuesday versus $3.27 billion in the previous session, logging a 74% spike.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the net stablecoin supply in circulation remained relatively idle, around $67 billion, showcasing adequate liquidity against demand even in the face of a brutal crypto market decline. As a result, many top stablecoins maintained their 1:1 dollar peg despite logging minor price drifts.\par \par \uc2 Centralized stablecoin more dependable\par \par \uc2 Among the top-10 stablecoins that showed minimal average deviation from their one dollar peg included six centralized, two mixed, and two algorithmic projects.\par \par \uc2 USDC demand pushed its average valuation by about $0.00196 above a dollar, closely followed by Paxos (PAX), which traded $0.00203 above the same peg.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/66a6a976-4566-4d37-b3c7-935d64e73e96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 stablecoins ranked according to their average deviation from the US dollar. Source: Larry Engineer's stablecoin tracker\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Binance exchange's native stablecoin BUSD and MakerDAO's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/makerdao-to-dissolve-foundation-and-become-truly-decentralized-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DAI}}}\uc2  maintain their stability via a dynamic system of Collateralized Debt Positions (CDPs), autonomous feedback mechanisms, and a variety of user incentive structures, was up $0.00244 from its dollar peg.\par \par \uc2 Tether's wider demand across the cryptocurrency spectrum also pushed its average deviation up by $0.00244.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-promises-an-audit-in-months-as-paxos-claims-usdt-is-not-a-real-stablecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tether promises an audit in \u8216\'20\'18months\u8217\'20\'19 as Paxos claims USDT is not a real stablecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, TrustToken's TUSD, Stable Universal's HUSD, and Terra's UST drifted $0.00249-0.00385 from their dollar valuation. FRAX and FEI posted decoupled from their dollar peg by jumping $0.00404 and $0.00474 above it, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The data snapshot was taken 24 hours after the Sept. 7 crypto market crash.\par \par \uc2 Stablecoin collapse good for Bitcoin?\par \par \uc2 But potential stablecoin risks have also attracted the attention of top U.S. officials, including Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen and Boston's Federal Reserve's President Eric Rosengren.\par \par \uc2 In July, Yellen \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/treasury-secretary-yellen-urges-lawmakers-to-quickly-introduce-stablecoin-guidelines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 underscored}}}\uc2  the need to act quickly to ensure there is an appropriate U.S. regulatory framework in place,\u8221\'20\'1D in a meeting with the heads of the Federal Reserve, the Securities and Exchange Commission, the \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission\uc2 , the \uc2 Office of the Comptroller of the Currency\uc2  and the \uc2 Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-growth-could-affect-credit-markets-rating-agency-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stablecoin growth could affect credit markets, rating agency warns}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Rosengren {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/federal-reserve-official-stablecoin-growth-is-exponential-deserves-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  Tether a potential challenge to financial stability.\par \par \uc2 In July, a paper released by \uc2 Fitch Ratings\uc2  also noted that collateralized stablecoins could trigger short-term credit market contagion. Excerpts:\par \par \uc2 "A sudden mass redemption of [tether] could affect the stability of short-term credit markets [...] particularly if associated with wider redemptions of other stablecoins that hold reserves in similar assets."\par \par \uc2 But what does a stablecoin market collapse could mean for Bitcoin and similar digital assets? Mike McGlone, the senior commodity strategist at Bloomberg Intelligence, said it would benefit Bitcoin, in particular.\par \par \uc2 "If the whole market collapse, there is only one safe store of value left: Bitcoin."\par \par \uc2 For more about the potential risk of stablecoins, check out {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoins-crypto-house-of-cards?utm_source=Telegram&utm_medium=social"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph's latest video report}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYTE3NDQ5YWUtODk0Mi00ZDA1LWI2ZjYtM2QwZjlmYjg4ZGEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh990002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price in line for 'impulsive bounce' as Solana (SOL) leads altcoin surge\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 411 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is approaching fresh \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says a BTC price analyst as altcoins stage a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is again overdue and one analyst is favoring an "impulsive" move towards $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/81326db7-62fa-44d1-9410-7d40d3aabe0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Trader: "Chill and wait" for Bitcoin breakout\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD continuing to circle $46,000 on Sep. 9 as an eerie calm lingered over the market.\par \par \uc2 Tuesday saw mass upheaval as a cascade of unwound positions sparked a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-plunges-below-43k-in-minutes-in-crypto-market-rout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 huge $9,000 daily loss}}}\uc2  for Bitcoin, something analysts have since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/who-was-selling-not-hodlers-new-data-hints-at-bitcoin-crash-culprit-amid-leverage-wipe-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pinned}}}\uc2  on overleveraged traders.\par \par \uc2 While the event's lows of $42,800 have not been retested, a breakdown is not off the cards, popular trader Crypto Ed says.\par \par \uc2 "Looks like a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pennant to me...Impulsive bounce followed by consolidation," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  alongside an updated chart Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 "Chill and wait for the break out. Wrong when it breaks down."{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1435850585652310016/photo/1}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/d3d9de57-7a2a-4fb6-af23-c6f11e512559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD scenario. Source: Crypto Ed/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 With expectations thus skewed to the upside, fellow trader and analyst Rekt Capital eyed an ongoing retest of Bitcoin's 50-day exponential moving average (EMA) as a potential game-changer.\par \par \uc2 "This is the first time that BTC is retesting the blue 50-day EMA as support, after having reclaimed it as support in late July," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1435714522476687363"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The 50-day EMA is useful for understanding \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum as it tends to support established uptrends.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ab8733f3-ceb9-47dd-8c22-9f152642f483.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with 50-day EMA. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Altcoins recover as Solana passes $200\par \par \uc2 Improved performance across major altcoins meanwhile is giving hope to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  short-term case for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-8-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-dot-uni-bch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/8: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH}}}\par \par \uc2 While BTC/USD has stayed broadly flat overnight, all of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap have posted solid gains of at least 4%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), added 4.5% to circle $3,470 at the time of writing, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovered above $2.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sol-price-nears-200-after-ftx-s-solana-enabled-nft-marketplace-goes-live"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Still outshining}}}\uc2  the pack, however, is Solana (SOL), now trading above $200 on 32% gains in just 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0b43fbd0-b302-47ab-811b-5780a3e7ea6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD 1-hour candle chart (FTX). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMGM2NmI5ZWUtMDg3NS00ZWNhLWE5NjQtNjNlZDVkNTNjMDVlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh990002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/8: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,903 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and most altcoins are attempting to capitalize on today\u8217\'20\'19s market-wide oversold bounce but the recovery could be thwarted by sell pressure at overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are attributing Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) plunge on Sept. 7 to the liquidation of over-leveraged positions. According to Bybt data, about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-sharp-fall-from-50k-linked-to-stronger-us-dollar-gold-correlation-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $3.68 billion worth of long positions were liquidated}}}\uc2  in the last 24 hours in the Bitcoin options market.\par \par \uc2 On-chain monitoring resource Whalemap said the decline was largely due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/who-was-selling-not-hodlers-new-data-hints-at-bitcoin-crash-culprit-amid-leverage-wipe-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling by whales}}}\uc2  who had bought their Bitcoin recently and not by the HODLers. Separately, analyst Willy Woo also said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLeverage markets sold off but investor buying just got stronger.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Every bull market has its share of corrections where weaker hands are shaken out and the stronger hands solidify their position. Therefore, if investors believe in the long-term story, they should not be perturbed by the pullbacks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ccb6f9bd-98c0-4d79-aab3-1196a8be02fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A new report by Standard Chartered\u8217\'20\'19s cryptocurrency research team has projected Bitcoin to reach {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-to-hit-100k-in-2021-or-early-2022-standard-chartered"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000 \u8220\'20\'1Cin late 2021 or early 2022\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  and $175,000 in the long-term. The analysts are also positive on Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), valuing it \u8220\'20\'1Cstructurally\u8221\'20\'1D between $26,000 and $35,000.\par \par \uc2 Is the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins over or could there be another leg down? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed huge \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Sept. 7 when it plunged from an intraday high at $52,920 to an intraday low at $42,843.05. Strong buying at lower levels resulted in a sharp recovery by the close, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/fd7a5c1a-06a7-4514-93dc-91d841d6ed90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls held off another attempt by the bears to extend the correction by pulling the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($44,391). This suggests that traders are aggressively defending the zone between the 50-day SMA and the breakout level at $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 If the zone holds, the bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($48,216). If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could again rise to $52,920 but the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has dropped below 47 and the 20-day EMA has started to turn down, indicating that bears have made a strong comeback. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $42,451.67. If that happens, the pair could enter a deeper corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s failure to rise and sustain above $4,000 could have attracted aggressive profit-booking from the short-term traders. The selling intensified after the price slipped below the immediate support at $3,705.05.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/2a86acb8-62a9-4156-a182-420e7107655d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not arrest the decline at the 20-day EMA ($3,486), resulting in a drop to the critical support at $3,000. This level attracted strong buying and the ETH/USDT pair staged a strong recovery, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 Although bulls pushed the pair above the 20-day EMA on Sept. 8, they have not been able to sustain the price above it. This shows that bears are selling on rallies. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the next few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Vertical rallies are usually followed by waterfall declines as traders rush to the exit and that is what happened in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on Sept. 7. The failure to sustain the price above the psychological level at $3 may have resulted in aggressive profit-booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/b81ea1ae-9839-4096-8f10-f5d22c25c18a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As the decline broke below the 20-day EMA ($2.62), it may have triggered several stops. Due to that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could have plummeted to the 50-day SMA ($2.03). The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the bears are likely to make one more attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If they pull it off, it will signal a change in trend where rallies are likely to be sold into.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers successfully defend the 50-day SMA, the pair could enter a consolidation for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $518.90 on Sept.7 and broke below the moving averages. Although bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($399) on a closing basis, the failure to push and sustain the price above $433 may attract further selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/38d93e57-50f7-4cf5-acb7-4115fe818908.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($458) has started to turn down and the RSI slipped into the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. They are likely to sell on relief rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the next support at $340. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound between $340 and $433 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rallied and closed above the overhead resistance at $1.35 on Sept. 6 but the breakout proved to be a bull trap. The bears sold aggressively and pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.98).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/d38dc9ad-3ad5-4cf8-b55a-27615f47e0dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Sept. 7 and today\u8217\'20\'19s candlesticks show that bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA. If the price sustains above $1.05, the buyers will try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($1.18).\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could consolidate between $1.05 and $1.35 for a few days. On the contrary, if bears sustain the price below $1.05, the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA increases.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) soared to a new all-time high at $198 on Sept. 8 but higher levels attracted profit-booking. The bears pulled the price down but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $130.84.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/27df1116-f907-450f-8967-afb770d0bdf2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After the strong recovery on Sept. 7, the SOL/USDT pair is witnessing renewed selling today. If bears sustain the price below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $146.10, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($117).\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off this level, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $146.10, the bulls will again try to push the pair toward $195.48. A breakout and close above this level may start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) failed to pick up momentum after breaking out of the falling wedge pattern. The price slipped below both moving averages on Sept. 7, indicating strong selling by traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4cb4d47b-4fb8-4d04-b1dc-f56b0067b644.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair dropped to the $0.21 support where buyers stepped in. This started a recovery, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The RSI has dropped into the negative territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn down, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.28), the pair could witness another round of selling. A break below $0.21 could challenge the critical support at $0.15. The bulls will have to push the price above $0.32 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) broke below the rising wedge pattern on Sept. 7. Aggressive selling pulled the price below the breakout level at $28.60, resulting in a fall to the 50-day SMA ($22.77).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0c4a73aa-d158-464c-b74f-17fb5625aa08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair rebounded sharply off the 50-day SMA as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance at $28.60. If the price sustains above this level, the buyers will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are closing their positions on rallies. The bears will then again try to pull the price below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the break above $28.60 was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/09/08/sell-or-hodl-how-to-prepare-for-the-end-of-the-bull-run-part-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sell or hodl? How to prepare for the end of the bull run, Part 2}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s (UNI) range-bound action between $25 and $31.41 resolved to the downside on Sept. 7. The bulls tried to stage a recovery and push the price back above $25 on Sept. 8 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4f9d31a6-3409-4e7f-beb3-5dec5b284226.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($27) has turned down and the RSI has dropped below 38, indicating that bears have the upper hand. They are attempting to sink the price below the intraday low at $21 made on Sept. 7.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to the pattern target at $18.69. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair may trade between $18.69 and $23.45 for a few days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $25 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance zone at $806.90 to $864.30 on Sept. 7. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the overhead zone. The altcoin could now remain stuck inside the large range between $383.50 and $864.30 for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/2c336e18-ffb2-4c48-9a30-b1bef277a741.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($673) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off $596, the bulls will again try to propel the price above the overhead zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the zone, the BCH/USDT pair could consolidate between $596 and $684.30 for a few days. A breakout and close above the overhead zone will indicate the possible start of a new uptrend while a break below $596 could open the doors for a further decline to $500.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvY2ZhMmJhN2EtNzc4Zi00ZTkwLTg4NWMtNThmYzczNjJjNzM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210909eh98000bg\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/8: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,899 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and most altcoins are attempting to capitalize on today\u8217\'20\'19s market-wide oversold bounce but the recovery could be thwarted by sell pressure at overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are attributing Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) plunge on Sep. 7 to the liquidation of over-leveraged positions. According to Bybt data, about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-sharp-fall-from-50k-linked-to-stronger-us-dollar-gold-correlation-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $3.68 billion worth of long positions were liquidated}}}\uc2  in the last 24 hours in the Bitcoin options market.\par \par \uc2 On-chain monitoring resource Whalemap said the decline was largely caused due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/who-was-selling-not-hodlers-new-data-hints-at-bitcoin-crash-culprit-amid-leverage-wipe-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling by whales who had recently bought}}}\uc2  their Bitcoin and not by the HODLers. Separately, analyst Willy Woo also said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLeverage markets sold off but investor buying just got stronger.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Every bull market has its share of corrections where weaker hands are shaken out and the stronger hands solidify their position. Therefore, if investors believe in the long-term story, they should not be perturbed by the pullbacks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ccb6f9bd-98c0-4d79-aab3-1196a8be02fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A new report by Standard Chartered\u8217\'20\'19s cryptocurrency research team has projected Bitcoin to reach {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-to-hit-100k-in-2021-or-early-2022-standard-chartered"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000 \u8220\'20\'1Cin late 2021 or early 2022\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  and $175,000 in the long-term. The analysts are also positive on Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), valuing it \u8220\'20\'1Cstructurally\u8221\'20\'1D between $26,000 and $35,000.\par \par \uc2 Is the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins over or could there be another leg down? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed huge \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Sep. 7 when it plunged from an intraday high at $52,920 to an intraday low at $42,843.05. Strong buying at lower levels resulted in a sharp recovery by the close, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/fd7a5c1a-06a7-4514-93dc-91d841d6ed90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls held off another attempt by the bears to extend the correction by pulling the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($44,391). This suggests that traders are aggressively defending the zone between the 50-day SMA and the breakout level at $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 If the zone holds, the bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,216). If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could again rise to $52,920 but the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has dropped below 47 and the 20-day EMA has started to turn down, indicating that bears have made a strong comeback. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $42,451.67. If that happens, the pair could enter a deeper corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s failure to rise and sustain above $4,000 could have attracted aggressive profit-booking from the short-term traders. The selling intensified after the price slipped below the immediate support at $3,705.05.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/2a86acb8-62a9-4156-a182-420e7107655d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not arrest the decline at the 20-day EMA ($3,486), resulting in a drop to the critical support at $3,000. This level attracted strong buying and the ETH/USDT pair staged a strong recovery, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 Although bulls pushed the pair above the 20-day EMA today, they have not been able to sustain the price above it. This shows that bears are selling on rallies. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint, suggest a range-bound action in the next few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Vertical rallies are usually followed by waterfall declines as traders rush to the exit and that is what happened in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on Sep. 7. The failure to sustain the price above the psychological level at $3 may have resulted in aggressive profit-booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/b81ea1ae-9839-4096-8f10-f5d22c25c18a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As the decline broke below the 20-day EMA ($2.62), it may have triggered several stops. Due to that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could have plummeted to the 50-day SMA ($2.03). The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the bears are likely to make one more attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If they pull it off, it will signal a change in trend where rallies are likely to be sold into.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers successfully defend the 50-day SMA, the pair could enter a consolidation for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $518.90 on Sep.7 and broke below the moving averages. Although bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($399) on a closing basis, the failure to push and sustain the price above $433 may attract further selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/38d93e57-50f7-4cf5-acb7-4115fe818908.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($458) has started to turn down and the RSI slipped into the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. They are likely to sell on relief rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the next support at $340. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound between $340 and $433 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rallied and closed above the overhead resistance at $1.35 on Sep. 6 but the breakout proved to be a bull trap. The bears sold aggressively and pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.98).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/d38dc9ad-3ad5-4cf8-b55a-27615f47e0dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Sep. 7 and today\u8217\'20\'19s candlesticks show that bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA. If the price sustains above $1.05, the buyers will try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($1.18).\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could consolidate between $1.05 and $1.35 for a few days. On the contrary, if bears sustain the price below $1.05, the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA increases.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) soared to a new all-time high at $198 on Sep. 8 but higher levels attracted profit-booking. The bears pulled the price down but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $130.84.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/27df1116-f907-450f-8967-afb770d0bdf2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After the strong recovery on Sep. 7, the SOL/USDT pair is witnessing renewed selling today. If bears sustain the price below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $146.10, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($117).\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off this level, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $146.10, the bulls will again try to push the pair toward $195.48. A breakout and close above this level may start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) failed to pick up momentum after breaking out of the falling wedge pattern. The price slipped below both moving averages on Sep. 7, indicating strong selling by traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4cb4d47b-4fb8-4d04-b1dc-f56b0067b644.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair dropped to the $0.21 support where buyers stepped in. This started a recovery, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The RSI has dropped into the negative territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn down, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.28), the pair could witness another round of selling. A break below $0.21 could challenge the critical support at $0.15. The bulls will have to push the price above $0.32 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the rising wedge pattern on Sep. 7. Aggressive selling pulled the price below the breakout level at $28.60, resulting in a fall to the 50-day SMA ($22.77).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0c4a73aa-d158-464c-b74f-17fb5625aa08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair rebounded sharply off the 50-day SMA as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance at $28.60. If the price sustains above this level, the buyers will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are closing their positions on rallies. The bears will then again try to pull the price below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the break above $28.60 was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/09/08/sell-or-hodl-how-to-prepare-for-the-end-of-the-bull-run-part-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sell or hodl? How to prepare for the end of the bull run, Part 2}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) range-bound action between $25 and $31.41 resolved to the downside on Sep. 7. The bulls tried to stage a recovery and push the price back above $25 today but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4f9d31a6-3409-4e7f-beb3-5dec5b284226.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($27) has turned down and the RSI has dropped below 38, indicating that bears have the upper hand. They are attempting to sink the price below the intraday low at $21 made on Sep. 7.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to the pattern target at $18.69. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair may trade between $18.69 and $23.45 for a few days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $25 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance zone at $806.90 to $864.30 on Sep. 7. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the overhead zone. The altcoin could now remain stuck inside the large range between $383.50 and $864.30 for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/2c336e18-ffb2-4c48-9a30-b1bef277a741.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($673) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off $596, the bulls will again try to propel the price above the overhead zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the zone, the BCH/USDT pair could consolidate between $596 and $684.30 for a few days. A breakout and close above the overhead zone will indicate the possible start of a new uptrend while a break below $596 could open the doors for a further decline to $500.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvY2ZhMmJhN2EtNzc4Zi00ZTkwLTg4NWMtNThmYzczNjJjNzM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210908eh98000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin needs to hold $50K to avoid a $44K  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  BTC price target\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 462 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin makes sense of $50,000 support with BTC price targets calling for an impulse move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could jump to $58,000 or dive to $44,000 from its current levels, an analyst warns as $50,000 sees a \u8220\'20\'1Cvery healthy retest.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/5b111c84-7fb2-4319-9b39-ee4364637574.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Hedging bets against a \u8220\'20\'1Cswift downwards move\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD fluctuating around the $51,000 mark on Tuesday after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-suddenly-retests-50k-in-possible-shakeout-as-analysts-stay-bullish-on-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 losing $2,000 in two hours}}}\uc2  earlier in the day.\par \par \uc2 Overnight, the pair hit fresh highs of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-further-crushes-resistance-nears-53k-on-el-salvador-bitcoin-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearly $53,000}}}\uc2 , coinciding with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum on the back of El Salvador becoming the first sovereign state to officially adopt Bitcoin as a currency.\par \par \uc2 Now, $50,000 is once again a deal-breaker for bulls and bears alike, says Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe.\par \par \uc2 Specifically, Bitcoin needs to hold the area between $49,500 and $50,000 in order to preserve its trajectory.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf that is holding, we\u8217\'20\'19re going to look at $58,000 next,\u8221\'20\'1D he said in his latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7jtneD_ZOmY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 YouTube update}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf it doesn\u8217\'20\'19t hold, I\u8217\'20\'19m going to look at $44,000 next, as there might be a swift downwards move.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe added that there was no reason for concern at levels above $50,000, regardless of Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which he argued constitutes a \u8220\'20\'1Cvery healthy\u8221\'20\'1D move after the breakout.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRetest is now in progress,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow trader and analyst Rekt Captial {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1435182744305274883"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 echoed}}}\uc2 , highlighting a \u8220\'20\'1Ckey\u8221\'20\'1D area to hold at around $50,300. Pentoshi also called for a $50,000 retention.\par \par \uc2 GM/Grand rising.\par \par \uc2 Today we want to hold 50.5k on a closing basis and flip this resistance to support {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi Wont DM You (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1435224814697029636?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 7, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether lines up BTC support test\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, altcoins continue to lick their wounds after outdoing Bitcoin at losing recently-gained levels.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-6-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-dot-uni-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 Out of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, Solana (SOL) remained the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sol-price-nears-200-after-ftx-s-solana-enabled-nft-marketplace-goes-live"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sole green performer}}}\uc2  on the day, in sharp contrast to other tokens.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) could be in line for a retest of $3,400 if $3,700 is lost, van de Poppe said about the largest altcoin. Against BTC, it could likewise retest the recently reclaimed 0.071 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/5ccfbcce-6d85-4c57-b225-091dc9639f9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) saw a modest recovery after falling to $2.58, still down 6.7% on the day at the time of writing and 15% versus its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ada-price-hits-3-for-the-first-time-as-cardano-ethereum-lead-crypto-super-bull-cycle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent all-time highs}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMzdhYzdiMjYtZDMzNC00YmUwLTg4NzMtYTI1NjNhZDU3MzMxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210907eh970008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin suddenly retests $50K in possible \u8216\'20\'18shakeout\u8217\'20\'19 as analysts stay  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  on BTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 379 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin retests $50,000 as analysts call for calm after BTC price action pauses its upside.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) kept traders on their toes on Tuesday as a sudden price dip sparked a retest of $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/005e1895-2d9b-4fa8-abc0-df0987e44e9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC still \u8220\'20\'1Cfine\u8221\'20\'1D at $49,000\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  followed BTC/USD as it shed $2,000 in two hours Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The pair had hit $52,960 \u8212\'20\'14 nearly a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-further-crushes-resistance-nears-53k-on-el-salvador-bitcoin-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 four-month high}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 before consolidating and then heading lower.\par \par \uc2 The volatile conditions mark a memorable day for Bitcoin adoption, coming as El Salvador becomes the first country in history to adopt a partial \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin standard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 For traders, the BTC price reversal, which at the time of writing had cooled at $50,500, was likely merely a technical event.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShaking out some late longs I\u8217\'20\'19d expect,\u8221\'20\'1D popular social media trader Crypto Chase {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1435172866048335878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CStill confident we see 54.7K~ hit as long as 50K can hold as support (fairly obvious 12HR level to work with here).\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1435172866048335878/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1435172866048335878/photo/1}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-becomes-legal-tender-in-el-salvador-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , funding rates this week signaled \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias, with expectations of profitable shorts providing a potential opportunity for a squeeze upward.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe agreed, highlighting even $49,000 as a reasonable target, which would still give no cause for concern.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTest happening!\u8221\'20\'1D he subsequently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1435177230796263427"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Major altcoins erase days of gains\par \par \uc2 Altcoins felt the pain of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s retest more acutely.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-3-altcoins-mooned-as-bitcoin-price-rallied-to-52-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 These 3 altcoins mooned as Bitcoin price rallied to $52,000}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, was down 5.9% on the day at $3,715, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) shed 11.2%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2  / {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/sol?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #sol}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Solana?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Solana}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana continues its phenomenal run into Price Discovery, consistently reaching new All Time Highs\par \par \uc2 SOL has rallied over +240% since breaking the downtrend {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Crypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Crypto}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HLIkV3Nh79"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/HLIkV3Nh79}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Bm4hxlANJv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Bm4hxlANJv}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rekt Capital (@rektcapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1435137484632076289?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 7, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) was the day\u8217\'20\'19s only winner {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-extends-rally-with-another-new-high-why-is-sol-price-up-by-70-in-one-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 yet again}}}\uc2  out of the top 10 cryptocurrencies, impressively gaining nearly 25% in 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYmZiMmQ3N2UtMWZkMi00MmU5LWJmOTctZjhhOWZlMjA2NDRlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210907eh970005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,891 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If bulls flip $52,000 to support, Bitcoin could see a substantial breakout that is likely to pull more buyers into select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) market capitalization is nearing the $1 trillion mark and several altcoins have also been rallying hard in the past few days. This has driven the Crypto Fear and Greed Index into the extreme greed territory where the range fluctuates between 79 and 100. Generally, tops are made when the index hits around 95, which shows there is some more room to run.\par \par \uc2 PlanB, the creator of the Bitcoin stock-to-flow model, believes that BTC is on target to reach $100,000 by Christmas this year. Eventually, he believes that BTC price will be much higher than $100,000 before the end of the current halving cycle in 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f75c9c58-1ed2-4102-9ca5-128acbf2ab01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Tuesday marks an important milestone for Bitcoin because El Salvador has become the first sovereign country in the world to launch BTC as legal tender. Although the experiment will have its hiccups, it is likely to be closely monitored by other nations.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins pick up momentum and resume their up-move or will bears again pull the price below key support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action between $46,200 to $50,500 resolved to the upside on Sep. 5. The bulls pushed and closed the price above the $50,500 to $51,000 overhead resistance zone, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9b490c23-4fb1-4d1d-8a66-36b6096c682b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the $50,500 level and trap the aggressive bulls. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,476).\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because the price has repeatedly bounced off it in the past few days. If the price again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive. The bulls will then again attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The first target level on the upside is $55,000 and then $60,000. This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could attract profit-booking from short-term traders, pulling the price down to the 50-day simple moving average ($43,719).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above $4,000 on Sep. 3 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that bears are defending this level aggressively. However, a positive sign is that buyers have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/1e7de7e5-8c04-4669-8fa4-c8f3ab14df89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bulls are in no hurry to book profits because they anticipate the up-move to continue. Although the upsloping moving averages signal advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $3,700, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($3,493). A strong rebound off this support will indicate that bulls continue to accumulate on dips. The buyers will then try to push the price toward the all-time high at $4,372.72. Alternatively, a break below $3,377.89 may indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears have thwarted several attempts by the bulls to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the $2.97 to $3.10 overhead resistance zone. The negative divergence on the RSI also indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is slowing down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/742dec14-cacc-46c0-a2fd-dd74dcac6854.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($2.65), which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above the overhead zone. If they succeed, the pair could start its journey toward $3.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to $2.47. A bounce off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $2.47 and $3.10 for a few days. A break below $2.47 will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to drive Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $518.90 but a positive sign is that they have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($467). This suggests accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/86e8edc3-2dfd-463f-b94c-0d39966bce1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price again bounces off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will try to thrust the BNB/USDT pair above $518.90. If they manage to do that, the pair could resume its uptrend and rally to the next target at $600.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA could sink the price to $433. If bulls defend this level, the pair could remain range-bound between $433 and $518.90 for a few more days. A break and close below $433 may signal that bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  back into the triangle on Sep. 4 but the bulls bought the dips. The buyers have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $1.35 today, signaling the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/3893ee70-62fa-40f3-9aa5-e6d0a5b35417.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $1.35, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.66. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls fail to sustain the price above $1.35, the bears may pull the price back to the 20-day EMA ($1.19). That will increase the possibility of the pair consolidating between $1.05 and $1.35 for a few more days. A break and close below $1.05 will suggest that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is in a strong uptrend. Although bears tried to stall the uptrend at the psychological level at $150 on Sep. 4, they could not pull the price below $135.73. The shallow correction shows that traders were in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/7eaa9c52-07ef-429b-a9bb-ee57b55e239d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying by the bulls has pushed the price above $150.60 today, signaling the resumption of the up-move. The SOL/USDT pair could now rally toward the next target objective at $179.45.\par \par \uc2 Although the pair is in a strong momentum, vertical rallies are rarely sustainable. They are usually followed by a sharp pullback as traders rush to the exit when the rally stalls. The bears will have to pull the price below $134.74 to signal the possible start of a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($105).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the falling wedge for the past three days, the bulls are struggling to push the price toward the target objective at $0.35. This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/1b8133ad-7f1e-490c-9544-db1f9869f985.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.29). If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will again try to push the price above $0.35. If that happens, the pair may rally to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.25). The marginally rising 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the 50-day SMA cracks. That could open the doors for a decline to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving up since breaking out of $28.60 but the slow pace of rise suggests a lack of conviction among bulls. The RSI has also formed a negative divergence indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/b74d1f3a-3c8e-434b-bce4-35915f4a1baa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could drop to the breakout level at $28.60. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest accumulation by the bulls at lower levels. The buyers will then try to resume the uptrend toward the first target objective at $41.40.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off $28.60 but stays below $35. That may lead to a few days of range-bound action between these two levels. A break and close below $28.60 will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap. That may pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($22).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/link-price-locks-in-36-gains-following-ethereum-layer-2-chainlink-integration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK price locks in 36% gains following Ethereum layer 2's Chainlink integration}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $31.41 on Sep. 3 but the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to break below the 20-day EMA ($28).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0ee045d4-34c3-4e8d-a155-10f11bcce969.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls. However, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be slowing. The Doji candlestick pattern today indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $25. If this support holds, the pair may extend its stay between $25 and $31.41 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $31.41, the pair may rally to $37.52 and then to $42.25.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level at $30 on Sep. 4 but the bulls had other plans. They aggressively bought the dip and have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $35.33 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0a6ec8df-a80b-4580-800f-8779a1070d45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $35.33, the LINK/USDT pair could resume its uptrend and rally to $36 and then to $43.50. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to sustain above $35.33, the bears may pull the price to $30. If this level holds, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. A break and close below the 20-day EMA ($28) will signal that bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYzFlYjJhZTYtM2UxOS00YTlkLWFjZTctZWQ0Zjc2ZDBkODJmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210906eh96000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/3: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, UNI, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,010 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This week\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally in Bitcoin and Ether signals that bulls are back in control and altcoins are likely to follow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) finally broke above the $50,500 resistance and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the $4,000 mark. This suggests that there is growing interest in cryptocurrencies and several legacy finance companies are initiating steps to tap into this increasing demand.\par \par \uc2 One of the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest independent asset managers, Franklin Templeton, has posted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/franklin-templeton-seeks-experts-for-bitcoin-trading-and-crypto-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh job applications for medium to senior-level positions}}}\uc2  in crypto trading and research, according to Linkedin job postings.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in Japan, financial conglomerate \uc2 SBI Holdings\uc2  is planning to set up one of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sbi-reportedly-looks-to-launch-crypto-fund-in-japan-by-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first crypto funds in the country}}}\uc2  by the end of November. Tomoya Asakura, the director and senior managing executive officer at SBI, said that the launch of a second fund will be explored depending on the success of the first one.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/afc4d40a-795b-43e1-9e04-5de83a213ee4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While crypto traders are cheering the recent run-up in several altcoins, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-sounds-alarm-over-frothy-crypto-markets-after-august-boom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 JPMorgan analysts have warned their clients}}}\uc2  that the altcoin rally and nonfungible tokens (NFT) are getting frothy.\par \par \uc2 The analysts said that the altcoins share of the crypto market trading surged from 22% at the beginning of August, to 33%, which is high compared to historical standards. They believe the reason is \u8220\'20\'1Cfroth and retail investor 'mania' rather than a reflection of a structural uptrend.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin sustain above $50,500 and resume its uptrend or will altcoins remain in focus? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears successfully defended the $50,500 resistance on Sep. 2 but they could not pull and sustain the price back below the downtrend line. This could have attracted buying from the bulls who have pushed Bitcoin above $50,500 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/8b4ef7ca-d5cc-4be1-9e6d-81181d77fecd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $50,500, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $60,000. This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if bulls can thrust the price above it, the pair could challenge the all-time high at $64,854.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the relative strength index (RSI) above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the negative divergence. That along with the upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($47,584) indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 200-day simple moving average ($46,083). That could pull the price down to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether picked up momentum after breaking above $3,377.89 and hit the $4,000 mark today. If bulls sustain the price above this psychological level, the biggest altcoin could challenge the all-time high at $4,372.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/3ff660b2-7a2b-454d-b9b8-ba10bba642e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($3,344) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control. If buyers push the price above $4,372.72, the ETH/USDT pair could start its journey toward the critical level at $5,000.\par \par \uc2 This may not be easy as bears are likely to have other plans. They are likely to mount a stiff resistance in the $4,000 to $4,372.72 zone. If the price turns down from this zone and breaks below $3,700, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The buyers will then try to resume the up-move. Conversely, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the $3 mark on Sep. 2 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. Although the price dipped back below $2.97 today, the bulls bought the dip and are again trying to drive the price above $3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/d75a05a1-3ba7-4e1b-9720-ff2092440c25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $3.10 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $3.50. The 20-day EMA ($2.58) favors the bulls but the negative divergence on the RSI indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to drive the price above the overhead resistance, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level for the bulls to defend. A strong rebound off it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA may pull the price to the breakout level at $2.47. A break below this support could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($456) and the overhead resistance at $518.90. The long wick on the Sep. 2 candlestick suggests that bears are selling above $500 but the positive sign is that bulls are not giving up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/e5dd91f1-a6b2-4007-b5c4-0609c9c2b155.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will again try to push and sustain the price above $518.90. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $600. This psychological level may act as a resistance but if bulls clear this hurdle, the rally may extend to $680.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and dips below the 20-day EMA, the pair may slide to $433. A break below this level will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may then decline to the 200-day SMA ($375).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the downtrend line on Sep. 2, invalidating the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The bears tried to pull and sustain the price below the downtrend line today but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0086309f-85ba-4e1a-8b5f-fec2f82e3834.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the downtrend line, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.35. This level may act as a resistance and if the price turns down from it, the pair may trade between $1.05 and $1.35 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.15) has turned up and the RSI has risen above 64, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. A breakout and close above $1.35 could clear the path for a rally to $1.66. The bears will have to pull the price below $1.05 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to stall Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) uptrend at $130 but the bulls were in no mood to relent. The buyers did not allow the price to break below the psychological support at $100.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/25b3425f-3de7-4a9f-9a2b-a8dec636e9bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying resumed on Sep. 2 and the bulls have extended the SOL/USDT pair to a new all-time high today. Vertical rallies are rarely sustainable and they usually result in sharp declines. The RSI above 88 also indicates the pair is overextended in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or $150, the first support is at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $115.75.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level will suggest strength and increase the possibility of a break above $150. The next target on the upside is $166.97. On the contrary, a break below $115.75 could pull the price down to the 50% retracement level at $106.29.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($0.28) on Sept. 1 and bulls pushed the price above the downtrend line of the falling wedge pattern on Sept. 2. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that bears were selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/23766f41-5896-4460-b5c0-b4e1ba4163a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has bounced off the 20-day EMA and the bulls have pushed the price above the wedge. If buyers sustain the price above $0.31, the pair could rally to $0.35. This level is likely to act as a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.35, the pair may again drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off it will suggest that the sentiment is positive. A breakout and close above $0.35 could clear the path for an up-move to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the breakout level at $28.60 for the past three days, indicating the start of a new uptrend. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0ac0d265-dedf-4fe0-82d3-6707f923830b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $33.84, the DOT/USDT pair could start its northward journey toward $41.40 and then to the pattern target at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level, the price may retest the breakout level at $28.60. If bulls flip this level into support, it may act as a launchpad for the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA ($27.12) will be the first sign that the current breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/09/03/how-to-prepare-for-end-of-bull-run-part-1-timing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to prepare for the end of the bull run, Part 1: Timing}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) up-move turned down from $31.41 on Sept. 2, suggesting that the bears have not thrown in the towel yet. The price action of the past few days has formed a negative divergence on the RSI, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9b666fe2-d711-42af-81cb-7ed51babdbae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($27.91), the bulls will make one more attempt to push the UNI/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $31.41. If they succeed, the pair may start its journey to $37.52 and then to $42.25.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair may drop to $25 and remain range-bound for a few more days. A break and close below the $25 to $23.45 support zone will signal that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) had been range-bound between $24 and $30 for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance on Sept. 2 but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/1bb0a374-2443-4cc7-83c7-ddd7a0cf3595.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls again bought the dip today and have propelled the price above the overhead resistance. If buyers sustain the price above $30, the LINK/USDT pair could rally to $36 and if that level is crossed, the up-move may reach $43.50, which is the May 19 intraday high.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($26.99) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that buyers have the upper hand. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below $30, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvMTA5ZGFhN2MtN2QzOS00MzdiLWI3ZWMtYjc1NmZmYTg2YmU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210903eh93000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin bull run sparks $180K BTC price prediction ahead of institutional \u8216\'20\'18fireworks\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 421 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is battling to take control of $50,000 as a BTC price support level.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) made traders play a guessing game on Thursday as $50,000 looked increasingly shaky as new support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/c2ae6cbf-e680-4fa8-8fd3-62f653f73e49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Crypto seeing \u8220\'20\'1Cspectacular\u8221\'20\'1D September\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracked BTC/USD as it crisscrossed the $50,000 barrier after returning to it for the first time in almost two weeks.\par \par \uc2 The largest cryptocurrency saw 4.5% gains on the day, these nonetheless beaten by three of the top 10 altcoins, which all managed over 7%.\par \par \uc2 Against a largely positive background, traders were understandably \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prospects.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBreak above 50k = 58-60k to follow. Sitting above 200D MA which is now acting as support,\u8221\'20\'1D Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1433214500170313730"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  to \uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat is your price discovery plan? Above those Highs 3x seems reasonable which is around 180k. You don\u8217\'20\'19t go make new ath\u8217\'20\'19s for 10% gains. Verge of breaking out into that last range.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ad45eea8-2257-4838-b905-89337a7c3e59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD scenario. Source: Pentoshi/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 A $180,000 BTC price is a curious prospect for many and beats even the more optimistic {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $135,000 minimum target}}}\uc2  set by stock-to-flow creator PlanB for the end of 2021.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSeptember has been a spectacular month for Crypto thus far,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow trader Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1433327695690096644"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-returns-to-50k-as-bitcoin-bears-lose-450m-in-daily-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the first two days of the month have contrasted sharply with historical norms for September, which has always been a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-a-bitcoin-bull-run-not-in-september-btc-price-data-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lackluster month}}}\uc2  for cryptocurrency markets.\par \par \uc2 Looking ahead, institutional reporting may serve to make the coming weeks even more intriguing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA lot of large and important institutions bought bitcoin over the summer,\u8221\'20\'1D Mike Alfred, founding CEO at BrightScope & Digital Assets Data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mikealfred/status/1433252301959876610"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey will announce their purchases between September 7 and November 19. Enjoy the fireworks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto pauses gains with Cardano at all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Among altcoins, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) were likewise taking a break from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  surges of their own at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-stock-flips-bullish-with-mstr-a-bitcoin-proxy-for-institutional-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy stock flips \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  with MSTR a Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18proxy\u8217\'20\'19 for institutional investors}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD had hit new all-time highs earlier in the day, while ETH/USD neared $3,800 \u8212\'20\'14 its highest level since May.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph highlighted this week, Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT is being tipped as the next altcoin to see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-polkadot-could-be-the-next-altcoin-to-hit-a-new-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 major gains}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvNmI2M2I2MzItOTlkYi00MGQyLTlkYmYtZTNiNWUxNDAzOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210902eh920008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price returns to $50K as Bitcoin bears lose $450M in daily liquidations\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 406 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin retakes $50,000 while BTC price action costs shorters huge losses.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) swiftly reclaimed $50,000 on Thursday as bears felt maximum pain and lost hundreds of millions of dollars.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/f00c7eb6-5549-44e5-9b89-52d4537b4e02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sparks a fresh bear bloodbath\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD suddenly breaking through the $50,000 mark to hit its highest since Aug. 23.\par \par \uc2 After a night of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  action, the pair left its lower trading range of recent weeks behind, with \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  still significant at the time of writing. Local highs topped $50,300 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-bitcoin-reserves-drop-to-the-lowest-level-since-december-2017"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , $51,000 remains the level to beat in order to cement a continuation of the 2021 Bitcoin bull run.\par \par \uc2 Heavy resistance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1433309744584962048/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remained}}}\uc2  at that level Thursday, with analysts waiting to see if the latest uptick had the momentum required to change the longer-term paradigm.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/ab3af275-1e5e-4e19-8211-b497b9eaba0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell positions (Binance) as of Sept. 2. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin facing final hurdle before $57K,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph contributing analyst Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1433323584676585472"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  in his latest update.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWelcome back to $50,000 BTC,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1433325570985709573"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Short traders lost out heavily from the upside, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bybt.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liquidations}}}\uc2  hitting almost half a billion dollars in the past 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/81cd3349-76c0-4e22-a474-5a061b147fa6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD liquidations chart. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 Not so boring after all\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-a-bitcoin-bull-run-not-in-september-btc-price-data-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 , September tends to be a \u8220\'20\'1Cboring\u8221\'20\'1D month when it comes to Bitcoin returns, with 6% currently the best performance on record.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ada-price-hits-3-for-the-first-time-as-cardano-ethereum-lead-crypto-super-bull-cycle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price hits $3 for the first time as Cardano, Ethereum lead crypto 'super bull cycle'}}}\par \par \uc2 Price forecasts take account of the anomaly, with the popular \u8220\'20\'1Cworst-case scenario\u8221\'20\'1D series from stock-to-flow model creator PlanB {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calling for}}}\uc2  a $43,000 minimum monthly close.\par \par \uc2 Will August indeed close >$47K?\par \par \uc2 Btw these are worst case / floor estimates, so do not worry about Sep >$43K, my base case prediction is based on S2F: $100K. I use the floor stuff for options. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HGXa5MMqH0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HGXa5MMqH0}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 PlanB (@100trillionUSD) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1432609652743749633?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 31, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The statistician\u8217\'20\'19s August monthly close prediction, $47,000, was exactly on point. October, he calculates, should close at a minimum of $68,000 \u8212\'20\'14 a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYzkyMTRhMDAtMjg4ZC00NmI3LTg5ZjUtMjBhMzM1NzZmZWU5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210902eh920005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price hits $3 for the first time as Cardano, Ethereum lead crypto \u8216\'20\'18super bull cycle\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 343 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano and Ethereum lead a strong altcoin market as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and ETH price action head higher and higher.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token surged to new all-time highs on Thursday as an altcoin comeback gripped cryptocurrency markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/a5f14684-d042-468b-bef1-19d7c3e8822d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Cardano joins Ether in serious gains\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD clipping $3.06 during trading Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Having shown strength for multiple weeks, Cardano benefited from a broader altcoin resurgence after attempting to hit the $3 mark throughout the second half of August.\par \par \uc2 The move coincided with the launch of the Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alonzo testnet}}}\uc2  ahead of a mainnet debut later this month.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD remained above $3 while taking a break at $3.066 on Binance.\par \par \uc2 Weekly gains totaled 17.2%, while Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-ethereum-s-rally-signaling-the-next-bull-market-phase-for-bitcoin-above-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outshined within the top 10}}}\uc2  cryptocurrencies by market capitalization with 20.5% weekly returns.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD traded at almost $3,800 Thursday, around $600 short of its historic all-time highs seen in mid-May.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4757e495-ae28-4530-838f-cb073ff4a7fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Stars align for a crypto bull run\par \par \uc2 ETH had begun the upward moves for altcoins, which originally came about as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-bitcoin-reserves-drop-to-the-lowest-level-since-december-2017"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cooled}}}\uc2  around $47,000. As BTC/USD then began to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-target-50k-as-friday-s-655m-btc-options-expiry-approaches"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 follow suit}}}\uc2 , a snowball effect appeared to enter the market, with all but three of the top 50 crypto tokens in the green on the day.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-1-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-sol-dot-uni-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/1: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re entering the second phase of this super bull cycle and I like it. Enjoy it,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph contributing analyst Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1433195461746126850"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/remarkable-on-chain-metrics-could-spell-bitcoin-ethereum-bull-market-return-new-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the foundations appear to be in place for renewed strength in Bitcoin and altcoins, the former\u8217\'20\'19s on-chain metrics and fundamentals firmly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvOGRhMTg4ZTYtNWM1Zi00MWRjLWJmMTEtYzRlYTRkZWI0MDFiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210902eh920005t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price returns to $50K as Bitcoi