\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price hits $3 for the first time as Cardano, Ethereum lead crypto 'super bull cycle'}}}\par \par \uc2 Price forecasts take account of the anomaly, with the popular "worst-case scenario" series from stock-to-flow model creator PlanB {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calling for}}}\uc2  a $43,000 minimum monthly close.\par \par \uc2 Will August indeed close >$47K?\par \par \uc2 Btw these are worst case / floor estimates, so do not worry about Sep >$43K, my base case prediction is based on S2F: $100K. I use the floor stuff for options. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HGXa5MMqH0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HGXa5MMqH0}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 PlanB (@100trillionUSD) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1432609652743749633?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 31, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The statistician's August monthly close prediction, $47,000, was exactly on point. October, he calculates, should close at a minimum of $68,000 \u8212\'20\'14 a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvYzkyMTRhMDAtMjg4ZC00NmI3LTg5ZjUtMjBhMzM1NzZmZWU5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210902eh920002x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price hits $3 for the first time as Cardano, Ethereum lead crypto 'super bull cycle'\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 344 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano and Ethereum lead a strong altcoin market as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and ETH price action head higher and higher.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token surged to new all-time highs on Sep. 2 as an altcoin comeback gripped cryptocurrency markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/a5f14684-d042-468b-bef1-19d7c3e8822d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Cardano joins Ethereum in serious gains\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD clipping $3.06 during trading Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Having shown strength for multiple weeks, Cardano benefited from a broader altcoin resurgence after attempting to hit the $3 mark throughout the second half of August.\par \par \uc2 The move coincided with the launch of the Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alonzo testnet}}}\uc2 , ahead of a mainnet debut later this month.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD remained above $3 while taking a break at $3.066 on Binance.\par \par \uc2 Weekly gains totaled 17.2%, while Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-ethereum-s-rally-signaling-the-next-bull-market-phase-for-bitcoin-above-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outshined within the top-ten}}}\uc2  cryptocurrencies by market cap with 20.5% weekly returns.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD traded at almost $3,800 Thursday, around $600 short of its historic all-time highs seen in mid-May.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/4757e495-ae28-4530-838f-cb073ff4a7fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Stars align for a crypto bull run\par \par \uc2 ETH had begun the upwards moves for altcoins, which originally came about as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-bitcoin-reserves-drop-to-the-lowest-level-since-december-2017"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cooled}}}\uc2  around $47,000. As BTC/USD then began to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-target-50k-as-friday-s-655m-btc-options-expiry-approaches"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 follow suit}}}\uc2 , a snowball effect appeared to enter the market, with all but three of the top-50 crypto tokens in the green on the day.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-1-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-sol-dot-uni-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/1: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe're entering the second phase of this super bull cycle and I like it. Enjoy it,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph contributing analyst Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1433195461746126850"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/remarkable-on-chain-metrics-could-spell-bitcoin-ethereum-bull-market-return-new-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the foundations appear to be in place for renewed strength in Bitcoin and altcoins, the former's on-chain metrics and fundamentals firmly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvOGRhMTg4ZTYtNWM1Zi00MWRjLWJmMTEtYzRlYTRkZWI0MDFiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210902eh9200001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/1: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,852 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to press higher within its range and altcoins broke out after ETH rose above a key resistance level.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to break above $50,000 but analysts remain confident due to strong on-chain metrics. Analyst Willy Woo believes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-bitcoin-reserves-drop-to-the-lowest-level-since-december-2017"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors have been accumulating Bitcoin}}}\uc2  and a break above $50,000 could result in a quick up-move to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Another positive voice was that of SkyBridge Capital CEO Anthony Scaramucci, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/anthony-scaramucci-100k-per-btc-by-year-end-is-still-within-reach"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in an interview with Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  that the limited, fixed supply of Bitcoin and exponentially growing demand will boost prices higher. Scaramucci personally believes that Bitcoin could reach $100,000 before the end of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/a8b01532-7b83-4a63-a42e-071251bd7dbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the focus seems to have shifted to Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) as it rallied to a three-month high against Bitcoin. This strong performance is backed by a drop in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-breaks-3-500-and-hits-3-month-highs-against-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 amount of Ether held in exchange wallets}}}\uc2  from 19.45 million on Aug. 18 to 18.75 million on Sep.1, according to data from CryptoQuant.\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin in consolidation, will altcoins continue their outperformance or will they face profit-booking at higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the 20-day exponential moving average ($47,008) today but bounced off the 200-day simple moving average ($46,064). Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/c6ad5548-da09-40bb-8d29-46c695dc9727.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 200-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could decline to the next support at $43,927.70. If this support also cracks, the next stop could be the breakout level at $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 Such a move will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. That could be followed by a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the downtrend line, the pair could challenge the overhead resistance zone at $50,000 to $50,500. If the price once again turns down from this zone, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $50,500 to signal the resumption of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $60,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether had been trading between the overhead resistance zone at $3,335 to $3,377.89 and the breakout level at $3,000 for the past few days. This consolidation resolved to the upside on Aug. 31 with a break and close above $3,377.89.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/bd2d05c9-9a23-470a-a3ce-6325450f7fe9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued buying today and pushed the price above the psychological mark at $3,500. This signals the resumption of the uptrend, which may reach the next target objective at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($3,212) and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control. If the price turns down from the current level, the bulls will try to defend the zone between $3,377.89 and $3,335.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that supply exceeds demand. A break below the $3,000 support may signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers have been defending the $2.70 support for the past three days but are struggling to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $2.97. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/8728736f-f1f0-4ccc-848c-9e8b26f24369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the psychological level at $3 to signal the resumption of the uptrend. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to its next target at $3.50.\par \par \uc2 While the 20-day EMA ($2.47) is rising, the RSI has formed a negative divergence, warning that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below $2.70, the pair could drop to the breakout level at $2.47. A break and close below this level will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($449) on Aug. 31, suggesting that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $518.90 and resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/6aa393de-de6b-4f5d-8a1e-cf67292efceb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. A breakout and close above $520 could clear the path for an up-move to $600 and then to $680.\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from $518.90, the BNB/USDT pair may drop to the 20-day EMA and remain range-bound between these two levels for the next few days. A break and close below $433 will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair may then drop to the 200-day SMA ($371).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($1.11) on Aug. 31 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are defending the downtrend line. A minor positive is that bulls have not given up much ground today and are again trying to push the price above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/0841f1e4-3e0b-42ef-9a0c-e8f7dea268b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $1.35 and then start its journey toward $1.66. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below $1.05 will complete a descending triangle pattern, indicating the start of a decline to the 200-day SMA ($0.88) and then to the pattern target at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is currently trading inside a falling wedge pattern. The bears are aggressively defending the zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the downtrend line of the wedge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/192498ed-8a0b-468b-a004-c3bab4f723ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. A breakout and close above the falling wedge pattern will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could then rise to $0.35. This level may act as a resistance but if bulls drive the price above it, the rally could reach $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the wedge, the pair could drop to the critical support at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high at $130.11 on Aug. 31 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/b92bb274-36d2-493a-821a-4c783da970e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that lower levels have again attracted buying today. The bulls will now try to push the price above the all-time high at $130.11. If they can sustain the price above this level, the SOL/USDT pair may rally to $150.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price again turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest selling at higher levels. The pair may then start a correction to $100. If this support cracks, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($80).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($25.66) in the past few days, indicating accumulation at lower levels. The buying momentum picked up on Aug. 31 and the bulls thrust Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $28.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9e93bba4-92fb-4a53-af50-eb9974c88031.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This completed a V-bottom pattern, which points to the possibility of a new uptrend. The DOT/USDT pair could now rally to $41.40 and then to the pattern target at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 Generally, when the price breaks out of a setup, it tends to retest the breakout level. In this case, if the price rebounds off the breakout level at $28.60, it will signal strong buying by the bulls. That will increase the prospect of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 200-day SMA ($27.80). Such a move will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoins-rally-to-new-highs-after-the-eth-btc-pair-flips-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins rally to new highs after the ETH/BTC pair flips \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rose above the downtrend line on Aug. 31, invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $31.26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/cc003a85-2452-40c3-b9c2-6e40ed8d67d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the UNI/USDT pair could resume its up-move toward the first target objective at $37.52 and later to $42.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $31.26, the pair may drop to the moving averages, signaling that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $25 will be the first sign of weakness. That will open the doors for a further decline to $23.45 and then to $20.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA is currently correcting in a strong uptrend. The bulls are attempting to defend the support at $30.44. The rising 20-day EMA ($27.83) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/9743031f-7abb-4a56-b7b8-32ff454280c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above $36.89.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the LUNA/USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The first target on the upside is $43 and if that resistance is crossed, the rally may extend to the psychological barrier at $50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sink the price below $30.44, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important support for the bulls because if it cracks, a deeper correction to $26 and then to $22.40 may start.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvNzU0MDJlZTQtMjVhYy00N2E1LTlmZGItNmRiNjMwYmM4YzZiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210901eh91000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Ethereum price breaks $3,500 and hits 3-month highs against Bitcoin\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 822 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 September 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) rose 3.13% to hit 0.07475 for the first time since June 9. Meanwhile, bids for ETH/USD climbed 3.4% to $3,546, the highest since May 18, showcasing a renewed upside sentiment among traders.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s native asset, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), has extended its rally on Wednesday to log multi-month highs against Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 The ETH/BTC exchange rate rose 3.13% to hit 0.07475 for the first time since June 9. Meanwhile, bids for ETH/USD climbed 3.4% to $3,546, the highest since May 18, showcasing a renewed upside sentiment in the second-largest cryptocurrency market after it consolidated sideways for more than three weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/55e3efb6-c987-46a3-9fe5-7982ea49185a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD and ETH/BTC daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price jump appeared despite a wobbling price behavior across the cryptocurrency market. For instance, Bitcoin prices {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-turns-to-test-lower-support-levels-as-50k-stays-out-of-reach"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remained stuck around $47,000}}}\uc2  while eyeing a clear breakout move above their psychological resistance level of $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, one of Ether\u8217\'20\'19s top rivals, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), also consolidated sideways following its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-chart-painting-a-bull-flag-for-3-ada-price-ahead-of-erc-20-converter-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 100%-plus price rally in August}}}\uc2 , while its market dominance fell from 4.54% between Aug. 8 to 4.26% at the time of writing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/275e62d6-8d57-411e-af8f-662bffe4e4c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano prices vs. its market dominance against all the cryptocurrencies. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The same period witnessed Ether\u8217\'20\'19s market dominance rising from 18.17% to 19.65%, hinting that Ether attracted capital out of assets with interim overstretched valuations.\par \par \uc2 Hodling detected\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s run up above $3,500 coincides with a decline in ETH reserves across all exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Blockchain analytics firm CryptoQuant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/overview/btc-exchange-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that the amount of Ether held in exchange wallets has declined from 19.45 million on Aug. 18 to 18.75 million on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 However, analysts perceive falling reserves as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , arguing that traders primarily withdraw their coins from exchanges because they choose to hold them instead of selling them for other assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/cbda3a6f-5dec-4189-99e8-dda43405bb64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether balance across exchanges drop as ETH/USD rise. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Additionally, more upside cues for Ether prices have emerged due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/remarkable-on-chain-metrics-could-spell-bitcoin-ethereum-bull-market-return-new-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply squeeze}}}\uc2  prospects.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant data shows that more than 6% of Ether\u8217\'20\'19s supply now stands locked inside the Ethereum 2.0 smart contract \u8212\'20\'14 i.e., about 7.28 million ETH, worth $25.77 billion at current exchange rates.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-09/67af0aeb-62bd-4627-8afe-82d8075dbd79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total value staked in Ethereum 2.0 smart contract exceeds $25 billion. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Additionally, a new Ethereum network update, dubbed \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/london-s-impact-ethereum-2-0-s-staking-contract-becomes-largest-eth-holder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 London Hard Fork}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D has introduced a protocol that burns a fraction of its gas fees. Since its introduction on Aug. 5, the Ethereum Improvement Proposal 1559 has removed 156,986 ETH \u8212\'20\'14 worth over $555 million \u8212\'20\'14 from the supply, per data provided by WatchTheBurn.com.\par \par \uc2 Demand prospects against supply squeeze\par \par \uc2 Ether has already climbed over 380% in 2021, with its gains boosted by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/surge-in-activity-and-token-prices-show-defi-summer-2-0-already-started"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emerging decentralized finance}}}\uc2  (DeFi) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nft-market-projected-to-double-by-october-as-trading-volume-surges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nonfungible token}}}\uc2  sector. In comparison, Bitcoin has gained 62% year-to-date against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Payal Shah, director of equity and cryptocurrency product development at CME Group, noted that Ether is equivalent to DeFi, a sector that enables users to trade, as well as borrow and lend directly assets to one another without involving central authorities like banks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum hosts more than 200,000 ERC tokens, some of which are part of the top 100 largest cryptocurrencies,\u8221\'20\'1D Shah {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/openmarkets/finance/2021/six-reasons-why-ethereum-has-intrinsic-value.html?source=rss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in a note published mid-August.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTogether, with the accessibility of DeFi and the draw of better interest rates, more and more retail consumers will likely turn to the DeFi space.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Data tracker DappRadar {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/defi/protocol/ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2  that the total value locked inside Ethereum-backed DeFi protocols has crossed $100 billion.\par \par \uc2 Cardano rivalry\par \par \uc2 But Ethereum is racing against a long list of rivals as it grapples with network congestion and higher fees issues. For instance, Cardano employs a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://why.cardano.org/en/introduction/designing-in-layers/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dual-layer design}}}\uc2  to perform computations and settlements separately, thus solving network congestion issues.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Cardano consumes almost no energy due to its proof-of-stake (PoS) system. Ethereum expects to have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/when-will-ethereum-2-0-fully-launch-roadmap-promises-speed-but-history-says-otherwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 switched fully to PoS by 2022\u8211\'20\'132023}}}\uc2 , which gives Cardano and other Ethereum rivals a lot of room to grow.\par \par \uc2 But Ethereum has a first-mover advantage in the blockchain space, compared to Cardano, which has very few decentralized applications to show.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-remain-bullish-on-cardano-and-ether-while-btc-outflows-persist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutions remain \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on Cardano and Ether, while BTC outflows persist}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum is the place to be, already boasting thousands of DApps,\u8221\'20\'1D said investment analysts at the Value Trend, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt s