hereum-2-0-fully-launch-roadmap-promises-speed-but-history-says-otherwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 switch fully to proof-of-stake by 2022-2023}}}\uc2 , which gives Cardano and similar Ethereum rivals a lot of room to grow.\par \par \uc2 But Ethereum has a first-mover advantage in the blockchain space, compared to Cardano, which has very few decentralized applications to show.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-remain-bullish-on-cardano-and-ether-while-btc-outflows-persist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutions remain \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on Cardano and Ether, while BTC outflows persist}}}\par \par \uc2 "Ethereum is the place to be, already boasting thousands of DApps," said investment analysts at the Value Trend, adding that:\par \par \uc2 It simply makes more commercial sense, at the moment, to build an app on Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDkvZDg3MWU5NzAtNzc1Zi00ZjA4LTkyMWEtMWM0NGVkNmUxMzE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210901eh910005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Institutions remain  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  on Cardano and Ether, while BTC outflows persist\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Martin Young \par \uc2 392 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are continuing to dominate institutional inflows to crypto investment products.\par \par \uc2 Institutional inflows to altcoin investment products have continued to increase this past week, but the same cannot be said for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 In its \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  on Monday, institutional asset manager \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  identified overall inflows of $24 million to altcoin-based investment products. The capital flows mark the second consecutive week of inflows to altcoin funds, with investments into altcoin products increasing by 14.3% compared to last week\u8217\'20\'19s $21 million.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was the favored asset among institutional investors, with ETH-based products posting a weekly inflow of $17.2 million. The report noted that products tracking Ether and other altcoins now represent 32% of the sector\u8217\'20\'19s total assets under management (AUM) \u8212\'20\'14 just 3% shy of mid-May\u8217\'20\'19s record of 35%.\par \par \uc2 Cardano-based institutional funds posted record weekly inflows with $10.1 million, representing 32% of the week\u8217\'20\'19s total altcoin inflows. Cardano-based instruments now hold 0.15% of the capital locked in crypto investment products combined.\par \par \uc2 The surge in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) inflows is attributed to anticipation for the network\u8217\'20\'19s Sept. 12 Alonzo upgrade, which will see the project {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-chart-painting-a-bull-flag-for-3-ada-price-ahead-of-erc-20-converter-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch smart contract functionality for the first time}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Polkadot and Solana-based funds also saw inflows with $1.5 million and $2.7 million, respectively. Solana (SOL) has now surpassed Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) for assets under management in related funds with $16 million, ranking ninth in terms of AUM with BCH funds in 10th.\par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum surrounding altcoins, the report noted that Bitcoin products continue to see outflows, with a loss of $3.8 million for the period. As such, Bitcoin products have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-141m-outflow-from-bitcoin-products-signals-institutions-are-bearish-on-btc-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted outflows}}}\uc2  for 14 of the past 16 weeks.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  estimates that institutional asset managers currently represent an AUM of $56.8 billion combined \u8212\'20\'14 attributing the slight week-over-week drop in sector-wide AUM to persistent outflows from Bitcoin-based products.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investment-products-still-suffering-outflows-despite-price-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin investment products still suffering outflows despite price recovery}}}\par \par \uc2 Looking at the performance of fund issuers, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 own Bitcoin fund saw the heaviest losses this past week with an outflow of $14.5 million. ETC Issuance saw the largest inflow at $14.1 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOWE5N2E3NjktOGRlZS00Mzg2LTg0ZjgtMTQ0NmY5YTY5YTZkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210831eh8v0005w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price sinks to $46.7K despite record accumulation and supply shock events\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 397 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price activity slows, in contrast with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  metrics and analysts' predictions.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw fresh local lows on Tuesday as limp price action diverged further from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/23f0abf0-40eb-40b5-b577-edd9626f306a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin evades \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD reversing at $46,700 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  after dropping $2,000 in hours.\par \par \uc2 Part of a multi-day rangebound construction, the dip resulted in a push toward $48,000, with bulls still unable to gather momentum for an attack on $50,000.\par \par \uc2 For popular trader Crypto Ed, $48,200 was the level to watch for continuation upward.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShowing some tricky moves, retest failed overnight with that dump,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1432621691830616067"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on the hourly chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRight now busy to print a Bart pattern. Still having the same view: reclaim that first horizontal and we\u8217\'20\'19re good to go.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3147fa9d-5396-4da3-9e51-c27bac14bba5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT annotated 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: Crypto Ed/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 The mood among analysts broadly stayed optimistic on the day despite price action lagging any noticeable improvement in market activity.\par \par \uc2 Some highlighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432328378384781326"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conspicuous accumulation}}}\uc2  at current levels, while on-chain metrics such as illiquid supply were also a talking point.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis wave of Bitcoin supply shock has the most momentum of any in recent history,\u8221\'20\'1D William Clemente III, lead insights analyst at Blockware, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432399090143449100/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going much higher over the coming months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c4fe8948-bb93-40b7-b073-c96060b76108.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin illiquid supply relative strength index vs. BTC/USD chart. Source: William Clemente III/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Ether on the move\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, Solana (SOL) and Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT were the standouts in the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-30-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-sol-dot-uni-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD continued making new highs, gaining 19% on the day to near $120, while DOT/USD added 9.2%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was also on the move, up 5% at the time of writing and above $3,350 in what Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1432611989000425473"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  as a \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D market.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum bouncing from support as well on the $BTC pair. Looking good,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/99924c67-3b81-4050-a5e4-d5fbc2a755ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOTc5MjA5NzAtMzkwMy00MjBhLThkZjgtYThlZGRmNzQ5MTAxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210831eh8v0005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price sinks to $46.7K despite record accumulation and supply shock events\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 395 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price activity slows, in contrast with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  metrics and analysts' predictions.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw fresh local lows on Aug. 31 as limp price action diverged further from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/23f0abf0-40eb-40b5-b577-edd9626f306a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin evades \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD reversing at $46,700 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  after dropping $2,000 in hours.\par \par \uc2 Part of a multi-day rangebound construction, the dip resulted in a push towards $48,000, with bulls still unable to gather momentum for an attack on $50,000.\par \par \uc2 For popular trader Crypto Ed, $48,200 was the level to watch for continuation upwards.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShowing some tricky moves, retest failed overnight with that dump,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1432621691830616067"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on the hourly chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRight now busy to print a Bart pattern. Still having the same view: reclaim that first horizontal and we're good to go.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3147fa9d-5396-4da3-9e51-c27bac14bba5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT annotated 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: Crypto Ed/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 The mood among analysts broadly stayed optimistic on the day despite price action lagging any noticeable improvement in market activity.\par \par \uc2 Some highlighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432328378384781326"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conspicuous accumulation}}}\uc2  at current levels, while on-chain metrics such as illiquid supply were also a talking point.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis wave of Bitcoin supply shock has the most momentum of any in recent history,\u8221\'20\'1D William Clemente, lead insights analyst at Blockware, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432399090143449100/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe're going much higher over the coming months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c4fe8948-bb93-40b7-b073-c96060b76108.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin illiquid supply relative strength index vs. BTC/USD chart. Source: William Clemente/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Ethereum on the move\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) were the standouts in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-30-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-sol-dot-uni-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD continued making new highs, gaining 19% on the day to near $120, while DOT/USD added 9.2%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was also on the move, up 5% at the time of writing and above $3,350 in what Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1432611989000425473"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  as a "\b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 " market.\par \par \uc2 "Ethereum bouncing from support as well on the $BTC pair. Looking good," he added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/99924c67-3b81-4050-a5e4-d5fbc2a755ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOTc5MjA5NzAtMzkwMy00MjBhLThkZjgtYThlZGRmNzQ5MTAxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210831eh8v0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, SOL, DOT, UNI, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select major altcoins are still facing selling at overhead resistance levels, indicating that the next leg of the uptrend may have to wait.\par \par \uc2 There is an old proverb which says that history does not always repeat, but it tends to rhyme. If that holds true for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), then a strong up-move may not happen in the month of September.\par \par \uc2 Bybit data shows that since 2013, Bitcoin has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-a-bitcoin-bull-run-not-in-september-btc-price-data-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closed September in the red for six years}}}\uc2  and has managed a positive monthly close only on two occasions. The best performance was in 2016 when Bitcoin rose 6.04%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/7a297fbb-4f1f-4056-9ee1-5c0927a872a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, September\u8217\'20\'19s poor historical performance has not stopped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-join-small-fish-in-buying-btc-as-price-holds-above-47k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 small and large traders from accumulating}}}\uc2  Bitcoin in August. Ecoinometrics reported rising account balances for addresses holding 1,000 to 10,000 BTC and for accounts that hold less than one Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Will September\u8217\'20\'19s poor historical record scare away the bulls or will this year be an exception? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls again failed to push the price above the overhead resistance at $50,000 on Aug. 29, suggesting that bears are defending the level aggressively. Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 29, which has resolved to the downside today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/93d85971-b4ac-4a90-afc3-8f4277125fb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the relative strength index (RSI) to climb back into the symmetrical triangle indicates weakness. If bears pull the price below the 200-day simple moving average ($46,065), the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the next support at $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may remain range-bound between $42,451.67 and $50,500 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $42,451.67 will signal the start of a deeper correction. The pair may then correct to $36,670.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $50,500. Such a move could open the gates for a rally to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the overhead resistance zone at $3,335 to $3,377.89 on Aug. 29. This suggests that bears are defending the overhead zone aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/eb1be136-f13a-4afc-bf14-840b738abf87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls haven\u8217\'20\'19t surrendered and are defending the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,139) as seen from the strong rebound today. If bulls drive the price above the overhead zone, the ETH/USDT pair may resume its up-move with a target objective at $3,670 and then $4,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the breakout level at $3,000. A bounce off this level may keep the pair range-bound between $3,000 and $3,377.89 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A deeper correction may start if bears pull and sustain the price below the breakout level at $3,000. That could result in a decline to the 200-day SMA ($2,389).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $2.95 on Aug. 28, suggesting that bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $2.97. That was followed by a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 29, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1489eacb-2942-4fa6-b2c9-8727861dda20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty has extended today with the formation of the inside-day candlestick pattern. If sellers sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the Aug. 29 intraday low at $2.71, the pair may again drop to the breakout level at $2.47. A strong rebound off this level may keep the pair range-bound between $2.47 and $2.97 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping 20-day EMA ($2.44) suggests advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI indicates the momentum is weakening. A break and close below $2.47 will suggest the start of a deeper correction. The pair may then drop to $2.20.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the psychological level at $3 to signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push and sustain Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the May 19 intraday high at $516.50 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders. The altcoin has turned down and it may now drop to the breakout level at $433.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/afded937-824b-4e13-97ef-a69240d177c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to aggressively defend the support zone between the 20-day EMA ($445) and the breakout level at $433. A strong rebound off this zone will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $520 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The BNB/USDT pair may then rally to $600. Conversely, if bears sink the price below $433, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($368).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the $1.07 support on Aug. 27 but the bulls could not push the price to the downtrend line. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears are currently attempting to sink the price to the critical support at $1.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ccced9bb-c0cc-4b3a-a83b-55b7db1d14f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below $1.05. This setup has a target objective at $0.75. The flattening 20-day EMA ($1.10) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the $1.05 support and breaks above the downtrend line, it will negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. The pair may then start its rally to $1.35 followed by a move to $1.66.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance at $0.29 on Aug. 27 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price dipped back below $0.29 on Aug. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/d7e7c014-3cc1-45a4-80eb-6474e6a23606.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the immediate support at $0.26. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance will shift in favor of the bulls if they can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. The pair may then rally to $0.35 and later to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is in a strong uptrend. The up-move halted on Aug. 29 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that bulls bought on dips. The buyers have again pushed the price to a new all-time high today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/409dd7d8-f02b-483a-b5a8-6c8680dce55f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $100, the SOL/USDT pair could start its journey toward the next target at $122.09. Although the momentum is strong, the RSI above 83 suggests the rally is overheated in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $90. That will suggest that traders are aggressively booking profits. The pair could then correct to the 20-day EMA ($72), which is likely to act as a strong support. A break and close below this support will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The uptrend line in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is acting as a resistance. Attempts by the bulls to push the price back above this line failed on Aug. 27 and 28, which suggests that traders are closing their positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b71c72a6-cddf-46ef-9a00-4129f61e6976.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($24.48), the DOT/USDT pair could witness further selling. The pair may then drop to the strong support at $18. Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The gradually flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest that bulls are losing their grip. To gain the upper hand, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $28.60. That will complete a V-bottom pattern, which has a target objective at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/this-service-is-declaring-that-it-s-crypto-altseason-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 This service is declaring that it's \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto altseason\u8221\'20\'1D again}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $25 support on Aug. 27 and rose above the moving averages but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears have not given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ba71d64e-4104-4d76-b1d6-138e4fd6483d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has dipped back below the moving averages today and the sellers will now try to pull the price below the support at $25. If that happens, the UNI/USDT pair will complete a small descending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $18.74.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the $25 support and breaks above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair could then rise to $30. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this resistance to signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA rallied to a new all-time high on Aug. 29 but traders used this rise to book profits. The price turned down today but bounced sharply from $32, indicating that bulls had flipped the previous resistance into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e11215c0-e8a0-411c-98da-ae2365ef0341.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above the all-time high at $36.89. If they manage to do that, the LUNA/USDT pair could start its journey toward the next target objective at $43 and later to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down from $36.89, the bears will try to sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($27.23).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the up-move. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNWYxNWYwYjUtMWYwNS00MDliLTk5M2ItZmNiMjZlZTI0YjgzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210830eh8u000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is the time right for $50K BTC? 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,123 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin stays below $50,000 as BTC bulls lack momentum for major change.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is keeping everyone guessing this week as another Monday starts below $50,000.\par \par \uc2 After rangebound movements over the weekend, bulls are still waiting for a decisive attack on the $50,000 mark \u8212\'20\'14 could it happen now?\par \par \uc2 Despite optimism from analysts, it seems that not even an \u8220\'20\'1Cuber dovish\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has the fuel to push BTC/USD above crucial resistance.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at five things that could still provide Bitcoin with new momentum.\par \par \uc2 Dollar comedown as stocks set for even higher highs\par \par \uc2 Stocks hit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uber-dovish-fed-sparks-s-p-500-all-time-high-as-analyst-calls-new-bitcoin-impulse-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh all-time highs}}}\uc2  last week on the back of comments from Fed Chair Jerome Powell.\par \par \uc2 Correspondingly, the strength of the U.S. dollar took a hit, and the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) began a multi-day downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Such conditions tend to be favorable for Bitcoin, and a lack of headwinds coming from the macro-environment could yet give bulls a helping hand.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is little doubt Powell was dovish, relative to market pricing and positioning,\u8221\'20\'1D one analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloombergquint.com/markets/stocks-set-to-climb-on-powell-s-dovish-fed-stance-markets-wrap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg, echoing the general feeling from Friday\u8217\'20\'19s speech.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a234a86d-ccfe-4d44-834a-2364e33e4bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Resistance keeps Bitcoin bulls in check\par \par \uc2 Saturday and Sunday weren\u8217\'20\'19t exactly boring for Bitcoin traders \u8212\'20\'14 two run-ups above $49,000 gave them plenty of hope for the \u8220\'20\'1Cbig showdown\u8221\'20\'1D against the $50,000 barrier.\par \par \uc2 In the end, however, both attempts failed below $49,500, and BTC/USD remained in a narrow range in the upper $40,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the picture remains the same, with $47,000 now back on the table for support.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin above $51K, until then just noise,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1432025355406168065"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  as the weekend ended.\par \par \uc2 In an uncertain environment, others are warning that buy-side strength may yet crumble in the short term to produce lower support retests.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC is still trying to hold this red area as support, producing increasingly volatile downside wicks below it,\u8221\'20\'1D trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1432071489893896203"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on an updated daily chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe downside has been bought up successfully thus far but this blue downtrending resistance continues to weigh down on price.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A look at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1432222485408272384"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance Monday underscores the relative lack of support much above $40,000, while firm resistance is in place overhead.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e92ec4d0-cbb6-415f-96d5-af04fa2c1727.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 30. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Hash rate retests April dip zone\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s a situation that could yet play out elsewhere in Bitcoin beyond spot price \u8212\'20\'14 fundamentals are also slowing their rapid growth.\par \par \uc2 After an impressive 13.2% upward difficulty adjustment a week ago, Bitcoin is now looking at the next being all but flat \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 less than 1%}}}\uc2  is currently estimated to be added.\par \par \uc2 This may yet turn negative, marking a pause for thought among miners after a mass return to the network over recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Should difficulty nonetheless increase, however, it would seal the second run of four upward difficulty adjustments in a row for 2021.\par \par \uc2 Correspondingly, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miningpoolstats.stream/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 network hash rate}}}\uc2  is also lingering at higher levels this week, approaching 125 exahashes per second (EH/s).\par \par \uc2 The hash rate has recovered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VailshireCap/status/1430554965639008265"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extremely well}}}\uc2  since July and is now just 40 EH/s away from all-time highs, having added 4 EH/s since last Monday.\par \par \uc2 Investor and analyst Vince Prince further {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Vince_Prince_/status/1431915779767750670/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that current levels echo the brief lows seen after April\u8217\'20\'19s all-time highs for BTC/USD. The hash rate then bounced to hit all-time highs of its own before the China rout took hold.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hash rate is already back to the levels seen in November 2020,\u8221\'20\'1D an even more optimistic Anthony Pompliano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/APompliano/status/1429589128467845124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t surprise me to see a new hash rate all-time high by end of year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/87415bf3-ed6e-492c-bc33-c048c10a7865.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 7-day average hash rate chart. Source: Blockchain.com\par \par \uc2 Sizing up the chances of $50,000\par \par \uc2 What are the odds that a $50,000 onslaught by bulls becomes the defining market feature this week?\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-weekly-outlook-why-a-50k-retest-is-likely-ahead-of-friday-s-us-jobs-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the upcoming U.S. jobs data release on Friday may already seal the deadline for a BTC comeback.\par \par \uc2 The ingredients to make it happen are already broadly in place \u8212\'20\'14 neutral funding rates across trading platforms and an increasing supply of stablecoins, this topping $19 billion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince the surge of US$1.8 billion in a single day on August 24, the accumulated stablecoins on centralized exchanges have exceeded 19 billion for a week,\u8221\'20\'1D on-chain analytics firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/quicktake/612c2fe49733862cda0b10d0-stablecoins-on-centralized-exchanges-have-exceeded-19-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CryptoQuant}}}\uc2  noted Monday citing data from CoinGecko.\par \par \uc2 It added that trading volumes for major stablecoins have also increased, in the case of market leader Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) by 28% in the past five days.\par \par \uc2 Charles Edwards, founder of Capriole Investments, meanwhile, noted that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decreasing dominance, now at 44%, is itself in a bull trigger-in-waiting.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis sidelined capital is like rocket fuel for when we start getting daily closes above $50K,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/caprioleio/status/1432109819633311753"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What could be the sticking point? For analyst William Clemente , low volumes remain an issue in the short term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf anything has me concerned it\u8217\'20\'19s this,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432039596611751943/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  alongside a comparative chart of volume throughout the 2020\u8211\'20\'1321 bull run.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhere is the demand?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a501aac2-ef56-4152-a29c-0cf0fd8e6001.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin volume chart. Source: William Clemente III/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Eerie calm continues for sentiment\par \par \uc2 The idea that Bitcoin is facing its \u8220\'20\'1Cfinal hurdle\u8221\'20\'1D before challenging all-time highs is arguably already visible in trader sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-luna-vet-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , LUNA, VET, XTZ}}}\par \par \uc2 After BTC/USD added 60% in weeks, sentiment likewise went from \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 as per the Crypto Fear & Greed Index.\par \par \uc2 Now, as the pace of gains has slowed due to $50,000 resistance, so too has \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme\u8221\'20\'1D feeling given way to a more moderate \u8220\'20\'1Cgreed\u8221\'20\'1D rating on the Index.\par \par \uc2 August has in fact been mostly stable for sentiment, which the Index has measured at between 70 and 80 for the past three weeks.\par \par \uc2 The last chance to buy Bitcoin under $50,000.\par \par \uc2 ATH retests have a way of popping off and inducing massive FOMO and attention.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Alex Wice (@AWice) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AWice/status/1432028899886600193?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 29, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drop-in-3-2-1-fear-and-greed-index-nears-dangerous-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ideal bull run}}}\uc2  combines solid price appreciation with steady sentiment increases \u8212\'20\'14 as history has shown, hitting the standard top zone of 95/100 on Fear & Greed too quickly coincides with a BTC price sell-off.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/f1d113eb-fc00-45e1-babf-c740c1c6f98e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTBkODkxMjAtZGUxMy00MjdhLWIwNjAtYjY5OWFkYmVmZTFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210830eh8u0005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is the time right for $50K BTC? 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,118 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin stays below $50,000 as BTC bulls lack momentum for major change.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is keeping everyone guessing this week as another Monday starts below $50,000.\par \par \uc2 After rangebound movements over the weekend, bulls are still waiting for a decisive attack on the $50,000 mark \u8212\'20\'14 could it happen now?\par \par \uc2 Despite optimism from analysts, it seems that not even an \u8220\'20\'1Cuber dovish\u8221\'20\'1D Federal Reserve has the fuel to push BTC/USD above crucial resistance.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at five things which could still provide Bitcoin with new momentum.\par \par \uc2 Dollar comedown as stocks set for even higher highs\par \par \uc2 Stocks hit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uber-dovish-fed-sparks-s-p-500-all-time-high-as-analyst-calls-new-bitcoin-impulse-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh all-time highs}}}\uc2  last week on the back of comments from Fed Chair Jerome Powell.\par \par \uc2 Correspondingly, the strength of the U.S. dollar took a hit, and the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) began a multi-day downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Such conditions tend to be favorable for Bitcoin, and a lack of headwinds coming from the macro-environment could yet give bulls a helping hand.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is little doubt Powell was dovish, relative to market pricing and positioning,\u8221\'20\'1D one analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloombergquint.com/markets/stocks-set-to-climb-on-powell-s-dovish-fed-stance-markets-wrap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg, echoing the general feeling from Friday\u8217\'20\'19s speech.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a234a86d-ccfe-4d44-834a-2364e33e4bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Resistance keeps Bitcoin bulls in check\par \par \uc2 Saturday and Sunday weren\u8217\'20\'19t exactly boring for Bitcoin traders \u8212\'20\'14 two run-ups above $49,000 gave them plenty of hope for the \u8220\'20\'1Cbig showdown\u8221\'20\'1D against the $50,000 barrier.\par \par \uc2 In the end, however, both attempts failed below $49,500, and BTC/USD remained in a narrow range in the upper $40,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the picture remains the same, with $47,000 now back on the table for support.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin above $51K, until then just noise,\u8221\'20\'1D Cointelegraph Contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1432025355406168065"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  as the weekend ended.\par \par \uc2 In an uncertain environment, others are warning that buy-side strength may yet crumble in the short term to produce lower support retests.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC is still trying to hold this red area as support, producing increasingly volatile downside wicks below it,\u8221\'20\'1D trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1432071489893896203"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on an updated daily chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe downside has been bought up successfully thus far but this blue downtrending resistance continues to weigh down on price.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A look at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1432222485408272384"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance Monday underscores the relative lack of support much above $40,000, while firm resistance is in place overhead.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e92ec4d0-cbb6-415f-96d5-af04fa2c1727.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 30. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Hash rate retests April dip zone\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s a situation that could yet play out elsewhere in Bitcoin beyond spot price \u8212\'20\'14 fundamentals are also slowing their rapid growth.\par \par \uc2 After an impressive 13.2% upward difficulty adjustment a week ago, Bitcoin is now looking at the next being all but flat \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 less than 1%}}}\uc2  is currently estimated to be added.\par \par \uc2 This may yet turn negative, marking a pause for thought among miners after a mass return to the network over recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 Should difficulty nonetheless increase, however, it would seal the second run of four upward difficulty adjustments in a row for 2021.\par \par \uc2 Correspondingly, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miningpoolstats.stream/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 network hash rate}}}\uc2  is also lingering at higher levels this week, approaching the 125 exahashes per second (EH/s) mark.\par \par \uc2 Hash rate has recovered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VailshireCap/status/1430554965639008265"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extremely well}}}\uc2  since July, and is now just 40 EH/s away from all-time highs, having added 4 EH/s since last Monday.\par \par \uc2 Investor and analyst Vince Prince further {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Vince_Prince_/status/1431915779767750670/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that current levels echo the brief lows seen after April\u8217\'20\'19s all-time highs for BTC/USD. Hash rate then bounced to hit all-time highs of its own before the China rout took hold.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin's hash rate is already back to the levels seen in November 2020,\u8221\'20\'1D an even more optimistic Anthony Pompliano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/APompliano/status/1429589128467845124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt wouldn't surprise me to see a new hash rate all-time high by end of year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/87415bf3-ed6e-492c-bc33-c048c10a7865.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 7-day average hash rate chart. Source: Blockchain\par \par \uc2 Sizing up the chances of $50,000\par \par \uc2 What are the odds that a $50,000 onslaught by bulls becomes the defining market feature this week?\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-weekly-outlook-why-a-50k-retest-is-likely-ahead-of-friday-s-us-jobs-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the upcoming U.S. jobs data release on Friday may already seal the deadline for a BTC comeback.\par \par \uc2 The ingredients to make it happen are already broadly in place \u8212\'20\'14 neutral funding rates across trading platforms and an increasing supply of stablecoins, this topping $19 billion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince the surge of US$1.8 billion in a single day on August 24, the accumulated stablecoins on centralized exchanges have exceeded 19 billion for a week,\u8221\'20\'1D on-chain analytics firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/quicktake/612c2fe49733862cda0b10d0-stablecoins-on-centralized-exchanges-have-exceeded-19-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CryptoQuant}}}\uc2  noted Monday citing data from CoinGecko.\par \par \uc2 It added that trading volumes for major stablecoins have also increased, in the case of market leader Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) by 28% in the past five days.\par \par \uc2 Charles Edwards, founder at Capriole Investments, meanwhile noted that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decreasing dominance, now at 44%, is in itself a bull trigger-in-waiting.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis sidelined capital is like rocket fuel for when we start getting daily closes above $50K,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/caprioleio/status/1432109819633311753"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What could be the sticking point? For analyst William Clemente, low volumes remain an issue in the short term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf anything has me concerned it's this,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1432039596611751943/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  alongside a comparative chart of volume throughout the 2020-21 bull run.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhere is the demand?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a501aac2-ef56-4152-a29c-0cf0fd8e6001.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin volume chart. Source: William Clemente/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Eerie calm continues for sentiment\par \par \uc2 The idea that Bitcoin is facing its \u8220\'20\'1Cfinal hurdle\u8221\'20\'1D before challenging all-time highs is arguably already visible in trader sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-luna-vet-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , LUNA, VET, XTZ}}}\par \par \uc2 After BTC/USD added 60% in weeks, sentiment likewise went from \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 as per the Crypto Fear & Greed Index.\par \par \uc2 Now, as the pace of gains has slowed due to $50,000 resistance, so too has \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme\u8221\'20\'1D feeling given way to a more moderate \u8220\'20\'1Cgreed\u8221\'20\'1D rating on the Index.\par \par \uc2 August has in fact been mostly stable for sentiment, which the Index has measured at between 70 and 80 for the past three weeks.\par \par \uc2 The last chance to buy Bitcoin under $50,000.\par \par \uc2 ATH retests have a way of popping off and inducing massive FOMO and attention.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Alex Wice (@AWice) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AWice/status/1432028899886600193?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 29, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drop-in-3-2-1-fear-and-greed-index-nears-dangerous-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ideal bull run}}}\uc2  combines solid price appreciation with steady sentiment increases \u8212\'20\'14 as history has shown, hitting the standard top zone of 95/100 on Fear & Greed too quickly coincides with a BTC price sell-off.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/f1d113eb-fc00-45e1-babf-c740c1c6f98e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTBkODkxMjAtZGUxMy00MjdhLWIwNjAtYjY5OWFkYmVmZTFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210830eh8u0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, VET, XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation near $50,000 reflects a steady market and this could attract buyers to altcoins like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, VET and XTZ.\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 27, U.S. Federal Reserve Chair Jerome Powell said that the central bank will start tapering its $120 billion monthly bond purchases by the end of the year, but the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uber-dovish-fed-sparks-s-p-500-all-time-high-as-analyst-calls-new-bitcoin-impulse-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interest rate hikes would have to wait}}}\uc2  until the job market and inflation pass a more stringent test.\par \par \uc2 In response to the speech, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) fell, the S&P 500 index rose to a new all-time high, and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) surged about $1,500 in under an hour. This showed that market participants viewed the speech as \u8220\'20\'1Cdovish.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b875cd0b-2b8c-4e1b-917b-96165e0c16a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s uncertainty near the $50,000 mark has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-key-momentum-metric-just-flashed-bearish-with-btc-price-pinned-under-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts divided about its short-term directional move}}}\uc2 . Analyst Ryan Clark believes the current consolidation in Bitcoin is similar to the one seen below $24,000 before the breakout in December 2020, but TraderXO believes that BTC may correct to the $39,000 the to 42,000 zone in September.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation below $50,000 attract buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may outperform in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average ($46,823) on Aug. 27 but the bulls have not been able to push the price above the overhead resistance zone at $50,000 to $50,500. This suggests that bears have not thrown in the towel yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/42e786ba-d7d6-4f5e-9e33-149882160ff6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the short-term traders are booking profits. That may pull the price down to $43,927.70 and then to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the BTC/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $42,451.67 and $50,500 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the overhead zone. If they manage to do that, the pair may start its journey toward $60,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/80e01812-2149-4e86-ba62-2809243d59ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages on the 4-hour chart have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is close to the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. The price may remain stuck between $46,200 and $49,500 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $49,500, the pair may challenge the $50,500 resistance. A breakout and close above this level could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. On the contrary, if bears sink the price below $46,200, the pair may drop to $44,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating between $2.97 and $2.47. The price had dropped to the breakout level at $2.47 on Aug. 26 but the sharp rebound off it on Aug. 27 shows that bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e2478ab6-5e56-4338-9cf9-cba66535c258.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A consolidation near the all-time high is a positive sign as it shows that traders continue to buy on dips. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive and sustain the price above the psychological barrier at $3, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the $2.97 to $3 resistance zone, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. A break and close below $2.47 will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/66d54d6f-a155-4b50-ac64-499bf793f76f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI on the 4-hour chart has formed a negative divergence, indicating that the upward momentum may be slowing down. If bears pull and sustain the price below the 50-simple moving average, the pair may drop to $2.47.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $2.47 and $2.97 for some time. The bears will have to sink the price below the $2.47 to $2.31 support zone to gain the upper hand. Alternatively, the uptrend may resume if bulls drive and sustain the price above $2.97.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token is in a strong uptrend. After a few days of consolidation, the price rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($26.42) on Aug. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2153290f-62e1-47d2-a2cb-1d5df4ca0b15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. The first target objective on the upside is a move to $43 and if that level is crossed, the LUNA/USDT pair may rally to $50.\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are defending the overhead resistance aggressively. If bears pull the price below $32, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls to defend. A strong bounce off it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact but a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8e9fc334-75c5-47d9-8469-6c487e6645e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows a broadening triangle formation which indicates an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The buyers had pushed the price above the triangle but they could not sustain the breakout, suggesting aggressive selling by the bears at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-EMA, the bulls will again make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. If bulls sustain the price above the triangle, it may signal the resumption of the up-move. The pattern target of this setup is $46.95.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. A break and close below this support will signal that bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may then drop to the $22.40 to $20.81 support zone.\par \par \uc2 VET/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the sharp recovery from its recent lows at $0.05 on July 21, VeChain ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/vechain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET}}}\uc2  ) has formed a pennant. This setup will complete after the price breaks above or below the formation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b011e534-6ad3-402a-9fa8-dfe846d6f277.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VET/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/VETUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.11) has flattened out and the RSI has dropped close to the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. A breakout and close above the resistance line of the pennant will suggest the resumption of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 The first target objective on the upside is a move to $0.16 and if this level is crossed, the VET/USDT pair may rally to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the support line of the pennant, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c158b8e1-3181-4006-a401-00bf94b658ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VET/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/VETUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the price is getting squeezed inside the triangle. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 The rebound off the support line is facing stiff resistance at the 50-SMA. If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to sink the pair below the support line. If they succeed, the pair may drop to $0.082.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls drive the price above the 50-SMA, the pair could challenge the resistance line. A breakout and close above this resistance could signal the resumption of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-weekly-outlook-why-a-50k-retest-is-likely-ahead-of-friday-s-us-jobs-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin weekly outlook: Why a $50K-retest is likely ahead of Friday's US jobs data}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) completed a rounding bottom pattern when the price broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $4.47. This suggests the start of a new uptrend that has a pattern target at $6.85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a501acf5-c1a6-45d0-bb28-860e47d8ddab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, after the price breaks out of a setup, it retests the breakout level. In this case, the XTZ/USDT pair could drop to $4.47. If bulls flip this level into support, it will suggest the start of a new uptrend. The rising 20-day EMA ($4.25) and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. That could trap several aggressive bulls and result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($3.31).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/92bd7cb3-bc49-4c49-90f7-98f1806cbe20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the pair picked up momentum after it rose above the $4.47 resistance. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The pair could rally to the overhead resistance zone at $6.31 to $6.50 where bears may mount a stiff resistance. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-EMA. That could open the doors for a decline to the breakout level at $4.47.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMWFhNDAyZjEtNWZkNy00OGEyLWIxZTYtMjk1NTQwNjdlNTEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210829eh8t000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin in line for 'phenomenal' weekly close if BTC price holds $49K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 482 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin erases most of its losses with BTC price action in need of a $49,300 weekly close.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) held $49,000 on Aug. 28 after the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  sparked a run-up toward critical resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ab85541c-c9ab-4fde-90df-ecf89a8f61d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 All eyes on $49,300 on the weekly chart\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD cooling at higher levels after cracking the $49,000 mark late Friday.\par \par \uc2 The end of the working week had seen a positive reaction to comments from Fed Chair Jerome Powell on tapering of asset purchases, as well as remarks on inflation.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uber-dovish-fed-sparks-s-p-500-all-time-high-as-analyst-calls-new-bitcoin-impulse-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , stocks surged to all-time highs, while the U.S. dollar weakened \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin made use of the opportunity and added $1,500 in under an hour.\par \par \uc2 With talk of a new "\b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  impulse" move afoot on crypto markets, the mood into the weekend was thus far from \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "If BTC is able to stay above the ~$49000 level for the rest of the week... It would set itself up for a phenomenal Weekly Close," trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1431399201913679877"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 That weekly close had a solid chance of beating the last at the time of writing, with $49,300 the level to clinch for a multi-month high.\par \par \uc2 That would also place Bitcoin back in the tiny two-month window in which it closed above $49,000 on the weekly chart earlier this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/27dcd395-47ae-4a2d-be81-514d3e5461c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "Should be pretty obvious where Bitcoin is heading," popular Twitter account Ryan Cantering Clark {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CanteringClark/status/1431419552357830658"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A look at buy and sell levels on major exchange Binance on the day meanwhile revealed a support line slowly building at around $48,800, forming a close stand-off with sellers just below $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/60d3922c-bf14-4924-a695-45ff2223ec72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 28. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cardano bulls back in action as altcoins wake up\par \par \uc2 Altcoins meanwhile mostly benefited from renewed strength in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-27-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-dot-sol-uni-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/27: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 With the exception of a flat Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap saw solid 24-hour gains.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bulls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-chart-painting-a-bull-flag-for-3-ada-price-ahead-of-erc-20-converter-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led the advance}}}\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD climbing almost 10% to $2.85 and making up for much of its recently lost ground after hitting all-time highs. Solana (SOL) continued upwards after its own {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-hits-record-high-with-sol-price-up-over-218-in-six-weeks-what-s-behind-the-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record high}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b9c7bdbe-3222-41cf-a4a7-e4c7994b816a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was at $3,240, having increased by a more modest 4% and still down 1.5% versus the same time last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMjBhNzhlYzAtMTA2Mi00YWUxLTk1MDItMWFlMTE0MTI1MGFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210828eh8s0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/27: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins saw a strong bounce off their respective support levels, a sign that traders are still buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 Asset managers and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/asset-managers-and-companies-accumulate-1-2m-bitcoin-worth-57-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 companies currently hold over 6%}}}\uc2  of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) circulating supply, according to Buy Bitcoin Worldwide. A breakdown of the data shows Bitcoin fund issuers and asset managers hold about 4% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply, public companies account for nearly 1% and private companies own roughly 0.83% of the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s supply.\par \par \uc2 It's clear that institutional investors have continued to add crypto to their portfolios and Adam Proctor, the managing director for billionaire Simon Nixon\u8217\'20\'19s investment firm Seek Ventures, said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-simon-nixon-s-venture-capital-to-increase-crypto-allocation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the company plans to increase}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Callocation to crypto\u8221\'20\'1D as they believe it to be an \u8220\'20\'1Cimportant area for the future.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/968663f3-3318-4d10-b615-60702ba29ad7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 CNBC Mad Money host, \uc2 Jim Cramer\uc2 , recently said that he was a \u8220\'20\'1Cbeliever in crypto\u8221\'20\'1D and recommended that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jim-cramer-coinbase-stock-is-cheap-put-5-of-your-portfolio-in-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors allocate 5% of their investment portfolio}}}\uc2  to digital currencies.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin breaking above the psychological barrier at $50,000, result in a buying stampede in the sector? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Strong resistance near the $50,000 mark may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders on Aug. 26. That pulled Bitcoin below the support line of the rising wedge pattern but the bears have not been able to capitalize on this move and sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ca797458-7024-41ab-b05b-2d9d0387828b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price back into the wedge today. If the rebound sustains, the BTC/USDT pair could gradually move toward the overhead resistance zone of $50,000 to $50,500. A breakout and close above this zone will indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rise to the resistance line of the wedge where bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may continue to rise inside the wedge.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the wedge will signal a pick-up in momentum. That may result in a rally to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has broken below a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating a marginal advantage to the bears. If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, the pair may drop to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a tight range between $3,000 and $3,335 for the past few days. The 20-day exponential moving average ($3.097) is flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/14c46cfe-b82f-4c21-835d-3d39ce91c51d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has rebounded off the 20-day EMA today and the bulls will now attempt to push the price above $3,335. If that happens, it will suggest that bulls accumulated the ETH/USDT pair inside the range. The pair could then rally to $3,670 and later to $4,000.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $3,000 will indicate that bears have overpowered the bulls. That could result in further selling as several stop-losses may get hit. The pair could then drop to the next support at the 200-day simple moving average ($2,366).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Generally, the breakout from a critical level is retested as seen in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). The price dropped from an all-time high at $2.97 on Aug. 23 to the breakout level at $2.47 on Aug. 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8efd9e74-52a7-4ba3-875d-5c6e4311a7fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has rebounded off the $2.47 today, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on every minor dip. The bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $2.97.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair may rally to $3.50. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2.29) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will indicate that bulls are closing their positions on rallies. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) intraday high on May 19 was $516.50 and that level is likely to act as a stiff resistance. The bulls pushed the price above this resistance on Aug. 26 but could not sustain the altcoin above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/d594e12b-0ca8-4d69-817a-057353ae2632.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will suggest strength. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair may rally to $600.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($432) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest advantage to buyers. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could result in a decline to the 200-day SMA ($362).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has again dropped to the breakout level at $1.07. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the altcoin could witness long liquidation and drop to the next support at the 200-day SMA ($0.86).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/cbfa555d-9400-4cb0-b26d-d6cbc2c85c93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($1.08) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest that bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above the downtrend line will increase the possibility of a rally to the overhead resistance at $1.66.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price once again turns down from the downtrend line, the pair may be at a greater risk of starting a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.28) on Aug. 27, indicating that supply exceeds demand. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price back above the overhead resistance at $0.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/055d36ba-5566-4d76-be9f-91938318acbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the DOGE/USDT pair breaks out of the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up. The pair could then rise to $0.35 and if this level is crossed, the next move could be to the overhead resistance at $0.45.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears are aggressively defending at $0.29. The pair could then drop to $0.21. A strong rebound off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $0.21 and $0.29 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $28.60 and corrected to the 20-day EMA ($24.03). The strong rebound off this level shows that bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e3b6e2b4-8139-415e-8270-c82979e933af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bounce holds up, the bulls will try to drive the price above the overhead resistance at $28.60. If the DOT/USDT pair sustains above $28.60, it will complete a V-bottom, which has a target objective at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bounce fizzles out, the bears will try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may decline to the next strong support at $18. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may remain range-bound between $18 and $28.60 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) Aug. 25 and 26 candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. A shallow correction after a strong up-move is a sign of strength because it suggests that traders are not closing their positions and are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/13cfab6c-d72f-44bb-ab56-e1a4a225d3db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the all-time high at $82 today. If buyers sustain the price above $82, the SOL/USDT pair could start its journey toward the next psychological barrier at $100.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($63) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control. If the price fails to sustain above $82, the pair could remain stuck in a range for a few days. The bears will have to pull the price below $58.38 to break the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-hit-30k-or-100k-this-year-as-analyst-warns-next-months-are-key"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could hit $30K or $100K this year as analyst warns \u8216\'20\'18next months are key\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on Aug. 24, indicating weakness. The bulls tried to push the price back above the moving averages on Aug. 25 and 26 but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1edfc0d9-8770-4f18-b340-562c8097fdf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently again trying to push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to $30. A breakout of the $30 to $31.25 overhead resistance zone could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $23.45. A strong rebound off this level may keep the pair range-bound between $23.45 and $30 in the short term. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a consolidation for a few days.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token has been consolidating between $26 and $32 for the past few days. Although bulls pushed the price above $32 on Aug. 19 and 24, they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8d4d4d3e-deb6-4e53-904a-7613796bfbfa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LUNAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LUNA/USDT pair has rebounded off the support today and the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. If the price closes above the $32 to $34.67 resistance zone, the pair may rally to $43.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($24.44) and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the breakout level at $22.40.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvZTE4YjYxODktZTRmMS00NDdiLTk3ZTAtYzZkMDc0ZTA5ZGY0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210827eh8r000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Traders split on BTC price outlook after Bitcoin dips below $47K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 377 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin drops below $47,000 but BTC price action could now surprise with fresh upside, some argue.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) gave traders a serious sense of d\u233\'00\'E9j\u224\'00\'E0 v\u249\'00\'F9 on Thursday after a fresh attack on $50,000 ended in a firm rejection.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9c4ad0c5-e4f5-40b4-8471-da3af26aff21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin optimism wavers\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD falling to local lows of $46,540 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , having passed $49,300 hours before.\par \par \uc2 The action continues {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-erases-btc-price-dip-but-48-2k-is-now-key-to-avoid-bull-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rangebound behavior}}}\uc2 , which looks to be cementing old resistance at $51,000, bears lacking volume and momentum to flip the area to support.\par \par \uc2 Despite pausing in the mid-$46,000 range, Bitcoin was not enticing many for long positions on the day, with popular trader Crypto Ed eyeing the potential for another relief rally before an even deeper price dip takes hold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  step 2 (bounce) executed it seems {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ZPEsDXspmk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/ZPEsDXspmk}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto_Ed_NL (@Crypto_Ed_NL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1430761846148145163?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 26, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Others were more optimistic, and among them were contributors to market updates at on-chain analytics service CryptoQuant.\par \par \uc2 In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/quicktake/612722c86e4a06184bf949c1-It-is-way-too-obviously-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one}}}\uc2  of the various updates on the day, one analyst forecast that a BTC price move below $47,000 would be a \u8220\'20\'1Cfake dip,\u8221\'20\'1D and the result would be a successful crossing of the $50,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Buyer support on BTC/USD, meanwhile, was wearing thin on Thursday, with reliable interest on major exchange Binance only in place closer to $41,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/453b27f1-1dae-41c2-90af-af7bd0a8c0cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 26. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Ether nears $3,000 retest\par \par \uc2 A similar picture held true for major altcoins as Bitcoin ranged.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-traders-expect-volatility-ahead-of-friday-s-820m-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum traders expect \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  ahead of Friday\u8217\'20\'19s $820M options expiry}}}\par \par \uc2 Out of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, none posted meaningful 24-hour gains while equally barely moving in any direction.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) maintained $3,000 support by a thread, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) erased more of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/number-of-cardano-millionaires-rises-by-173-after-ada-price-hit-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly returns}}}\uc2 , still up 20% over the past seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/0bc3c7fa-ea99-4879-ac9d-ccea9bbbb107.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTU0ZDNjM2MtYWU1Ny00MDU4LWI4ZWEtNDIwNjAwZjhjYmQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210826eh8q0005u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Traders split on BTC price outlook after Bitcoin dips below $47K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 374 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin drops below $47,000 but BTC price action could now surprise with fresh upside, some argue.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) gave traders a serious sense of deja vu on Aug. 26 after a fresh attack on $50,000 ended in a firm rejection.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9c4ad0c5-e4f5-40b4-8471-da3af26aff21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin optimism wavers\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD falling to local lows of $46,540 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , having passed $49,300 hours before.\par \par \uc2 The action continues {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-erases-btc-price-dip-but-48-2k-is-now-key-to-avoid-bull-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rangebound behavior}}}\uc2  which looks to be cementing old resistance at $51,000, bears lacking volume and momentum to flip the area to support.\par \par \uc2 Despite pausing in the mid $46,000 range, Bitcoin was not enticing many for long positions on the day, with popular trader Crypto Ed eyeing the potential for another relief rally before an even deeper price dip takes hold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  step 2 (bounce) executed it seems {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ZPEsDXspmk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/ZPEsDXspmk}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto_Ed_NL (@Crypto_Ed_NL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1430761846148145163?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 26, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Others were more optimistic, among them contributors to market updates at on-chain analytics service CryptoQuant.\par \par \uc2 In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/quicktake/612722c86e4a06184bf949c1-It-is-way-too-obviously-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one}}}\uc2  of various updates on the day, one analyst forecast that a BTC price move below $47,000 would be a "fake dip," and the result would be a successful crossing of the $50,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Buyer support on BTC/USD was meanwhile wearing thin Thursday, with reliable interest on major exchange Binance only in place closer to $41,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/453b27f1-1dae-41c2-90af-af7bd0a8c0cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 26. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Ethereum nears $3,000 retest\par \par \uc2 A similar picture held true for major altcoins as Bitcoin ranged.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-traders-expect-volatility-ahead-of-friday-s-820m-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum traders expect \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  ahead of Friday\u8217\'20\'19s $820M options expiry}}}\par \par \uc2 Out of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, none posted meaningful 24-hour gains, while equally barely moving in any direction.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) maintained $3,000 support by a thread, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) erased more of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/number-of-cardano-millionaires-rises-by-173-after-ada-price-hit-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly returns}}}\uc2 , still up 20% over the past seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/0bc3c7fa-ea99-4879-ac9d-ccea9bbbb107.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTU0ZDNjM2MtYWU1Ny00MDU4LWI4ZWEtNDIwNjAwZjhjYmQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210826eh8q0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/25: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,926 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Even with Wednesday's pullback, Bitcoin and most major altcoins are finding buyers on minor dips to underlying support levels, signaling that the trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) remains on a strong footing after bears failed to capitalize on the rejection near the psychological mark at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 The recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin has not enticed longer-term investors to part with their holdings, and Glassnode data shows that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-transactions-stay-low-despite-price-rally-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin supply held by long-term holders}}}\uc2  has hit a new all-time high of 12.69 million BTC. This tops the previous record achieved in October 2020.\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recent Form 8-K filing with the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  shows that the company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-splashes-177m-on-bitcoin-now-holds-almost-109-000-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bolstered its Bitcoin holdings}}}\uc2  by 3,907 BTC between July 1 and Aug. 23. The company bought at an average price of $45,294. This brings \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 's total holdings to 108,992 BTC, with an average price of $26,769.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/cb846d00-972c-4f8a-9c8b-5240c6b9cf4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term. John Bollinger, the creator of the popular technical analysis Bollinger Bands indicator, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bollinger-bands-creator-warns-bitcoin-bulls-as-btc-price-struggles-below-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sounded a note of caution to traders}}}\uc2  and suggested that they \u8220\'20\'1Ctake some profits or hedge a bit.\u8221\'20\'1D He said there was no confirmation of a fall yet, but if it happened, hodlers could use the lower levels to buy more.\par \par \uc2 After Aug. 25's minor correction, could Bitcoin and altcoins resume their up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the psychological barrier at $50,000 on Aug. 23, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed profit-booking at higher levels. The selling continued on Aug. 24 and on Aug. 25, which pulled the price down to the support line of the rising wedge pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2291d184-59e0-4905-8daf-0ecd39637d59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently defending the support line. If the rebound sustains, the bulls will have another go at the overhead resistance zone of $50,000 to $50,500. If it clears this hurdle, the BTC/USDT pair may rally to the resistance line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the wedge will suggest strength and could attract further buying. That may clear the path for a rally to $60,000. The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($46,014) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone indicate an advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if bears sink the price below the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($45,977). That may result in a decline to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $3,335 on Aug. 23 and Aug. 24, but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b59989df-2cd9-41e5-9214-363de46a8a51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair dropped to the 20-day EMA ($3,080) on Aug. 25, but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels. If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the buyers will take another shot at pushing the pair above $3,335.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the pair may resume its uptrend, which could reach $3,670 and then $4,000. On the contrary, if the price again turns down from $3,335, a few days of consolidation is possible. The first sign of weakness will be a break and a close below $3,000. If bears sustain the price below this level, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($2,352).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit-booking near the psychological level at $3 on Aug. 24, but a positive sign is that bulls are not giving up much ground. The long tail on Aug. 24's and Aug 25\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1e19afdb-1714-4d8f-a933-e5cb0c79bbdf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level or the breakout level at $2.47, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $3. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may rise to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may consolidate between $3 and $2.47 for a few days. A break and close below $2.47 could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($2.20). The bears will have to sink the price below this support to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the strong up-move on Aug. 23, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) made an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 24. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. Currently, the buyers are attempting to resolve the uncertainty in their favor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a25db224-25a7-496c-b14c-99352582ca56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above $509.72, the BNB/USDT pair could start its northward journey toward $600. The rising 20-day EMA ($420) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $509.72, the pair may drop to the breakout level at $433 and consolidate between these two levels for a few days. A break and close below the 20-day EMA could result in a decline to $385.47 and then to the 200-day SMA ($358).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Aug. 23 candlestick shows that bears are attempting to stall the recovery in the $1.30 to $1.35 zone. This may have led to profit-booking from short-term traders, resulting in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($1.08).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/fad124f5-e701-453d-bc3e-7c62237f0b8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to aggressively defend the breakout level at $1.07. If the price rebounds off this support, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line and above it to $1.35. A breakout and close above this resistance will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $1.07, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.86). Such a move will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and the pair may trade in a range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on Aug. 24 and dropped to the 20-day EMA ($0.28). Although bulls have defended the support, the failure to achieve a strong rebound suggests a lack of aggressive buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/7dd88a61-82bd-473b-81ae-5cca7dce25b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the next support at $0.21. Such a move will suggest that the recent breakout above $0.29 was a bull trap. The pair could then remain range-bound between $0.21 and $0.29 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint also suggest a consolidation in the short term. Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the downtrend line, the pair may rally to $0.35. A breakout and close above this resistance could open the gates for an up-move to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Polkadot (DOT) above the overhead resistance at $28.60 for the past few days attracted profit-booking on Aug. 24. The price dropped close to the 20-day EMA ($23.84), but the buyers are attempting a rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a9f077bd-c0ae-4cd4-bab2-8de598dd1857.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now make one more attempt to thrust and sustain the price above the overhead resistance. If they manage to do so, the DOT/USDT pair will complete a V-bottom, which has a pattern target at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bounce fizzles out and bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then drop to $18 and remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is currently correcting the sharp up-move of the past few days. This suggests that traders are booking profits. The critical support to watch on the downside is the breakout level at $58.38.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/90fbf195-02f2-4eca-857d-33ef717dad2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($59) and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off $58.38, it will suggest that traders continue to accumulate on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $82 may start the next leg of the up-move. On the other hand, if the price turns down from $82, the SOL/USDT pair could remain range-bound for a few days. A break and close below $58.38 will suggest that bears are making a strong comeback.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-erases-btc-price-dip-but-48-2k-is-now-key-to-avoid-bull-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin erases BTC price dip but $48.2K is now key to avoid bull trap}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Uniswap (UNI) candlestick showed that bears continue to defend the overhead resistance at $30 on Aug. 23. That may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders on Aug. 24, which pulled the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/92f52205-bc24-4d70-bb9c-b05a36d4371a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to sustain the price above the moving averages, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $23.45. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that traders are buying on dips. That could keep the pair range-bound between $23.45 and $30 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a few days of consolidation. A breakout and close above the $30 to $31.25 overhead resistance zone will signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $700 to $714.76 overhead resistance and slipped below the 200-day SMA ($657) on Aug. 24. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($632), which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ff4cb11a-927d-42fa-bec8-c67c563c2d60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 200-day SMA, the BCH/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone. A breakout and close above this zone could open the doors for a rally to $806.87.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA and the $619 support, the pair could witness a deeper correction to $588 and then $550. Such a move will point to a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYzNiYzM0MDMtOTI3OC00YjcyLWEwYjAtOTM5ZmViNTUzODFlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210825eh8p000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin loses $48K as analysts eye next zones for a potential BTC price bounce\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has failed to quash resistance and BTC price action is targeting a retest of lower support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) headed down to test new support on Wednesday after a breakdown of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory sparked predictions of $44,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/995ec719-67ea-4fcf-81ba-132de611ab48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Old resistance provides a backdrop for BTC price rethink\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD losing around 2% overnight Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 A rejection after an attempt to reclaim $51,000 \u8212\'20\'14 the top of a key long-term resistance zone \u8212\'20\'14 saw Bitcoin pause for thought, beginning what analysts had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-classic-resistance-but-belief-in-a-fresh-btc-price-pullback-fading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 already said}}}\uc2  would be a well-earned correction.\par \par \uc2 For Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, $44,000 could be a useful floor should the downside continue.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAt this stage, $51,000 is a critical resistance zone; the area to watch for potential support can be found around $42,500\u8211\'20\'13$44,000,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0PJo8l8JM6g"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat is the level that we could be looking at for a rangebound construction, for some sideways action. We could still see $40,600 \u8212\'20\'14 previous resistance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Fellow trader Scott Melker, meanwhile, eyed a potential \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  U-turn already occurring on lower timeframes thanks to the relative strength index (RSI) trying to push out of \u8220\'20\'1Coversold\u8221\'20\'1D territory. This was aided by increasing on-chain volume, something required for reliable upside.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPotential \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence with RSI, coming out of oversold. Would confirm with a clear elbow up on RSI on the next close,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1430471118616506371/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  on the hourly chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo we wait. Low time frame, low strength signal, but compelling since it coincides with support.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A look at buy and sell levels on major exchange Binance confirmed $47,000 as the nearest strong support level among spot traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/95b61b84-5877-46f3-8802-3ef498c6fca4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 25. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Good times on hold for major altcoins\par \par \uc2 Altcoins continued their descent in line with Bitcoin on the day, in classic fashion often posting deeper losses.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-bitcoin-bulls-might-trample-50k-ahead-of-friday-s-2b-btc-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s why Bitcoin bulls might trample $50K ahead of Friday\u8217\'20\'19s $2B BTC options expiry}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) lost over 6% to near $3,000 support, while the top 10 cryptocurrencies\u8217\'20\'19 biggest loser was Solana (SOL), which shed close to 14%.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), despite trading 8% lower at $2.65, still preserved {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/number-of-cardano-millionaires-rises-by-173-after-ada-price-hit-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly gains}}}\uc2  of 34%.\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe added that a slow grind back up for Bitcoin would give altcoins room to outperform, this potentially penciled in for September or October.\par \par \uc2 More broadly, cryptocurrency markets are expected to put in a second major surge toward the end of the year, Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-data-suggests-bitcoin-could-see-btc-price-double-bubble-top-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOThmMzI4YmUtNzVhMC00YjMzLWExMWEtM2UzZmM0YWY3NzQyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210825eh8p0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 markets\par \b \uc2 Number of Cardano millionaires rises by 173% after  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price hits new highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 779 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano addresses with a balance greater than $1 million have surged 173% during the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rally.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) addresses with a balance greater than $1 million have surged 173% during {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-eyes-3-but-ada-chart-fractal-hints-at-a-potential-40-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the latest \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price rally}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-eyes-3-but-ada-chart-fractal-hints-at-a-potential-40-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-eyes-3-but-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -chart-fractal-hints-at-a-potential-40-correction}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Specifically, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate gained almost 200% after bottoming out at $1.007 on July 20. The pair reached its record high of $3.02 in the previous session, a move that was followed by a 6.42% price correction to $2.73 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the same period saw the total number of Cardano wallets that hold at least $1 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens surge from 3,625 to 9,830, per information {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/asset/cardano/charts/addresses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provided}}}\uc2  by data analytics platforms CoinMetrics and Messari.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/d013ef6c-6610-406e-9a5e-9405428c6e31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  addresses with balance greater than $1 million. Source: Messari, CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Additionally, against \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 1,455% year-to-date (YTD) gains, the total number of Cardano millionaires surged from 504 to 9,830 \u8212\'20\'14 a 1,850% jump. That coincided with erratic {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://trends.google.com/trends/explore?date=2021-01-01%202021-08-24&q=cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spikes}}}\uc2  in Google Trends searches for the keyword "Cardano," signaling retail interest.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the number of Cardano wallets holding more than $10 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens climbed from 504 on July 20 to almost 1,000. On Jan. 1, there were only 86 wallets with balances above $10 million.\par \par \uc2 Hodling makes Cardano investors rich\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise in 2021 also led to a spike in the sum of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-accelerates-among-whales-and-fish-with-btc-rallying-to-40k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unspent transaction outputs}}}\uc2 , or UTXOs.\par \par \uc2 UTXOs represent cryptocurrencies that have remained unspent in their crypto wallets after deposit. Therefore, if a blockchain network sees a rise in UTXOs, it indicates that most wallets are holding the cryptocurrency instead of transferring it to other addresses \u8212\'20\'14 i.e., a weaker selling sentiment.\par \par \uc2 CoinMetrics data fetched by Messari shows that Cardano's UTXO count surged from 816,600 on Jan. 1 to 2.85 million at the time of writing. That illustrates an incredible rise in Cardano investors' "hodling" sentiment, something that might have worked as a backstop to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 1,455% YTD rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ba67e321-3d06-4f11-bfab-045fef19bba4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  UTXO count. Source: CoinMetrics, Messari\par \par \uc2 The decision to hold instead of selling \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens found its cues in Cardano's potential to unseat its top blockchain rival, Ethereum, as the latter experienced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fallout-ethereum-fees-skyrocketed-as-traders-raced-to-unwind-leveraged-positions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 problems with network congestion and higher transaction fees}}}\uc2  at the beginning of this year.\par \par \uc2 For instance, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD surged 579% in the first quarter on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-is-now-a-top-three-cryptocurrency-as-ada-price-soars-27-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 optimism around its "Mary" upgrade}}}\uc2 , a protocol update that made Cardano a multi-asset blockchain. In doing so, the blockchain became compatible with host projects involved in the emerging decentralized finance (DeFi) and nonfungible tokens (NFTs) space.\par \par \uc2 The update, which went live on March 1, was followed up with another {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-s-market-cap-flips-bitcoin-cash-bch-after-ada-rallies-by-100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hard fork in July, called "Shelley."}}}\uc2  The new mainnet introduced Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s proposed proof-of-stake layer, allowing users to contribute to the transaction validation process either directly (by operating a stake pool) or indirectly (via delegation) in exchange for staking rewards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/495fb732-d2a1-454a-bca5-bb5b8831cf15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 But despite solid fundamentals, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD surged a mere 19.21% during the second quarter, partly due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitmain-ceases-bitcoin-miner-sales-to-aid-second-hand-sellers-following-china-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 China's crackdown}}}\uc2  on its regional cryptocurrency industry and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-and-bitcoin-a-toxic-relationship"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tesla CEO Elon Musk's}}}\uc2  anti-Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) tweets.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-chalks-a-bearish-wedge-as-ada-price-soars-by-over-100-in-q3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano chalks a \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  wedge as \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price soars by over 100% in Q3}}}\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the Cardano UTXO count kept surging during the second quarter's turbulence in the crypto market. It topped out at 2.93 million on July 26, when \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was changing hands for $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Smart contracts\par \par \uc2 The third quarter has witnessed Cardano finalizing its plans to become a smart contract platform similar to Ethereum via its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 so-called "Alonzo" upgrade}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch}}}\uc2 . As a result, speculative bids for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , alongside investors' hodling sentiment, have surged.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum TVL 114 billion, daily NFT over 100 million, daily transactions 1.2 million, 166 million addresses total. Plus first mover advantage and near universal acceptance of ETH and ETH standard tokens on exchanges and in defi.\par \par \uc2 Cardano has a lot of work to do post launch!\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Lark Davis (@TheCryptoLark) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheCryptoLark/status/1430017509323804674?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 24, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOGIzZjNiMzMtNTIyMy00ZDE5LWI4MWEtYTY3YmM4MWExMDkwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210824eh8o000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin returns to classic resistance, but belief in a fresh BTC price pullback is fading\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 345 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin repeats historical treatment of $50,000 as BTC price action calms.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stayed tantalizingly close to $50,000 on Tuesday as bulls contended with a classic resistance level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e50d065b-b832-4e07-ba57-6c15f36e0ecf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Too late for \u8220\'20\'1Cdirt cheap\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin?\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD holding necessary support levels for \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation through Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The pair had dipped to within the $48,000 range over the past 24 hours before exiting to the upside, with $49,000 now the level in line for retests.\par \par \uc2 For trader and analyst Rekt Capital, current behavior had plenty of historical context \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s first trip above $50,000 in February had also involved a focus on the $48,000\u8211\'20\'13$49,000 area.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC is still retesting this area in an uptrend, just like it did on those two occasions earlier this year,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1430141058323828760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  alongside a chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/7d958d96-63a4-413c-aa24-008fbfd43900.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: Rekt Capital/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to hold $50,000 straightaway this time around had disappointed some, some analysts were clear that the \u8220\'20\'1Cbargain\u8221\'20\'1D BTC buy levels had already come and gone.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou had 3 months to accumulate dirt cheap BTC. Fundamentals only strengthened,\u8221\'20\'1D William Clemente III {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1429599259259715588"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe market does not owe you any pullbacks right now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cardano leaves major altcoins in the dust\par \par \uc2 Middling action on Bitcoin, meanwhile, transferred to most altcoins on the day, with only Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) being a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-chalks-a-bearish-wedge-as-ada-price-soars-by-over-100-in-q3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noticeable exception}}}\uc2  to the rule.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bullish-cross-on-weekly-chart-paints-225k-btc-price-target-if-history-repeats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  cross on weekly chart paints $225K BTC price target if history repeats}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  were all but stationary over the past 24 hours as the markets waited for fresh directional cues.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/50k-btc-price-vs-the-fed-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the upcoming Federal Reserve Jackson Hole summit \u8212\'20\'14 tipped to provide information on coronavirus policy \u8212\'20\'14 could well be that sentiment mover in the coming days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMDE5NWZjMzUtOTNhMy00ZmRhLTk4N2UtOTFlOWJmNDA3YjI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210824eh8o0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional investors bet big on Solana, while BTC outflows persist\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 352 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Capital flowed out of institutional Bitcoin investment products for the seventh consecutive week while Solana saw a surge of inflows.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are loading up on Solana (SOL), with one-third of inflows to crypto investment products being invested in instruments tracking Solana this past week.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Monday \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinshares/vol-43-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-cd5ae7be4a1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , $7.1 million flowed into Solana investment products between Aug. 15 and Friday.\par \par \uc2 While the price of SOL gained a meager 1.4% on spot markets over the same period, SOL has gained 110% from $35.58 since the start of August to trade for $75 as of this writing.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 report notes that institutional crypto investment products bucked a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-see-4th-consecutive-weekly-outflows-as-institutions-diversify-holdings-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week trend of outflows}}}\uc2 , with roughly $21 million flowing into the sector this past week.\par \par \uc2 Products tracking Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) were the second-most popular for the week, with inflows totaling $6.4 million. Institutions also poured $3.2 million into products tracking Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), $1.8 million into \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and $1.1 million into Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ef7f3560-3900-414e-811b-6ef152617761.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flows by asset. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Institutional Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) products saw outflows of $2.8 million for the week \u8212\'20\'14 marking the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investment-products-still-suffering-outflows-despite-price-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh consecutive week}}}\uc2  of outflows for Bitcoin. BTC shed 6% over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pro-traders-are-mildly-skeptical-about-bitcoin-s-recent-return-to-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pro traders are mildly skeptical about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent return to $50K}}}\par \par \uc2 The report noted that the value of assets under management (AUM) by crypto investment product issuers increased to $57.3 billion as the markets rallied this week \u8212\'20\'14 its highest level since peaking at around $66 billion during the heights of the 2021 bull market in mid-May.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealth-managers-gain-exposure-to-bitcoin-via-grayscale-according-to-new-sec-filings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Leading institutional asset manager}}}\uc2  Grayscale represents three-quarters of the sector\u8217\'20\'19s AUM with $42.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 Flows across asset providers were mixed, however, with the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  XBT and ETC Issuance funds shedding $9.5 million and $9.4 million, while 21shares, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical and 3iQ posted inflows of $21.8 million, $14.7 million and $10.8 million, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTExNDMyZWItMWM4ZC00ZGZiLWI3MDYtZGNiMWEyMTczMGQ5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210824eh8o0005v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano chalks a  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  wedge as  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price soars by over 100% in Q3\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 922 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A recent rally in the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) market has activated a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern that threatens to lower its prices by as much as 15%.\par \par \uc2 The latest rally in the Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) market has activated a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern that threatens to lower its prices by as much as 15%.\par \par \uc2 Dubbed as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investopedia.com/articles/trading/07/rising_wedge.asp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rising wedge}}}\uc2 , the textbook pattern forms when the price consolidates between upward sloping resistance and support trendlines. Its occurrence typically prompts a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal, confirmed by a voluminous break below the lower trendline.\par \par \uc2 The profit target during such a negative move comes to be as below as the maximum wedge height.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD currently ticks all the boxes for forming a falling wedge pattern, as shown in the chart below. The pair now awaits a negative breakdown below its wedge support trendline, which may prompt a correction toward the 50-4H exponential moving average (50-4H EMA; the purple wave) around $2.45.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/01349d04-033f-4615-aa8e-0eed7498ab76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano 4H price chart featuring a potential rising wedge formation. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The said wedge target is a little over 15% below the current \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD rates (~$2.90).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce the target zone has been reached, it will show if Cardano manages to bounce from there or just sets up for further continuations to the downside,\u8221\'20\'1D corroborated Vince Prince, an independent market analyst, in a separate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/ADAUSD/zylrv5Oh-Cardano-Key-Ascending-Wedge-Reversal-Incoming/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  based on the same rising wedge pattern.\par \par \uc2 Prince\u8217\'20\'19s wedge target for the Cardano token was near $2.24.\par \par \uc2 Bulls eyeing massive \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  adoption\par \par \uc2 The downside outlook appeared after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-defies-peter-brandt-s-90-crash-warning-ada-price-doubles-to-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano surged by more than 100% quarter-to-date}}}\uc2 , hitting a record high of $2.97 on the Binance exchange on Monday.\par \par \uc2 Traders raised their bids for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD after Cardano creator Charles Hoskinson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 finalized integrating a long-awaited smart contracts feature}}}\uc2  on the Cardano blockchain via the \u8220\'20\'1CAlonzo\u8221\'20\'1D upgrade slated for Sept. 12.\par \par \uc2 The news raised hopes that Cardano would directly rival Ethereum, the biggest smart contracts platform, which has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-network-congestion-shuts-down-crypto-gaming-casino"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grappling with network congestion and higher fees}}}\uc2 . As a result, demand for Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native asset, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been steadily growing.\par \par \uc2 Now imagine how much {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  would pump if there were actual projects using their smart contracts.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Blackbeard (@crypto_blkbeard) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/crypto_blkbeard/status/1429556668392738824?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 22, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency market analyst Lark Davis {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheCryptoLark/status/1430017486909366275"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that if Cardano manages to reach the same market cap as Ether\u8217\'20\'19s, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price will surge to $10 per token. But he reminded that there were more players in the smart contracts ecosystem waiting to dethrone Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf it was just Ethereum vs Cardano it would be a much clearer battle of platforms,\u8221\'20\'1D Davis tweeted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut we also have BSC, Polygon, Solana, Terra, Avalanche, Zilliqa, Elrond, Polkadot, and many others looking for market share. Many of whom are much further ahead in terms of ecosystem building.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The analyst added that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD might see a pullback after Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s smart contracts launch, citing the popular \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the rumor sell the news\u8221\'20\'1D effect. He advised potential \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  buyers to wait for a correction.\par \par \uc2 At least one technical indicator also pointed toward an imminent correction in the Cardano market. Dubbed as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investopedia.com/terms/r/rsi.asp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index}}}\uc2 , the momentum indicator returned a reading above 70, noting that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s current valuation exceeds its demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ee1a84e0-423e-422d-bd6d-57a08228ecb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily relative strength indicator reading is 82.91. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin correlation\par \par \uc2 Another catalyst that appeared to have played a key role in sending \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD rates higher is Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The benchmark cryptocurrency {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bloomberg-strategist-explains-why-30-year-us-bonds-have-bullish-implications-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 typically acts as a trendsetter}}}\uc2  for rivaling digital assets. When it moves higher, most top altcoins follow suit; similarly, its decline prompts sell-offs across the rest of the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Data provided by Crypto Watch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that the one-year correlation efficiency between Bitcoin and Cardano is 0.40. This means there is a 40% likelihood that BTC/USD and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD will move in the same direction. Interestingly, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s correlation with Bitcoin is also one of the lowest among altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/de1b1797-a814-44bd-a23b-8bcbf0c36753.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin correlation with altcoins, including Cardano. Source: Crypto Watch\par \par \uc2 However, the Bitcoin\u8211\'20\'13Cardano correlation on a 30-day period comes to be 0.53. Meanwhile, the past 24 hours have revised the correlation to 0.60, showing that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD prices remain influenced by BTC/USD\u8217\'20\'19s interim price trends.\par \par \uc2 In detail, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has also rallied in the third quarter, up more than 47% at the time of writing. It recently reached a three-month high of $50,505 on the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  exchange and \u8212\'20\'14 like Cardano \u8212\'20\'14 started consolidating sideways near its local top.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-eyes-3-but-ada-chart-fractal-hints-at-a-potential-40-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano price eyes $3, but \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  chart fractal hints at a potential 40% correction}}}\par \par \uc2 But Dmitry Machikhin, CEO of Pressman Capital Investment Fund, noted that Cardano is forming a league of its own, given its lower correlation with Bitcoin compared to other altcoins. As a result, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rates might keep on climbing for the remainder of 2021 irrespective of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price trends.\par \par \uc2 He told Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDespite logging a new all-time high at $2.97, a yearly close of $5 cannot be ruled out irrespective of the direction of Bitcoin or other prominent altcoins.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYzUxYjUwNzQtN2JjNy00NzI5LTgwNTktNTY3Nzg5YmQ3ZDVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210824eh8o0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional investors bet big on Solana while BTC outflows persist\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 351 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Capital flowed out of institutional Bitcoin investment products for the seventh consecutive week while Solana saw a surge of inflows.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are loading up on Solana (SOL), with one-third of inflows to crypto investment products being invested in instruments tracking Solana this past week.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Aug. 23 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinshares/vol-43-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-cd5ae7be4a1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , $7.1 million flowed into Solana investment products between Aug. 15 and Aug. 20.\par \par \uc2 While the price of SOL gained a megre 1.4% on the spot markets over the same period, SOL has gained 110% from $35.58 since the start of August to trade for $75 as of this writing.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 report notes that institutional crypto investment products bucked a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-see-4th-consecutive-weekly-outflows-as-institutions-diversify-holdings-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week trend of outflows}}}\uc2 , with roughly $21 million flowing into the sector this past week.\par \par \uc2 Products tracking Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) were the second-most popular for the week with inflows totaling $6.4 million. Institutions also poured $3.2 million into products tracking Ethereum (ETH), $1.8 million into \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC), and $1.1 million into Polkadot (DOT).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ef7f3560-3900-414e-811b-6ef152617761.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flows by Asset: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Institutional BTC products saw outflows of $2.8 million for the week \u8212\'20\'14 marking the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investment-products-still-suffering-outflows-despite-price-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh consecutive week}}}\uc2  of outflows for Bitcoin. BTC shed 6% over the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pro-traders-are-mildly-skeptical-about-bitcoin-s-recent-return-to-50k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Pro traders are mildly skeptical about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent return to $50K}}}\par \par \uc2 The report noted that the value of assets under management (AUM) by crypto investment product issuers increased to $57.3 billion as the markets rallied this week \u8212\'20\'14 its largest level since peaking at around $66 billion during the heights of the 2021 bull market in mid-May.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealth-managers-gain-exposure-to-bitcoin-via-grayscale-according-to-new-sec-filings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Leading institutional asset manager}}}\uc2  Grayscale represents three-quarters of the sector\u8217\'20\'19s AUM with $42.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 Flows across asset providers were mixed however, with the Coinshares XBT, ETC Issuance funds shedding $9.5 million and $9.4 million, while 21shares, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical and 3iQ posted inflows of $21.8 million, $14.7 million and $10.8 million respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNTExNDMyZWItMWM4ZC00ZGZiLWI3MDYtZGNiMWEyMTczMGQ5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210824eh8o00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,862 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins are likely to move higher even as Bitcoin price takes a breather after hitting $50,000 for the first time in months.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-tags-50k-for-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rallied above the psychological hurdle}}}\uc2  at $50,000 today for the first time since May 15. The sharp rally of the past few days has turned the sentiment \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  with many expecting the resumption of the bull run.\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Digital co-founder Anthony Pompliano told CNBC on Monday that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bullish-cross-on-weekly-chart-paints-225k-btc-price-target-if-history-repeats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could make a blow-off top}}}\uc2 , similar to the one seen in 2017 when the price had surged from \u8220\'20\'1C$10,000 to $20,000 in 18 days.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ae0e137f-ba31-4174-b6e5-c74c1de9b80c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index has risen to 79, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/50k-btc-price-vs-the-fed-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicating extreme greed}}}\uc2 . Just a month back, the indicator was showing a reading of extreme fear at 22. This shows how the sentiment has changed completely within a few days.\par \par \uc2 In other news, on August 22, \uc2 PayPal\uc2  announced that it will provide cryptocurrency services to the residents of the United Kingdom. This step increases the penetration of digital assets because \uc2 PayPal\uc2  has over 2 million active users in the U.K.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins continue their up-move or will profit-booking set in? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading inside a rising wedge pattern for the past few days. The bulls flipped the $48,000 level to support on Aug. 22 and pushed the price above the psychological level at $50,000 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/866dfa4c-611d-41d9-9b79-e5befaaab9b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could now rise to the resistance line of the wedge where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls because if it cracks, the pair could start a deeper correction to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the wedge, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may rally to the $58,000 to $60,000 resistance zone. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) advance at the overhead resistance at $3,335 on Aug. 21 but the bulls did not allow the price to sustain below $3,200. This suggests that sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9649e8bb-0d3e-4a83-999f-8f664b7cc1e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $3,335. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could resume its uptrend and rally to $3,670 and then to the psychological level at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair may drop to $3,000. If this level holds, the pair may consolidate between $3,000 and $3,335 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below $3,000 will be the first sign that bulls are losing their grip. That may result in long liquidation, dragging the price down to the 50-day simple moving average ($2,547).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days. After hesitating near the previous all-time high at $2.47 on Aug. 20 and 21, the bulls resumed the rally on Aug. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3502ff30-8cf4-433e-9fb8-425fb00bd1de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target objective on the upside is the psychological barrier at $3. Vertical rallies are rarely sustainable, hence the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may enter a minor consolidation or correction near $3.\par \par \uc2 If bulls can flip the $2.47 into support during the next pullback, it will signal strength. That will increase the likelihood of the resumption of the uptrend. The next target on the upside is $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink and sustain the price below $2.47, it will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the overhead resistance at $433 on Aug. 20, indicating the start of a new uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level on Aug. 22 and trap the aggressive bulls but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/72553f76-babc-4efe-8b19-d21a3460c4c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls resumed their buying today and pushed the price above the minor resistance at $460. The BNB/USDT pair may face minor resistance at $520 but if bulls can overcome this hurdle, the next stop could be $600.\par \par \uc2 On the way down, the critical level to watch is $433. If this level holds, the trend will continue to favor the bulls. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $433. Such a move will suggest that supply exceeds demand.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s recovery at $1.28 on Aug. 21 but the shallow correction on Aug. 22 indicates that bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry. The bulls will now try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6b48a872-b666-43ab-8279-079cc86ad769.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the next stiff resistance at $1.66. The bears had aggressively defended this resistance in May, hence the pair may again witness a minor correction or consolidation near it.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $1.35, the pair could drop to $1.07. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between the two levels for a few more days. The trend may turn in favor of the bears if the price slips and sustains below $1.07.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the breakout level at $0.29 hit a wall at $0.33 on Aug. 20. This suggests that bears have not given up and are attempting to stall the recovery. The price is currently stuck between the breakout level at $0.29 and the overhead resistance at $0.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/790ab01b-42c7-4f81-a27a-eefb8bc13d73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($0.28) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If the price sustains above $0.29 for a few more days, the buyers will again try to resume the uptrend by thrusting the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.35.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could start its journey toward the next target objective at $0.45. This level may again pose a stiff challenge for the bulls. The trend will indicate weakness if the price slips and sustains below $0.29.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at the $28.60 level for the past three days. Although bulls pushed the price above the resistance on Aug. 21, they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ff23aa1b-a379-4b6d-8abd-e3c9f49a91b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Aug. 22 candlestick suggests that bulls are buying on dips. They will make one more attempt to clear the obstacle at $28.60. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair will complete a V-shaped bottom. The pattern target of this setup is $46.83.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($23.40). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that sentiment remains positive. The bulls will then try to push the price above $28.60 and start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) hit a new all-time high at $82 on Aug. 21 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that traders are booking profits after the sharp rally of the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8cb14863-035c-4e15-a99f-37752176619f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $68. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. If they drive the price above $82, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $100.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the support at $68 cracks, the pair could retest the breakout level at $58.38. If bulls flip this level into support, the pair may consolidate the gains for a few days before trying to resume the up-move. However, if bears pull the price below $58.38 it will suggest a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/google-bans-8-deceptive-crypto-apps-from-play-store"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Google bans 8 \u8216\'20\'18deceptive\u8217\'20\'19 crypto apps from Play Store}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $30 on Aug. 21, suggesting that bears are defending this level aggressively. Although sellers tried to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($27.11) on Aug. 22, the bulls had other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2d798e40-a96e-4ea5-8c71-f93506ad0c85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The UNI/USDT pair again rebounded off the 20-day EMA, suggesting that the sentiment remains positive and bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The bulls will now again try to push the price above the $30 to $31.25 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could start a new uptrend that could reach $37 and then $45. On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead zone and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may drop to $23.45.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $23.45 and $30 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to defend the zone between $700 and $714.76 but the positive sign is that the bulls are not buckling under pressure and are buying Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) on dips to the 20-day EMA ($630).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6813366b-5f82-4fbe-91a0-1d8c49294fcd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $714.76, the BCH/USDT pair could rally to $806.87 and then to $864.28. This zone is likely to act as stiff resistance but if bulls do not give up much ground, the possibility of a break above $864.28 increases.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or $714.76, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($541).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNmRhZTE4YWYtZDBkYi00YThiLThjYTAtNThmNmIwMWM2YzllLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 $50K BTC price vs. the Fed \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,303 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is back above $50,000 as Fed comments near and concerns over BTC market strength mount.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is back at $50,000 as a new week gets underway with a bang.\par \par \uc2 After a strong weekend, Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-tags-50k-for-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 finally crossed the long-awaited $50,000 mark}}}\uc2  overnight on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 Along with a firm sense of d\u233\'00\'E9j\u224\'00\'E0 vu, traders are naturally curious as to what will happen next \u8212\'20\'14 and crucially whether Bitcoin has bitten off more than it can chew with its latest price surge.\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s annual Jackson Hole summit lined up this week, macro triggers could combine with internal sources of contention to spark a hectic week for cryptocurrency markets.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at five BTC price factors worth considering in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 $50,000 Bitcoin: What could go wrong?\par \par \uc2 There was no shortage of concern about Bitcoin failing to crack $50,000 this weekend.\par \par \uc2 Everything from low volumes to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wyckoff distribution event was visible on social media from those unconvinced of market strength.\par \par \uc2 In the event, however, Bitcoin clipped and held the psychologically significant price level in classic fashion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf btc can break out from here. People over trading will lose their Btc and hodlers will win,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1429475715775410181"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  in one of their various tweets Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI said this one other time before it did a relentless 6x. Know when to trade and when not to trade. All you have to do is do nothing. My strat is to do nothing when it happens.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Pentoshi channeled various references to Q4 2020, hinting at similarities between market composition now and the start of the main phase of the latest Bitcoin bull run.\par \par \uc2 This \u8220\'20\'1Cspringboard\u8221\'20\'1D was also apparent when BTC/USD hit $50,000 for the first time in February \u8212\'20\'14 but it took time for the level to become firm support and provide the foundation for a trip to current all-time highs of $64,500.\par \par \uc2 As such, should BTC/USD see a fresh pullback, it will likely be fleeting, Pentoshi argues.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CProbably won\u8217\'20\'19t be much looking back if any,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1429478969133387777"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRight now is all about accumulation. When markup begins there is only vertical accumulation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8472e715-9a5c-431e-a178-be573562e259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Tapering rumors fly as virtual Fed summit nears\par \par \uc2 Macro cues will likely all come from the U.S. Fed this week.\par \par \uc2 The annual Jackson Hole gathering of top financial figures \u8212\'20\'14 now set to be virtual \u8212\'20\'14 is rumored to focus extensively on economic policy changes stemming from the coronavirus pandemic.\par \par \uc2 Specifically, markets will want to know whether any tapering of asset purchases is on the cards, and when that might take place.\par \par \uc2 With such a move priced in to some extent, only something unexpected could send markets spinning, analysts suggest.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re still very, very dovish. They\u8217\'20\'19re slightly less dovish,\u8221\'20\'1D Garrett Melson, a portfolio strategist at Natixis Investment Managers Solutions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/fed-does-tapering-doesnt-really-163048103.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Yahoo Finance last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut that\u8217\'20\'19s a little semantics at this point. Taper is very well documented and well known. We know it\u8217\'20\'19s coming. It\u8217\'20\'19s just a matter of timing and really shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t surprise many investors out there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Stocks were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slides-with-s-p500-as-fed-signals-tapering-120b-monthly-bond-purchases"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 already weakening}}}\uc2  at the end of last week thanks to tapering fears, with the start of trading in the U.S. yet to come at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, gold, which suffered heavily this month while Bitcoin surged, has made up for much of its recently lost ground.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/unstable-bitcoin-price-to-pivot-investment-flow-to-gold-mining-chief-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , gold bugs remain convinced that the precious metal will continue to attract investment in the long term, with safe-haven seekers staying away from Bitcoin due to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Has China hastened a Bitcoin price top?\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s spot price action has failed to impress you, there is little debate about the strength of its network fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 The hash rate and difficulty, months into a broad recovery, outdid themselves over the past week.\par \par \uc2 Versus last Monday, the hash rate has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-eyes-50k-breakout-despite-most-greed-since-all-time-highs-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  8 exahashes per second (EH/s), estimates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miningpoolstats.stream/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 show}}}\uc2 , equating to a roughly 5% overall increase in computing power dedicated to mining.\par \par \uc2 At 121 EH/s, the hash rate is thus just 47 EH/s away from the all-time highs seen before the China mining rout took hold in May.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin hash rate is continuing its recovery from one of the largest infrastructure displacements in modern history\u8212\'20\'14with roughly 45% of the Bitcoin mining industry, billions of dollars, relocating continents as the network on continued as normal,\u8221\'20\'1D popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account Documenting Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DocumentingBTC/status/1428041797272539139"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin had zero downtime.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2b111a51-3853-4d2f-90a0-68d378a2d460.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin difficulty chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchain.com/charts/hash-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Not only zero downtime but zero loss of demand \u8212\'20\'14 with the return of hashing power has come difficulty adjustments, which have only served to strengthen network security and increase competition, all as planned.\par \par \uc2 With that, the difficulty is set to increase a third time in a row in two days\u8217\'20\'19 time, this time by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 around 9%}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 a post-China high.\par \par \uc2 This is firmly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the ears of those worried about long-term faith in mining profitability and likewise the role that China played in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s operation.\par \par \uc2 However, comparing this year\u8217\'20\'19s post-halving bull run to previous ones, one commentator highlighted a potential point of concern.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAround 120k-138k blocks AFTER miner capitulation bottom in each bear market, bitcoin has topped out,\u8221\'20\'1D Parabolic Trav {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/parabolictrav/status/1429233440205983749"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C120k-138k blocks builds up miner inventory enough (after they hodl for a while) to crush the market with. This cycle China exodus forced inventory to market early. Implications?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Should the China episode have hastened the bull run this time around, a potential second price peak could likewise come earlier than many anticipate. As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-data-suggests-bitcoin-could-see-btc-price-double-bubble-top-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , however, theories contend that 2021 will mimic 2013 in producing a \u8220\'20\'1Cdouble bubble\u8221\'20\'1D type of BTC price top with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-uptrend-can-create-a-2013-style-btc-price-double-pump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two peaks}}}\uc2 , the second of which coming at the end of the year or perhaps even later.\par \par \uc2 Exchange flows return to dominate\par \par \uc2 On the topic of 2020 comparisons, meanwhile, there is another trend clearly repeating last year\u8217\'20\'19s bull run \u8220\'20\'1Cspringboard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange reserves have dropped heavily in recent weeks after China temporarily reversed the overall downtrend.\par \par \uc2 While exhibiting mixed behavior throughout 2021, investors are now withdrawing BTC in large enough quantities for those withdrawals to dominate the landscape, on-chain analytics firm Glassnode noted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin exchange flows have returned to a dominance of outflows through August as investors withdraw BTC,\u8221\'20\'1D it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/glassnode/status/1428183127319478275/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  late last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe market has transitioned through a number of phases of exchange flow dominance over the last year, with outflow dominance last seen in late 2020.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This ties in with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/large-hodlers-accumulate-bitcoin-below-50k-as-btc-transactions-over-1m-soar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 popular narrative}}}\uc2  focusing on accumulation at current price levels, suggesting overwhelming faith in higher prices still to come.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ddbba1c6-5d3b-466d-9d35-9010110f7019.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange balance change annotated chart. Source: Glassnode/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CExtreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D heightens its grip\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CExtreme\u8221\'20\'1D emotions are back in the picture among crypto investors.\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2 , which this week is firmly within its \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-avax-cake-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, CAKE, ATOM}}}\par \par \uc2 While not quite at the top of its 0\u8211\'20\'13100 scale, the Index now measures 79/100, just 15 points away from typically \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  peaks, which preclude major price corrections.\par \par \uc2 The pace of change in Fear & Greed has been intense \u8212\'20\'14 just three weeks ago, it measured 42/100, denoting \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D as the overall market emotion.\par \par \uc2 Monday\u8217\'20\'19s reading is thus the highest since mid-April, when Bitcoin was at its current all-time highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/81dbd139-8967-4625-9a8b-fc29a321f45e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMzYwMjY5MzgtMWVjZC00Y2MwLWE5MjYtMGFjYjMzYzI0NzgxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price tags $50K for first time since May\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 311 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin price reclaimed the major psychological milestone of $50,000 Sunday evening as the crypto markets continue to recover.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price was back on the offensive late Sunday, touching $50,000 for the first time since May and signaling that the bull market was fast approaching its second leg.\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price peaked at $50,270.00 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , having gained 3% on the day, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscriptions.cointelegraph.com/sign-up/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2 . The largest cryptocurrency has a total market capitalization of $943 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3bff0dc1-ed34-4e3a-b4a1-1f449e39885f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price briefly wicks above $50,000 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  : Cointelegraph Markets Pro\par \par \uc2 On-chain metrics recently suggested that a supply squeeze may be imminent, with long-term holders and institutions bolstering their BTC holdings, while prices remained at a discount. A series of higher lows and a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-attacks-last-resistance-before-50k-with-btc-price-daily-close-now-crucial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive daily close}}}\uc2  signal have carried the momentum for BTC since trading in the low $30,000 range.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index, which is based on a multifactorial sentiment analysis, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flipped}}}\uc2  from \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D in less than a month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b3066068-8520-4097-ac7c-6622849fda0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sentiment has flipped positive this month. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market appears to have turned a corner this month, with the combined crypto capitalization currently hovering at roughly $2.2 trillion, according to CoinGecko. By contrast, the combined crypto capitalization dropped below $1.3 trillion during the depths of July\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market action.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-cap-returns-to-2t-for-the-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market cap returns to $2T for the first time since May}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin initially led the crypto market recovery earlier this month, many altcoins have since surged. At the time of writing, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-is-now-in-price-discovery-as-sol-shows-strength-below-70-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana}}}\uc2  (SOL) were all boasting double-digit gains for the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYmE4ZThkYTgtODY1ZS00NTc5LWE1MzMtMTA2ZDA1MTFlZWRiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n0005u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano price eyes $3, but  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  chart fractal hints at a potential 40% correction\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 618 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price topped out at $2.899, raising anticipations that it would easily close above $3 in the coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 Cardano blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s native asset, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , reached a new record high on Monday as investors pinned hopes on an upcoming smart contracts feature that expects to boost the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s adoption.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate topped out at $2.899 around 9:00 am UTC, raising anticipations that it would easily close above $3 in the coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 Many analysts, including pseudonymous chartist PostyXBT, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PostyXBT/status/1429712345463459845"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that the Cardano token had entered a \u8220\'20\'1Cprice discovery mode.\u8221\'20\'1D Meanwhile, David Gokhshtein {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/davidgokhshtein/status/1429622925280399361"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hinted}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD might continue its bull run until Sep. 12, the day Cardano is going to integrate a smart contracts feature to its blockchain via the \u8220\'20\'1CAlonzo\u8221\'20\'1D upgrade.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  is just a monster right now.\par \par \uc2 I\u8217\'20\'19m trying to figure out it\u8217\'20\'19s price before 9/12/2021.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 David Gokhshtein (@davidgokhshtein) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/davidgokhshtein/status/1429622925280399361?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 23, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 In detail, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alonzo upgrade}}}\uc2  introduces a native smart contracts development language called Plutus to the Cardano ecosystem. Plutus is already available for testing and brings functional programming to smart contract creation to everyday users.\par \par \uc2 As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls anticipate the token\u8217\'20\'19s adoption to boom in the sessions ahead as Cardano attracts decentralized application developers \u8212\'20\'14 operating in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-regulation-must-not-kill-the-values-behind-decentralization"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emerging decentralized finance}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoin-roundup-here-s-a-few-things-to-consider-when-buying-nfts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nonfungible token}}}\uc2  sectors \u8212\'20\'14 to its smart contracts ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Overbought risks\par \par \uc2 But Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s technical indicators predict a short-term shock, something that might have the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD corrected lower by as much as 40% despite maintaining its long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano token\u8217\'20\'19s daily {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investopedia.com/terms/r/rsi.asp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index}}}\uc2  (RSI) has ventured deeper into overbought territory, at around 83. Traders consider an RSI reading above 70 as overvalued. As a result, it prompts them to sell the asset to secure maximum profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/5d76cd4b-f3f9-4005-b787-f8a0a5b9d888.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart featuring RSI correction fractal. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 For instance, a run-up in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD rates in the first quarter of 2021 pushed its RSI reading above 90. Later, the pair started consolidating sideways while maintaining support near its 50-day exponential moving average (50-day EMA; the scarlet wave).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-defies-peter-brandt-s-90-crash-warning-ada-price-doubles-to-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano defies Peter Brandt\u8217\'20\'19s 90% crash warning, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price doubles to new high}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price now sits atop 114% month-to-date and 1,511% year-to-date profits. At the same time, an oversold RSI pictures an interim profit-taking scenario. So if the Q1/2021 fractal repeats, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s next line of support comes to be near its 50-day EMA at $1.73, almost 40% below the current prices of $2.83.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  Alonzo fork is in less than 3 weeks. Allegedly 100+ launches coming\par \par \uc2 And a major Summit\par \par \uc2 My first targets are going to be above $3 for TP1\par \par \uc2 I don\u8217\'20\'19t know how high this goes in price discovery so will just play it as we go. Exciting weeks ahead {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/47tnpZS3Rw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/47tnpZS3Rw}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/0ZRUZrMcpy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/0ZRUZrMcpy}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi Wont DM You (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1428408116161429516?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 19, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 But a correction won\u8217\'20\'19t necessarily exhaust Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook. Given the potential success of its Alonzo upgrade, the project could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-avax-cake-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 end up attracting more speculative upside bids}}}\uc2  for its \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token. As a result, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate expects to remain in price discovery mode.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNjg3NjZlYjctYTVkNC00MTE4LWE0MDctMjBkMDgyNjBhMDk4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 $50K BTC price vs. the Fed \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,297 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is back above $50,000 as Fed comments near and concerns over BTC market strength mount.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is back at $50,000 as a new week gets underway with a bang.\par \par \uc2 After a strong weekend, Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-tags-50k-for-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 finally crossed the long-awaited $50,000 mark}}}\uc2  overnight on Aug. 22.\par \par \uc2 Along with a firm sense of deja vu, traders are naturally curious as to what will happen next \u8212\'20\'14 and crucially whether Bitcoin has bitten off more than it can chew with its latest price surge.\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s annual Jackson Hole summit lined up this week, macro triggers could combine with internal sources of contention to spark a hectic week for cryptocurrency markets.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at five BTC price factors worth considering in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 $50,000 Bitcoin: What could go wrong?\par \par \uc2 There was no shortage of concern about Bitcoin failing to crack $50,000 this weekend.\par \par \uc2 Everything from low volumes to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wyckoff distribution event was visible on social media from those unconvinced of market strength.\par \par \uc2 In the event, however, Bitcoin clipped and held the psychologically significant price level in classic fashion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf btc can break out from here. People over trading will lose their Btc and hodlers will win,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1429475715775410181"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  in one of various tweets Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI said this one other time before it did a relentless 6x. Know when to trade and when not to trade. All you have to do is do nothing. My strat is to do nothing when it happens.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Pentoshi channeled various references to Q4 2020, hinting at similarities between market composition now and the start of the main phase of the latest Bitcoin bull run.\par \par \uc2 This \u8220\'20\'1Cspringboard\u8221\'20\'1D was also apparent when BTC/USD hit $50,000 for the first time in February \u8212\'20\'14 but it took time for the level to become firm support and provide the foundation for a trip to current all-time highs of $64,500.\par \par \uc2 As such, should BTC/USD see a fresh pullback, it will likely be fleeting, Pentoshi argues.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CProbably won\u8217\'20\'19t be much looking back if any,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1429478969133387777"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRight now is all about accumulation. When markup begins there is only vertical accumulation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8472e715-9a5c-431e-a178-be573562e259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Tapering rumors fly as virtual Fed summit nears\par \par \uc2 Macro cues will likely all come from the U.S. Fed this week.\par \par \uc2 The annual Jackson Hole gathering of top financial figures \u8212\'20\'14 now set to be virtual \u8212\'20\'14 is rumored to focus extensively on economic policy changes stemming from the Coronavirus pandemic.\par \par \uc2 Specifically, markets will want to know whether any tapering of asset purchases is on the cards, and when that might take place.\par \par \uc2 With such a move priced in to some extent, only something unexpected could send markets spinning, analysts suggest.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey're still very, very dovish. They're slightly less dovish," Garrett Melson, a portfolio strategist at Natixis Investment Managers Solutions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/fed-does-tapering-doesnt-really-163048103.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Yahoo! Finance last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut that's a little semantics at this point. Taper is very well documented and well known. We know it's coming. It's just a matter of timing and really shouldn't surprise many investors out there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Stocks were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slides-with-s-p500-as-fed-signals-tapering-120b-monthly-bond-purchases"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 already weakening}}}\uc2  at the end of last week thanks to tapering fears, with the start of trading in the U.S. yet to come at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Gold, which suffered heavily this month while Bitcoin surged, has meanwhile made up for much of its recently lost ground.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/unstable-bitcoin-price-to-pivot-investment-flow-to-gold-mining-chief-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , gold bugs remain convinced that the precious metal will continue to attract investment in the long term, with safe-haven seekers staying away from Bitcoin due to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Has China hastened a Bitcoin price top?\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin spot price action has failed to impress you, there is little debate about the strength of its network fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 Hash rate and difficulty, months into a broad recovery, outdid themselves over the past week.\par \par \uc2 Versus last Monday, the hash rate has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-eyes-50k-breakout-despite-most-greed-since-all-time-highs-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  8 exahashes per second (EH/s), estimates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miningpoolstats.stream/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 show}}}\uc2 , equating to a roughly 5% overall increase in computing power dedicated to mining.\par \par \uc2 At 121 EH/s, the hash rate is thus just 47 EH/s away from the all-time highs seen before the China mining rout took hold in May.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin hash rate is continuing its recovery from one of the largest infrastructure displacements in modern history\u8212\'20\'14with roughly 45% of the Bitcoin mining industry, billions of dollars, relocating continents as the network on continued as normal,\u8221\'20\'1D popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account Documenting Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DocumentingBTC/status/1428041797272539139"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin had zero downtime.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2b111a51-3853-4d2f-90a0-68d378a2d460.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin difficulty chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchain.com/charts/hash-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain}}}\par \par \uc2 Not only zero downtime, but zero loss of demand \u8212\'20\'14 with the return of hashing power has come difficulty adjustments, which have only served to strengthen network security and increase competition, all as planned.\par \par \uc2 With that, the difficulty is set to increase a third time in a row in two days\u8217\'20\'19 time, this time by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 around 9%}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 a post-China high.\par \par \uc2 This is firmly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the ears of those worried about long-term faith in mining profitability, and likewise the role that China played in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s operation.\par \par \uc2 However, comparing this year\u8217\'20\'19s post-halving bull run to previous ones, one commentator highlighted a potential point of concern.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAround 120k-138k blocks AFTER miner capitulation bottom in each bear market, bitcoin has topped out,\u8221\'20\'1D Parabolic Trav {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/parabolictrav/status/1429233440205983749"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C120k-138k blocks builds up miner inventory enough (after they hodl for a while) to crush the market with. This cycle China exodus forced inventory to market early. Implications?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Should the China episode have hastened the bull run this time around, a potential second price peak could likewise come earlier than many anticipate. As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-data-suggests-bitcoin-could-see-btc-price-double-bubble-top-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , however, theories contend that 2021 will mimic 2013 in producing a \u8220\'20\'1Cdouble bubble\u8221\'20\'1D type BTC price top with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-uptrend-can-create-a-2013-style-btc-price-double-pump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two peaks}}}\uc2 , the second coming at the end of the year or perhaps even later.\par \par \uc2 Exchange flows return to dominate\par \par \uc2 On the topic of 2020 comparisons, meanwhile, there is another trend clearly repeating last year\u8217\'20\'19s bull run \u8220\'20\'1Cspringboard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange reserves have dropped heavily in recent weeks after China temporarily reversed the overall downtrend.\par \par \uc2 While exhibiting mixed behavior throughout 2021, investors are now withdrawing BTC in large enough quantities for those withdrawals to dominate the landscape, on-chain analytics firm Glassnode notes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin exchange flows have returned to a dominance of outflows through August as investors withdraw BTC,\u8221\'20\'1D it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/glassnode/status/1428183127319478275/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  late last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe market has transitioned through a number of phases of exchange flow dominance over the last year, with outflow dominance last seen in late 2020.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This ties in with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/large-hodlers-accumulate-bitcoin-below-50k-as-btc-transactions-over-1m-soar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 popular narrative}}}\uc2  focusing on accumulation at current price levels, suggesting overwhelming faith in higher prices still to come.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ddbba1c6-5d3b-466d-9d35-9010110f7019.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange balance change annotated chart. Source: Glassnode/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 "Extreme greed" heightens its grip\par \par \uc2 "Extreme" emotions are back in the picture among crypto investors.\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2 , which this week is firmly within its \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-avax-cake-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, CAKE, ATOM}}}\par \par \uc2 While not quite at the top of its 0-100 scale, the Index now measures 79/100, just 15 points away from typically \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  peaks which preclude major price corrections.\par \par \uc2 The pace of change in Fear & Greed has been intense \u8212\'20\'14 just three weeks ago, it measured 42/100, denoting \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D as the overall market emotion.\par \par \uc2 Monday\u8217\'20\'19s reading is thus the highest since mid April, when Bitcoin was at its current all-time highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/81dbd139-8967-4625-9a8b-fc29a321f45e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMzYwMjY5MzgtMWVjZC00Y2MwLWE5MjYtMGFjYjMzYzI0NzgxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price tags $50K for first time since May\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 309 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin price reclaimed the major psychological milestone of $50,000 Sunday evening as the crypto markets continue to recover.\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price was back on the offensive late Sunday, touching $50,000 for the first time since May and signaling that the bull market was fast approaching its second leg.\par \par \uc2 The BTC price peaked at $50,270.00 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , having gained 3% on the day, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscriptions.cointelegraph.com/sign-up/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2 . The largest cryptocurrency has a total market capitalization of $943 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3bff0dc1-ed34-4e3a-b4a1-1f449e39885f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin price briefly wicks above $50,000 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  : Cointelegraph Markets Pro\par \par \uc2 On-chain metrics recently suggested that a supply squeeze may be imminent, with long-term holders and institutions bolstering their BTC holdings while prices remained at a discount. A series of higher lows and a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-attacks-last-resistance-before-50k-with-btc-price-daily-close-now-crucial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive daily close}}}\uc2  signal have carried momentum for BTC since trading in the low $30,000 range.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index, which is based on a multifactorial sentiment analysis, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flipped}}}\uc2  from \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D in less than a month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b3066068-8520-4097-ac7c-6622849fda0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sentiment has flipped positive this month. Source: alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market appears to have turned a corner this month, with the combined crypto capitalization currently hovering at roughly $2.2 trillion, according to Coingecko. By contrast, the combined crypto caplitazation dropped below $1.3 trillion during the depths of July's \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market action.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-cap-returns-to-2t-for-the-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market cap returns to $2T for the first time since May}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin initially led the crypto market recovery earlier this month, many altcoins have since surged. At the time of writing, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/search?q=dot+cointelegraphj&rlz=1C1FHFK_enCA938CA938&oq=dot+cointelegraphj&aqs=chrome..69i57j0i5i13i30.6629j0j4&sourceid=chrome&ie=UTF-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot}}}\uc2  (DOT) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-is-now-in-price-discovery-as-sol-shows-strength-below-70-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana}}}\uc2  (SOL) were all boasting double-digit gains for the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYmE4ZThkYTgtODY1ZS00NTc5LWE1MzMtMTA2ZDA1MTFlZWRiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210823eh8n00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, CAKE, ATOM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,703 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to encounter resistance at the $50,000 level, but the rounding bottom pattern seen in most altcoins is a signal that traders intend to push prices higher.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is knocking at the doors of the key $50,000 level and most traders are still optimistic even after the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallied 70% from the July 20 low at $29,278 to an intraday high at $49,757.04 on Aug. 21.\par \par \uc2 Monitoring resource Material Indicators pointed to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-prepares-for-50k-showdown-as-futures-traders-turn-modestly-bearish-on-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lot of puts at the $50,000 strike price}}}\uc2  and the \u8220\'20\'1Cpositive funding almost across the board (overheated),\u8221\'20\'1D which suggests a rejection at the current levels and a \u8220\'20\'1Cpullback going into September.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3d8b4a2a-7887-43a2-a270-eaeca1ed6b3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Nikita Ovchinnik, chief business development officer of 1inch Network said that several new i {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-appear-bullish-on-crypto-despite-record-bitcoin-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nstitutional investors had taken exposure to crypto}}}\uc2  in the past year, and that \u8220\'20\'1Cthey didn't come for short-term gains.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign for the crypto sector is the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/unicorns-in-crypto-a-growing-herd-of-billion-dollar-crypto-companies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ever-growing list of unicorns}}}\uc2 . Analysts expect more companies to join the list as the adoption of crypto and blockchain increases.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hesitation near the $50,000 mark may shift focus to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that are likely to attract traders' attention in the short term.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average ($45,049) on Aug. 19 and the bulls pushed the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $48,144 on Aug. 20. The bears are currently attempting to stall the up-move at the psychological resistance at $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/4a58ee3d-4b5f-4595-86ed-3f4f9bd316d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not give up much ground and flip the $48,144 level to support, it will indicate strength. The BTC/USDT pair could then pick up momentum and start its northward march toward $58,000.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears pull the price below $48,144, the pair could drop to the 200-day simple moving average ($45,816). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could embolden the bears.\par \par \uc2 The sellers will then try to sink the price below the breakout level at $42,451.67. If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2401055c-adc8-4815-a8c6-74853773fb17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears are aggressively defending the zone between $49,500 and $50,000. If they can sink the price below the 20-EMA, the pair could drop to $46,600 and then to $44,000.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip and the pair could then remain range-bound between $44,000 and $50,000 for a few days. The bears will have to pull the price below $42,451.67 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bulls pushed the price above the all-time high at $2.47 on Aug. 20 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed selling at higher levels. The altcoin formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 21, indicating indecision among bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1a19729b-c0fd-48d7-97f4-8b01983b432f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty resolved to the upside today as the bulls have again pushed the price to a new all-time high. If buyers sustain the price above the breakout level at $2.47, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $3.\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. They will try to pull the price back below $2.36 and trap the aggressive bulls. If that happens, the pair may correct to $2.20.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $2.20, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above the $2.47 to $2.65 will enhance the prospects of the continuation of the uptrend. Alternatively, a break below $2.20 could pull the price down to $1.94.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/0c5b396d-0b10-4e5a-b473-ab001e3962b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the 20-EMA is sloping up but the RSI is forming a negative divergence. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be slowing down. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-EMA.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will suggest strength. That could attract further buying and the pair may then rally to the psychological resistance at $3.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) rallied from $18.41 on Aug. 17 to $50.27 on Aug. 21, a 173% rally within a short time. This sharp up-move has pushed the RSI above 92, indicating the rally is over-extended in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/285dbc73-bec5-4b4d-9c66-0181766dccd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AVAXUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Aug. 21 candlestick shows that bears are attempting to defend the psychological resistance at $50. On the downside, the first support is at $40. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that bulls are not booking profits aggressively as they anticipate the rally to continue further.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $44 could improve the prospects of a retest of the all-time high at $60.30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bears pull the price below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $38.09, the AVAX/USDT pair could correct to the 50% retracement level at $34.34. A break below this support will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may have weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/82ac279f-52e3-4e85-9d76-3774f71bac5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AVAXUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that bears are attempting to stall the relief rally at the overhead resistance at $44.60 and the bulls are buying on dips to $40. This suggests that the pair could remain range-bound between these two levels in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls drive the price above $44.60, the pair could rally to $50.27. A breakout and close above this level will signal the resumption of the uptrend. Conversely, a break below the 20-EMA will indicate that traders are booking profits and not buying the dips. That could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 CAKE/USDT\par \par \uc2 PancakeSwap (CAKE) is currently in a strong recovery. Sustained buying by the bulls pushed the price above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $22.74 on Aug. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8f2495f5-a615-48a1-8b74-78ca34396b27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CAKE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CAKEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $22.74, the relief rally could reach the 50% retracement level at $26.85 and then the 61.8% retracement level at $30.96. The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance in this zone.\par \par \uc2 On the way down, the critical support to watch out for is the 20-day EMA ($20.37). If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a further decline to $16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c2b317f4-4e2a-4c17-bf0e-b9ab4d5cbda0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CAKE/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CAKEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the price is trading inside a rising wedge pattern. If bears sustain the price below the 20-EMA, the pair may drop to the support line of the wedge. This level is likely to act as a strong support and a sharp rebound off it will indicate that traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $24.65 will suggest the resumption of the up-move. The next target objective on the upside is the resistance line of the wedge. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if bulls thrust the price above the wedge.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/08/21/walmart-dogecoin-foundation-coinbase-war-chest-hodlers-digest-aug-15-21"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Walmart seeks crypto product lead, Dogecoin Foundation returns, Coinbase amasses $4B war chest: Holder\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Aug. 15-21}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USD\par \par \uc2 Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) had been trading in a large range between $8.51 and $17.56 since late May. The bulls pushed the price above the resistance of the range on Aug. 18, clearing the path for a possible move to the pattern target at $26.61.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/cd2c2346-de87-44eb-bdea-df138b6f5884.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ATOMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick and the RSI above 83 suggests the rally is overextended in the short term. This could attract profit-booking by the bulls, resulting in a minor correction or consolidation in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not give up much ground and flip the $17.56 level into support, the ATOM/USDT pair will again try to resume the uptrend. A break above $26.61 could open the doors for a rally to $28 and then to $30.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $17 to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1aad9674-d2b1-4e20-808f-1cad2d29c044.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ATOMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that bears are mounting a stiff resistance near $24. Although bulls had pushed the price above this resistance, they could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that buyers are not dumping their positions in a hurry. The pair could consolidate between $21 and $24 for some time. A breakout and close above $24 will indicate strength and signal the resumption of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break below the 20-EMA will indicate the start of a deeper correction to $17.56.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYmQ0OTczYmItYjJjMy00MzVkLWFhOGItYTNmMzQ1N2E3MWU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210822eh8m000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 Institutions appear  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  on crypto despite record Bitcoin outflows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anupam Varshney \par \uc2 1,556 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite Bitcoin posting its sixth consecutive week of institutional outflows, sentiment around the future of the asset class appears on the rise.\par \par \uc2 At the start of 2021, the cryptocurrency industry was bursting with news of increased institutional investment, and this is still largely true. Despite reports suggesting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investment-products-still-suffering-outflows-despite-price-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased outflows from institutional investors}}}\uc2 , net inflows are still very much positive. Additionally, though Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) appears to be the investment of choice for liquidations, institutional investment into Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has never been healthier.\par \par \uc2 From Wall Street hedge funds to major banks, large-scale investors are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-are-buying-bitcoin-like-it-s-late-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hopping aboard the crypto train}}}\uc2 . Bitcoin's fall from its all-time high at $65,000 placed doubt in the minds of all cryptocurrency investors, though that could be changing as its price has since started to recover.\par \par \uc2 BTC accounts for over 44% of the total $2 trillion \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market capitalization, while Ethereum stands at around 18%. Back in May, the number of addresses holding more than 1,000 BTC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lookintobitcoin.com/charts/wallets-greater-than-1000-btc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fell}}}\uc2  to around 2,100 from the 2,500 mark seen in February, according to blockchain data analytics firm CoinMetrics. However, most indicators point to institutions increasing their overall holdings.\par \par \uc2 According to Nikita Ovchinnik, chief business development officer of the decentralized platform 1inch Network, \u8220\'20\'1CThere is no doubt that institutional investors have a long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  approach to crypto and Bitcoin specifically.\u8221\'20\'1D Long term, he also said that the key obstacle for institutions would lie in the technology itself.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDue to its architecture, DLT works in a unique way that differs from the established IT and financial product infrastructure. It would certainly require some adjustments and updates in order to onboard more entities into crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D He added further:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe number of institutional investors that have exposure to crypto has risen dramatically over the last year, and they didn't come for short-term gains.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 International investment banks and financial services companies like \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 , BlackRock, \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  and \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2  have all {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.in/stock-market/news/jpmorgan-and-morgan-stanley-are-eyeing-bitcoin-here-are-the-big-wall-street-names-warming-to-cryptocurrencies/slidelist/80929415.cms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 set up}}}\uc2  Bitcoin-related services and funds over the last few months. After reaching a peak of $40 billion in April, the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 , one of the largest institutional investors in the space, reported that its total assets under management fell to $20 billion in July before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1428093914486132741"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbing}}}\uc2  back to nearly $41 billion amid the recent rally.\par \par \uc2 With concerns of a regulatory crackdown on \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges and service providers, as well as China's stance on Bitcoin trading and mining, there are enough reasons for traditional investors to be hesitant to enter the market. However, the recent pushback above the psychological mark of $40,000 could be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-data-suggests-bitcoin-could-see-btc-price-double-bubble-top-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a sign that the sentiment is recovering}}}\uc2 . The real question is, what will the institutions do next?\par \par \uc2 ETH and flow\par \par \uc2 One of the biggest reasons investors have flocked to Bitcoin over the last two years has been the rising inflation rate of the U.S. dollar. Amid the ongoing COVID-19 crisis, the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has printed trillions in the name of stimulus checks, pushing concerned investors to look for other places to park their capital.\par \par \uc2 In mid-August, Bitcoin reported its sixth consecutive week of institutional outflows, with over $22 million in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.financemagnates.com/cryptocurrency/news/crypto-investment-products-see-22-million-worth-of-weekly-outflows/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liquidations}}}\uc2  in a single week. This marks the longest period of outflows for the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 2018. Still, the total assets under management for \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products rose 10% in the same week, though this was primarily due to price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, multi-asset products appear much less uncertain about their direction, with institutional investors increasing their holdings by $7.5 million and attracting nearly $12 million through inflows over the last month. In contrast, over the same period, Bitcoin funds have experienced almost $68 million in outflows.\par \par \uc2 All of this points to institutions diversifying their holdings into other digital assets besides Bitcoin, with altcoins like Ethereum, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) also seeing increased inflows. While BTC outflows may be higher than ever, institutional investments into digital assets are higher this year than ever before.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe undeniable pattern is that institutional interest and participation in the field continues to rise,\u8221\'20\'1D said Jack Tao, CEO of a Singapore-based cryptocurrency exchange Phemex in a conversation with Cointelegraph, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CThis is despite the periods of high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  that crypto veterans are used to but may be undesirable to traditional investors.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He also stated that the DeFi space was still in its early phases of adoption and that while some technologies and applications are already in place, we're still only seeing the tip of the iceberg. \u8220\'20\'1CSmart institutional investors can sense the change coming and wish to position themselves squarely as beneficiaries for what's to come,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CThe final use cases that blockchain will address hasn't even been imagined yet.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Investing in digital assets as an institution is very different from retail purchases. Despite most crypto-positive institutions already trading on forex markets, they face risks that are very different from traditional systems. Finding differences in spot prices can become a costly ordeal, and since they end up trading with unknown counterparties, factors such as technological reliability and liquidity depth are far more critical than usual.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is still a long way to go,\u8221\'20\'1D Daniel Santos, CEO of Woonkly Labs\u8217\'20\'19 automated market maker, defi.finance, told Cointelegraph: \u8220\'20\'1C[Institutions] don\u8217\'20\'19t just need regulated products, but also easy-to-use products that are tailored specifically to their needs.\u8221\'20\'1D He added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInstitutions are looking for products that enable them to invest in DeFi safely with peace of mind. I believe they\u8217\'20\'19re taking a long-term approach, and they are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDeFi attracts a lot of attention,\u8221\'20\'1D said Yves Longchamp, head of research at SEBA Bank, a FINMA licensed digital assets bank. As Longchamp told Cointelegraph, institutional investors are focused on three main factors, including adding yield to their portfolios \u8212\'20\'14 a source of revenue that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t exist in traditional finance.\par \par \uc2 Despite consistent Bitcoin outflows, institutions appear to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as ever about the digital assets space. Recently, the global professional financial intermediary network, TP ICAP, announced that it would be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/finance/news/exclusive-icap-launch-crypto-trading-070319960.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAAJP_j_nIRRmq27SajlwF0zmxF35DAADZ6Q6R_HQWdOYaZRVpZnbfs9RFmgX5N0FDfuu8jg3_gDMNlxzM21O3OPmdRFluSh5_nlN8MX2nylyxgj74wZmMez37y04DDd_K0eE33D3apGsMJ1_zdrj2nkEJAU4k-XESVuxYP4zIpUGI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launching}}}\uc2  a cryptocurrency trading platform along with industry giants Standard Chartered and \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Though it seems that big money is entering the industry with confidence, bringing their capital into the space, price appreciation could take a back seat as \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  becomes a more prominent concern for institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 Institutional intrigue\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency adoption is rising faster than ever before with previously less proactive markets seeing increased movement, while the more actively participating regions grapple with broader changes and regulatory issues.\par \par \uc2 According to director of financial markets at \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange OKEx Lennix Lai, the main concerns are around Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and tax evasion, as he told Cointelegraph: \u8220\'20\'1CWe see regulatory acceptance as a key obstacle to the market as a whole, yet market size and integrity are also challenges.\u8221\'20\'1D According to Ovchinnik, since \u8220\'20\'1Cthe majority of protocols are completely permissionless, there is always a possibility of becoming a counterparty to some kind of criminal.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, he also added that these issues are being ironed out by development teams at the protocol level, taking pre-emptive measures to ensure their regulatory approval in the long run. This could become a significant factor for institutional investors entering the space, who are required to strictly adhere to regulations and the decisions of their governing political authorities.\par \par \uc2 According to chief operating officer at Huobi Trust Robert Whitaker, institutions are happy with Bitcoin and are starting to create market offerings around it. \u8220\'20\'1CInstitutions are still aggregating a significant amount of BTC for their own needs and on the balance sheets,\u8221\'20\'1D he told Cointelegraph, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CThis may easily drive the markets to sustain two to three trillion in valuation over the next year or so.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-race-to-50k-heats-up-as-solid-institutional-backing-continues"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's race to $50K heats up as solid institutional backing continues}}}\par \par \uc2 With net positive inflows into digital assets, the possibilities are endless for blockchain technology. The opportunities in this space are seemingly unending, and even the smallest ones can be immensely profitable. While Ocvhinnik believes institutions will focus more on cross-chain Layer-one solutions, Tao says there will be more focus on decentralizing traditional financial services and exploring more experimental aspects of the industry like NFTs and GameFi.\par \par \uc2 According to Rachid Ajaja, CEO of AllianceBlock, a decentralized capital market, decentralized finance, or DeFi, offerings are expanding into more traditional structured products like product wrapping and structured loans. \u8220\'20\'1CWe are in a very exciting time,\u8221\'20\'1D he told Cointelegraph, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CThe shift towards DeFi is happening right now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The biggest challenge will be finding a balance between the industry's ethos of decentralization and achieving the level of compliance governments seek. For now, while the two forces seem fundamentally opposed to each other, a more robust solution will likely arise soon, as more lawmakers and government leaders educate themselves about cryptocurrencies and the technology behind them.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  in digital assets is a net positive,\u8221\'20\'1D said CEO of Bitstamp exchange Julian Sawyer in a conversation with Cointelegraph, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CBy separating good actors from the bad, building more trust with investors and holding companies responsible for their actions through clearer guidelines, regulatory interest means credibility and growth for the whole industry.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNmQ4NTY4OTItNDgwMC00YWQyLWI5YzgtYzI1MmQwZjhjYWNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210822eh8m0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin prepares for $50K showdown as futures traders turn 'modestly  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2 ' on BTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 470 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin nears $50,000 amid \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signs from BTC futures.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) edged closer to $50,000 on Aug. 22 as concerns over a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  downturn made a timely reappearance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/0560e40f-e80a-439a-af7c-29392b779314.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "Modestly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 " signs accompany $50,000 run-up\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hitting a high of $49,830 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  Sunday \u8212\'20\'14 itself a three-month record.\par \par \uc2 The weekend had proven the staying power of higher levels, with even lower volumes failing to spark a comedown.\par \par \uc2 "So far, so good for BTC," trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1429154829830660104"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, as $50,000 loomed, concerns began to mount about the overall strength of the market.\par \par \uc2 As noted by monitoring resource Material Indicators, trader habits were hinting at belief in lower levels returning. One futures setup involved $32,000 and $34,000 for the August and September end-of-month settlements respectively.\par \par \uc2 This, the account {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1429181307473563655"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 , was "modestly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "In addition, we still have a lot of 50k puts, suggesting we get rejected here," it added, also highlighting the "overhepositive funding rates across trading platforms.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/11dbcdc4-a166-4221-a11a-54cf4fae126c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin funding rates chart. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 Such a perspective naturally grates with the overall consensus among analysts, notably with the stock-to-flow models and their creator's "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worst case scenario}}}\uc2 " for minimum prices each month.\par \par \uc2 For August, this stands at $47,000, while September's $43,000 expectation is only lower for technical reasons, PlanB explained this week.\par \par \uc2 September $43K floor / worst case is not a typo. The small dip is caused by the data. However, it is a worst case estimate, my base case is of course the S2F estimate. Also, October $63K worst case / floor is more in line again. So Sep is just a data blip, nothing to worry about. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/tj6SSwSzKR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/tj6SSwSzKR}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 PlanB (@100trillionUSD) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1427300104608919556?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 16, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 $50,000 points way to all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Similarly optimistic, but just as level-headed, was the popular trader known as John Wick on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-20-btc-eth-ada-bnb-xrp-doge-dot-sol-uni-bch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/20: BTC, ETH, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, BCH}}}\par \par \uc2 "So far a bit of supply front running fears of $50k distribution," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ZeroHedge_/status/1429172881792061444"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  as part of comments on Bitcoin tackling the signficiant $50,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 "If we can get past this area of resistance I'll feel even more confident about ATH's this year."{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ZeroHedge_/status/1429172881792061444/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/ZeroHedge_/status/1429172881792061444/photo/1}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e302dff0-1e23-401e-80f0-73da48eb78aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: John Wick/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 AT the time of writing, BTC/USD traded at just above $49,000 ahead of the return of professional traders and institutions Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYTNkNTgyNDYtMzYwNC00NTI1LWI3NTEtMGYxNjc5NDBmOThlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210822eh8m0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price returns above $47K as crypto market shrugs off Binance KYC news\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 422 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price action flips above $47,000 in the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) abruptly exited lower levels to challenge firm resistance on Friday in further inspiration for bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/839f4f21-0ed0-41dc-8c9b-9c7780f530cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin coils up beneath major sell wall\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hitting local highs of $47,415 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  overnight on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The pair had received a welcome boost from news of a Bitcoin fund launch from \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2 , which fuelled 24-hour gains of over 5%.\par \par \uc2 Now, Bitcoin was primed to challenge established resistance levels at $47,000 and higher \u8212\'20\'14 these nonetheless keeping bulls in check at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 For popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital, a key support area to watch was now broader \u8212\'20\'14 between $44,000 and $46,500.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC successfully Daily Closed above orange, which has led price to immediate resistance at the Lower High (black),\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1428623636181786627/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented }}}\uc2  on an accompanying chart showing the relevant price zones.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$BTC could get rejected from here, even if just for a small dip to retest the top of the orange area as support.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e3cb8428-49da-4a59-a824-ee043ceb98a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ) with price levels. Source: Rekt Capital/\uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) with price levels. Source: Rekt Capital/\par \par \uc2 A subsequent dip below $47,000 did not last long, with momentum still in evidence as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-holds-44k-support-in-great-sign-for-bitcoin-bulls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $48,000 sell wall }}}\uc2  loomed.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin was unimpacted by news that major exchange Binance would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-binance-users-are-now-subject-to-immediate-kyc-verification"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enforce }}}\uc2  identification measures for all users beginning in September.\par \par \uc2 Strength in the United States dollar, traditionally a problematic event for short-term price action, also failed to dampen the enthusiasm.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC is surprisingly strong while DXY is ripping higher,\u8221\'20\'1D trader Crypto Ed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1428607805741752321"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  in comments on the situation.\par \par \uc2 Cardano outshines in top 10 altcoins\par \par \uc2 Similar strength was observed as a knock-on effect for altcoins, with Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) once again returning to outshine market heavyweight Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gains-strength-as-friday-s-600m-btc-options-expiry-approaches"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin gains strength as Friday\u8217\'20\'19s $600M BTC options expiry approaches }}}\par \par \uc2 The latter nonetheless achieved daily gains above 6%, while Cardano was up 18% at the time of writing, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-defies-peter-brandt-s-90-crash-warning-ada-price-doubles-to-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbing above $2.50 }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  and Polkadot (DOT) both managed 10% returns.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2b8a26ff-5537-406f-9226-01f12a3979f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market capitalization stood at over $2 trillion once more Friday amid the broader altcoin comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMzM2YjI1ZTItOTMxNy00OGEyLTg5YTEtM2Y0Y2NmOTY2OTA2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210820eh8k0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/20: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, DOT, SOL, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,927 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has resumed its move toward $50,000 and this is likely to send altcoin prices higher.\par \par \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2 , in partnership with NYDIG and alternative assets manager FS Investments, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wells-fargo-files-for-bitcoin-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 registered a new investment fund}}}\uc2  dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CFS NYDIG BITCOIN FUND I,\u8221\'20\'1D which will offer the bank\u8217\'20\'19s wealthy clients an opportunity to gain indirect exposure to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 In another sign of growing institutional interest, filings submitted to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission by BlackRock show a 6.71% stake in \uc2 Marathon Digital Holdings\uc2  and a 6.61% stake in \uc2 Riot Blockchain\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-etfs-hold-384-million-of-shares-in-bitcoin-mining-firms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock\u8217\'20\'19s total investments}}}\uc2  in both the publicly traded Bitcoin mining firms are roughly valued at $384 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/effec766-e4aa-4ca8-a0cc-598d05654323.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brian Armstrong\uc2  announced on Aug. 20 that the company\u8217\'20\'19s board had approved a proposal to add {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-announces-500m-crypto-buying-spree-pledges-to-invest-10-of-future-profits-into-digital-assets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $500 million worth of crypto to the balance sheet}}}\uc2  and allocate 10% of the profits earned into crypto purchases in the future.\par \par \uc2 With this move, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  will become the first publicly-traded company to hold Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), decentralized finance tokens and proof-of-stake assets on its balance sheet.\par \par \uc2 The institutional interest in crypto continues to grow and that may bode well for the sector in the future. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and determine the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had been witnessing a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears near the 200-day simple moving average ($45,692) for the past few days. The bears pulled the price below the 200-day SMA on Aug. 17 but they could not break the 20-day exponential moving average ($44,183) support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6ebf16f6-5939-46e0-a363-1ee2725ce595.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying at the 20-day EMA pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA on Aug. 19. The rising 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought territory indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $48,144, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $51,500 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If bulls can arrest the subsequent decline above the 200-day SMA, it will signal strength and increase the prospects of the continuation of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $51,500 could lay the tracks for a possible up-move to $60,000. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the breakout level at $45,451.67.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether turned down from $3,335 on Aug. 16 and the bears tried to pull the price below the breakout level at $3,000 on Aug. 17 and 18. Although the price dipped below this support, the bears could not sustain the lower levels, indicating strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c4ae6eed-860a-453c-8c1f-54b1260da428.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($2,981) on Aug. 19, suggesting that bulls are aggressively defending this support. The buyers will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $3,335. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its journey toward $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $3,335, the pair could again drop to $3,000 and consolidate in this tight range for a few more days. A break and close below $3,000 will be the first sign that bulls are losing their grip. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($2,311).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls flipped the $1.94 level to support on Aug. 17 and 18. This attracted further buying and the bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the all-time high at $2.47 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/4fc892c0-d739-4fbd-a230-5c1e121da11e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now rally to $2.73 where it is again likely to face stiff resistance from the bears. If bulls bulldoze their way through this resistance, the pair could reach the psychological barrier at $3.\par \par \uc2 Although the trend favors the bulls, the RSI near 80 shows the rally is overextended in the short term. If the price slips and sustains below $2.47, the bears will try to pull the pair down to $2.20. A break below this level will suggest that the momentum has weakened in the short term. The pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA ($1.87).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $433 on Aug. 17 but the bulls did not allow the price to break below the 20-day EMA ($384).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/fcbf40f0-cdec-4d84-8867-25abc8324ab9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA has pushed the price above the stiff resistance at $433. If bulls sustain the price above $433, the BNB/USDT pair could start its northward march toward $520 and then to $600.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could result in a decline to $340.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the downtrend line of the descending channel and the overhead resistance at $1.07 on Aug. 13, which completed a rounding bottom pattern. The bears tried to pull the price back below $1.07 but the bulls foiled their attempt.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1d3365d3-0d50-4201-a43d-f96be0b2c7d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rebound off $1.07 on Aug. 18 shows that the bulls successfully flipped this level into support. The XRP/USDT pair could now rally to $1.70. This level could act as stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this hurdle, the pair may rally to $1.96.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $1.35, the bears will try to pull the pair below $1.07 and the 20-day EMA ($1.01). If they succeed, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.84). Such a move will suggest that traders offloaded their positions at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the $0.29 resistance on Aug. 14, which cleared the path for a rally to $0.35. The bears mounted a stiff resistance at this level on Aug. 16 and pulled the price back to the breakout level at $0.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/609dd451-19bf-49fc-806d-c16463fa0c2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the breakout level at $0.29 on Aug. 21, suggesting that the sentiment is positive. If buyers thrust the price above $0.35, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the next overhead resistance at $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or $0.35, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA ($0.27). If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to the next support at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 200-day SMA ($27.52) on Aug. 17 but the correction was short-lived as the bulls bought the dip on Aug. 18. The buyers have pushed the price above the 200-day SMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9b377b34-fe71-4ee5-9428-5a00de1ef16b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair will complete a V-shaped bottom if it rises and closes above the $28.60 resistance. This setup has a target objective at $46.83.\par \par \uc2 However, such a move may not be easy because the RSI has risen deep into the overbought territory, indicating that the rally is overextended in the short term. That could result in a minor correction or consolidation in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($21.86), the bulls will again try to propel the price above $28.60. Alternatively, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the pair may extend its range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) rose above the $44 resistance on Aug. 13. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level on Aug. 14 but failed to sustain the lower levels. This shows that bulls were in no hurry to dump their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/dc59785f-497f-4d00-b427-03018ab30ca8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair broke above the all-time high at $58.38 on Aug. 16 and has continued its journey higher. The strong rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI above 89, suggesting that the up-move is overextended in the short term.\par \par \uc2 This could result in a few days of consolidation or a minor correction where the price may retest the breakout level at $58.38. If bulls flip this level into support, the rally may resume and reach the psychological mark at $100.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $58.38 to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-attacks-last-resistance-before-50k-with-btc-price-daily-close-now-crucial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin attacks last resistance before $50K with BTC price daily close now crucial}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $30 attracted profit-booking, which dragged the price lower on Aug. 16. Although bears pulled the price below the moving averages on Aug. 18 and Aug 19, they could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/0ea27acb-a09c-4881-a58c-43b5902f6886.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rebound off the 20-day EMA ($26.60) on Aug. 19 suggests that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will now again try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $30.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could start a new uptrend. The first target on the upside is $37 and if this level is crossed, the pair could retest the all-time high at $45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $30, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below this level could pull the price down to $23.45.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 200-day SMA ($651) on Aug. 13 but the bulls could not build upon this advantage. Sensing an opportunity, the bears pulled the price back below the 200-day SMA on Aug. 17 but could not crack the support at the 20-day EMA ($613).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9e8e2032-9821-4a62-943c-712170128636.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA on Aug. 19 and will now try to thrust the BCH/USDT pair above $714.66.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to $800 and then to $864.28. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to $546.83.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMzg0YTNmZWEtZGRjYy00ZWRlLWI0MGEtYWQwMTVjNDQ0YjE1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210820eh8k000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin attacks last resistance before $50K with BTC price daily close now crucial\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 438 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin targets $50,000 as a new BTC price surge takes hold.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) climbed to new multi-month highs later on Aug. 20 as an extended rebound took hold of crypto markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/307f1528-5f68-4828-a520-9030e683ddc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Daily close "most important" for Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirmed that BTC/USD hit its highest level since mid May during Friday\par \par \uc2 After daily gains of almost 7%, Bitcoin saw a sudden surge to hit $48,630 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  at the time of writing, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-returns-above-47k-as-crypto-market-shrugs-off-binance-kyc-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  momentum}}}\uc2  still in action.\par \par \uc2 The move meant the largest cryptocurrency took its best swipe yet at a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-can-see-55k-breakout-if-last-major-btc-price-resistance-is-broken-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large sell wall}}}\uc2  that had been in place for much of August. Beyond it, little stands in the way of upside beyond $50,000, Cointelegraph reported.\par \par \uc2 "Daily Close is most important now," trader and analyst Rekt Capital said as part of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1428728984221720579"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comments}}}\uc2  on the latest price action.\par \par \uc2 He added that the daily close would also determine a breakout from a rising wedge construction that has characterized Bitcoin for the past two weeks.\par \par \uc2 A look at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1428719200537829386"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance highlighted the decreasing power of the sell wall, which was previously much denser and provided a firm barrier between spot price and $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/4eadcf90-c1c5-41ee-bb06-e489961c32eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 20. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Ethereum sees "phenomenal" buy side activity\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, it was hard to find a single bear in the house Friday as sentiment firmly favored a reclaim of the $50,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sub-zero-interest-gbtc-hits-biggest-discount-since-may-bitcoin-price-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sub-zero interest? GBTC hits biggest discount since May Bitcoin price crash}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-eyes-50k-breakout-despite-most-greed-since-all-time-highs-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , fundamentals and on-chain metrics favor continued upside for Bitcoin, with many echoing the scenario in late 2020, just before the main phase of the current bull run took hold.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin feels like it could rocket through $50,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Dan Held (@danheld) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/danheld/status/1428728254219829252?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 20, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins likewise benefited from the positivity, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) still {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-defies-peter-brandt-s-90-crash-warning-ada-price-doubles-to-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outperforming}}}\uc2  the top ten with 20% daily gains.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), which traded below $3,000 earlier in the week, more than made up for lost ground, targeting $3,300 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 "Phenomenal buy-side pressure on $ETH from the Weekly Higher Low," Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1428730470926270468"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "ETH has returned to the very same resistance it was rejected from earlier this week."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c01440fe-72e8-463b-a5fb-43dc0cd89890.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvOGQyODViMjktOGY5Mi00MGNhLWJkZGUtNGY1ZTg3NDQwZGYyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210820eh8k0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 Bitcoin's race to $50K heats up as solid institutional backing continues\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,082 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 There is enough evidence to suggest that the market may be primed for another bull run in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has been surging recently and there\u8217\'20\'19s one cryptocurrency \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 leading the way. After having suffered through \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the better part of the last 60-some days, the flagship crypto has showcased a high level of recovery, even breaking past its 200-day moving average earlier this month, suggesting that a move to the $50,000 psychological barrier may be in the cards soon.\par \par \uc2 To really put things into perspective, over the last month alone, BTC has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 registered}}}\uc2  gains of more than 55%, helping to take the total market capitalization of this relatively nascent space back beyond the $2 trillion threshold. These startling figures can, in large part, be attributed to increased institutional adoption that has been witnessed in relation to this industry in the recent past.\par \par \uc2 In this regard, some of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s most significant institutional backers include \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2 -led \uc2 Microstrategy\uc2 , EV manufacturer Tesla and crypto-focused investment firms Galaxy Digital Holdings and Voyager Digital. Additionally, even a number of traditional banking institutions have entered the crypto fray recently. \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2 , one of the oldest banks in the United States, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wells-fargo-files-for-bitcoin-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is the newest member}}}\uc2  of a list of growing financial institutions to offer its wealthy clients indirect exposure to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Other prominent financial institutions that also offer a range of crypto-focused financial offerings include \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 , BNY Mellon, \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 , \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  and \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 , among many others.\par \par \uc2 Lastly, according to recent filings made with the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC), a growing list of wealth management companies \u8212\'20\'14 such as Illinois-based Clear Perspective Advisors and Ohio-situated \uc2 Ancora Advisors\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 have been acquiring sizable sums of Grayscale's \uc2 Bitcoin Investment Trust\uc2  (GBTC) shares, signaling a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealth-managers-gain-exposure-to-bitcoin-via-grayscale-according-to-new-sec-filings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing demand for the asset}}}\uc2  among institutional players.\par \par \uc2 What to expect?\par \par \uc2 Providing his take on when he sees Bitcoin scaling up to the $50,000 mark, Iqbal Gandham, VP of Transactions for security and infrastructure solutions provider Ledger, told Cointelegraph that when crossing significant price milestones, there is always a pause \u8212\'20\'14 much like the one we are witnessing now \u8212\'20\'14 so that the market can stabilize:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe longer we hold it here the more support it will gather. As for factors that will drive this run, I really feel it's more psychological rather than news-driven. People are just waiting for a trend, so any slightly positive news could cause the price to move dramatically. It's not a matter of if anymore, just a when.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Daniele Bernardi, CEO of fintech management company Diaman Group, told Cointelegraph that his company\u8217\'20\'19s proprietary indicators are all extremely positive regarding BTC\u8217\'20\'19s near-term growth. In his personal view, however, the next wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market growth will not purely be driven by Bitcoin, but rather by alt-assets such as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cordano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy point of view is that it is actually more important to focus on altcoins for a while. We can expect a reduction of Bitcoin dominance for some months,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Lastly, according to Talal Tabbaa, chairman and co-founder of CoinMENA \u8212\'20\'14 an FTX-backed Middle East-based cryptocurrency exchange \u8212\'20\'14 even though Bitcoin could be trading at $50,000 in the coming few days, such short-term price action is quite irrelevant when looking at the grand scheme of things:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTechnical analysis has limitations and shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be solely used for decision making. I actually think it crazy that some people think they can draw lines on a chart and predict the future. Macro events like China banning mining or the US hopefully approving ETFs will have much bigger impacts on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short term movements than any technical analysis.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cgold cross\u8221\'20\'1D spotted suggesting solid near-term price action\par \par \uc2 Despite there being some uncertainty over the last few months in terms of where the crypto sector may be headed, there is enough evidence to suggest that the market may be primed for another bull run in the near term. In this regard, blockchain analytics platform Glassnode recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://studio.glassnode.com/metrics?a=BTC&category=Market%20Indicators&ema=0&m=indicators.HashRibbon&mScl=lin&resolution=1h&s=1470894344&u=1628574344&zoom=1825"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that a \u8220\'20\'1Cgolden cross\u8221\'20\'1D formation \u8212\'20\'14 between the 30-day and 60-day moving averages of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hash ribbon \u8212\'20\'14 has been recently observed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/9526e6f8-6fe2-4b7b-a7eb-37aa794be5eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 A golden cross is observed when the short-term average value of an asset rises above that of its average value in the long term. As can be seen from the chart above, the comparison between BTC\u8217\'20\'19s 30- and 60-day hash ribbons indicates that trading volumes are on the rise once again. It is also important to highlight that the same formation was spotted before Bitcoin rallied back in January 2019 and 2020, and in March 2020 and December 2020.\par \par \uc2 Lastly, Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s reported hash rate suggests that miners who may have been forced to move their operations from China \u8212\'20\'14 following the country\u8217\'20\'19s recent regulatory tightening \u8212\'20\'14 may have finally established their bases elsewhere. In this vein, it should be noted that just over a fortnight or so ago, five North American mining operators \u8212\'20\'14 including Marathon Digital, \uc2 Riot Blockchain\uc2 , Bitfarm, \uc2 Argo Blockchain\uc2  and Hut8 \u8212\'20\'14 reported {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.in/investment/news/crypto-markets-are-recovering-and-mining-companies-in-north-america-are-raking-in-the-gains/articleshow/85237637.cms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessing}}}\uc2  a 58% increase in their operational output.\par \par \uc2 Other factors affecting BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price action\par \par \uc2 Recently, Elon Musk made a U-turn in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-says-bitcoin-may-have-already-hit-his-benchmark-on-renewable-energy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his outlook regarding Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , after having slighted the premier crypto earlier this year regarding its adverse environmental impact, thus giving investors \u8212\'20\'14 who follow the Dogefather\u8217\'20\'19s every word \u8212\'20\'14 more fuel to become \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. Not only that, Twitter CEO Jack Dorsey and Ark Invest\u8217\'20\'19s Cathie Wood recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-says-bitcoin-may-have-already-hit-his-benchmark-on-renewable-energy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 confirmed}}}\uc2  their long-term investment in the premier crypto.\par \par \uc2 On BTC\u8217\'20\'19s increasing adoption, a spokesperson for cryptocurrency exchange Bitstamp told Cointelegraph that the number of active retail female investors has grown more than 24% in the last six months:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe share of the trading volume generated by female investors at \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  has increased by an astonishing 58% in that same time, pointing to a surge of new investors interested in cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Lastly, with a growing list of countries \u8212\'20\'14 most prominently El Salvador \u8212\'20\'14 starting to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/07/20/how-el-salvadors-bitcoin-law-change-global-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adopt varied measures}}}\uc2  to recognize and regulate the crypto market, it will be interesting to see how the coming few days play out for Bitcoin, especially with the prevailing market sentiment that seems to be overwhelmingly positive at the moment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvZDBmMWRhNTAtMDAyNy00M2U3LTg1NDUtZmVmZWM4OWViM2JhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210820eh8k0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 ADAUSD\par \b \uc2 Cardano defies Peter Brandt\u8217\'20\'19s 90% crash warning,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price doubles to new high\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 638 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ethereum's upside exhaustion, Cardano's smart contract FOMO, and an overall boom in the altcoin market catalyzed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , ignored a serious price crash warning to rally to a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate reached $2.56 for the first time on Friday, following a 154.54% price boom that started on July 20. In doing so, the pair also ignored veteran trader {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-risks-60-90-drop-warns-trader-with-ada-painting-a-classic-bearish-pattern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Peter Brandt\u8217\'20\'19s 60%\u8211\'20\'1390% price crash warning}}}\uc2 , which was based on a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern called the head and shoulders.\par \par \uc2 I remember being scoffed at unmercifully when I identified this top in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTCUSD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTCUSD}}}\uc2  back in mid 2018\par \par \uc2 Hey Cardano trolls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADAUSD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ADAUSD}}}\uc2  , take aim... {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/3gytNHW4cR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/3gytNHW4cR}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Peter Brandt (@PeterLBrandt) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1421079965508984844?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 30, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 But a flurry of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  fundamentals assisted Cardano to ignore \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical setups.\par \par \uc2 Capital rotation\par \par \uc2 At first, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\u8217\'20\'19s upside rally in the early days appeared largely in the wake of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-liquidity-crisis-could-see-new-eth-all-time-high-before-bitcoin-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 similar boom across the cryptocurrency market}}}\uc2 , led by the euphoria surrounding its rival\u8217\'20\'19s, Ethereum, major software upgrade and fresh endorsements for Bitcoin from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spacex-owns-bitcoin-elon-musk-and-nic-carter-believe-btc-is-becoming-greener"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tesla\u8217\'20\'19s Elon Musk}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-key-to-the-future-of-twitter-jack-dorsey-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter\u8217\'20\'19s Jack Dorsey}}}\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  prices also tailed Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which has recently rallied above $48,000. But the Cardano token started outperforming Bitcoin after Tuesday as the latter turned choppy around the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s tapering decision, as Cointelegraph covered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slides-with-s-p500-as-fed-signals-tapering-120b-monthly-bond-purchases"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/7b183937-0e66-4b5b-aa32-74a8982763e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trends (black and white) vs. BTC price trends (red and blue). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In detail, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate surged 36.81% from its Wednesday low of $1.87 versus BTC/USD\u8217\'20\'19s 7.91% rally in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Other top altcoins also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoins-soar-after-bitcoin-price-bounces-off-a-key-moving-average"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted better profits than Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , hinting that traders merely rotated capital out of the flagship crypto\u8217\'20\'19s market on overvaluation risks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/229496c5-fa8b-4c86-ba79-2944c2627f01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins 24-hour adjusted performance against the U.S. dollar and Bitcoin. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 Smart contracts FOMO\par \par \uc2 Traders\u8217\'20\'19 bids for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  also surged due to hype surrounding Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alonzo}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D upgrade, which is scheduled for mid-September. The update expects to deploy smart contracts functionality onto the Cardano blockchain, a step that the project\u8217\'20\'19s supporters say will make it a direct rival to Ethereum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/smartcontracts?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #smartcontracts}}}\uc2  are coming...\par \par \uc2 We're on track to meet the projected HF dates for both testnet & mainnet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Alonzo?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Alonzo}}}\uc2  upgrade, as Nigel outlined in last week update\par \par \uc2 A new era is set to begin on Sunday 12th September 2021 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HrdrqYizhP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HrdrqYizhP}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Input Output (@InputOutputHK) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/InputOutputHK/status/1427601293170946048?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 17, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Smart contracts would enable Cardano to integrate more decentralized applications in its ecosystem, particularly decentralized finance platforms that enable automated borrowing, lending and trading services.\par \par \uc2 Technical outlook\par \par \uc2 Brandt\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup appears less likely to be realized by traders against {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ada-hits-2-first-the-time-since-may-ahead-of-cardano-smart-contract-announcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  fundamentals}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart shows the pair in price discovery. Meanwhile, a Fibonacci retracement graph sketched from the swing high of $2.51 to the swing low of $1.05 spots \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  testing $2.51 as its interim resistance level.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bullish-cup-and-handle-pattern-sets-cardano-ada-price-up-for-a-new-ath"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  cup and handle pattern sets Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up for a new ATH}}}\par \par \uc2 A close above the said price ceiling puts \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD en route to the next resistance line at 1.618 Fib line near $3.41.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/bc997892-3722-4750-8a27-c63cea9c4204.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart technical setup. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conversely, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s daily relative strength indicator (RSI), now above 70, has alerted about its interim overvaluation risks. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD can undergo a certain degree of correction to neutralize its overbought status, with the next support target sitting near 0.786 Fib line (at $2.20).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYzNhNmY0ZjgtNTU2Ni00ODQwLTliNzEtZGUzNWQyZDVkOTE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210820eh8k0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Solana price soars to new highs with DeFi project launch, $70M DEX funding\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 687 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana blockchain's native asset SOL soared to a new record high on Monday, to over $65.\par \par \uc2 Solana blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s native asset, SOL, soared to a new record high on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USD exchange rate rose by 26.12% to $65.467 on the Binance exchange after traders assessed a flurry of infrastructural developments in the Solana ecosystem, including a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-multichain-approach-is-the-future-of-the-blockchain-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent $70-million crowdfund}}}\uc2  to support its blockchain-powered decentralized exchange, Mango Markets.\par \par \uc2 Solana ecosystem upgrades\par \par \uc2 Mango offers a platform for spot markets, lending and perpetual futures. It sources liquidity from its native pools and Serum, another Solana blockchain-based exchange, which is backed by billionaire Sam Bankman-Fried\u8217\'20\'19s FTX.\par \par \uc2 The working model is very similar to other successful, Ethereum-based decentralized exchanges such as Uniswap and SushiSwap.\par \par \uc2 I don't think you guys realize how \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mangomarkets?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @mangomarkets}}}\uc2  really is\par \par \uc2 50% of all USDC on Solana {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2  was on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mangomarkets?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @mangomarkets}}}\uc2  token sale, Sam has his hands all over this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MCAPS&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MCAPS}}}\uc2  is my play because of the low supply (below 475) and this is basically a bet on Mango with a better reward % {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/gSJaLn1QPC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/gSJaLn1QPC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/aI6nnr9UR9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/aI6nnr9UR9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 LilMoonLambo (@LilMoonLambo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LilMoonLambo/status/1425417444626153478?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 11, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Other optimistic updates involved the Aug. 9 launch of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-announces-defi-hackathon-offering-200k-in-seed-funding"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wormhole}}}\uc2 , a communication protocol between Solana and other top decentralized finance projects, including Terra, Ethereum and Binance Smart Chain, and the SOL-powered sales of the Degenerate Ape Project\u8217\'20\'19s 10,000 nonfungible tokens (NFT) over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe very first day has already had over 200k SOL traded not even 24 hours in,\u8221\'20\'1D market analyst Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1427047821690253314"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  on the NFT sale on Solana marketplace Solanart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere are barely any notable NFT projects if any on SOL, but what happens as the market begins to shift? The demand for SOL will drive prices up to new highs and looking at the chart it\u8217\'20\'19s primed for price discovery.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In conclusion. The FA+ TA is setting up for an explosive price discovery opportunity to trade and one that can be fueled by NFT's and projects launching on SOL. It's ready imo and a no brainer. Imo the most \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  asset in the space right now. Make the switch before the crowd. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/RfcEVVV54B"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/RfcEVVV54B}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi Wont DM You (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1427034100704161796?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 15, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market influence\par \par \uc2 The latest bull run in the Solana market also appeared as gains in top cryptocurrencies slowed down.\par \par \uc2 Both Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) stopped their upside booms midway on overvaluation risks, with their relative strength index (RSI) indicators returning readings above 70, a sign that traders consider these assets overbought.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, alternative cryptocurrencies picked up their upside momentum in the wake of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s and Ether\u8217\'20\'19s flat price action.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-hackathon-aims-to-bolster-crypto-innovation-in-india"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana hackathon aims to bolster crypto innovation in India}}}\par \par \uc2 For instance, the last seven days saw Solana surging by 57%, much in line with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , which also climbed 57%. Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s top rival, Cardano, also reported a 47% spike for its native asset {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , while meme cryptocurrency \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose 34% on fresh Elon Musk and Mark Cuban endorsements.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/cbf081a0-e507-42b6-b634-df544f7e8b9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 crypto assets' performance. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 But like Bitcoin and Ether, Solana now appears to be facing the same overvaluation risks.\par \par \uc2 As on Monday, the SOL/USD\u8217\'20\'19s daily RSI reading reached 84, raising profit-taking risks even though optimistic fundamentals ensured \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  backstops to the pair\u8217\'20\'19s ongoing price rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6b8038f5-541a-4e2c-a94a-fe8b972293e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart featuring its overbought RSI. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In previous instances, an RSI-led sell-off had SOL test its 50-day exponential moving average as support. The wave currently sits around $36.56, down 41% from SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvM2E3NjBiMmItMmFjNi00OTgzLTkzMzItMTI5N2E1Yjk3MTE2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210816eh8g0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Ether is more popular than Bitcoin in Singapore, new study finds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Erhan Kahraman \par \uc2 379 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The State of Crypto in Singapore Report 2021 shows that more than two-thirds of Singaporeans who have financial investments currently hold crypto.\par \par \uc2 Being a crypto-friendly country has paid off in terms of adoption, as a new study about Singapore revealed.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe State of Crypto in Singapore Report 2021,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gemini.com/state-of-sg-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conducted}}}\uc2  by crypto exchange Gemini in partnership with CoinMarketCap and Seedly, found that more than two-thirds of Singaporeans who have financial investments currently hold crypto.\par \par \uc2 The report, which sampled 4,348 Singapore-based adults who self-identify as having or being interested in personal finance and investment products, shows that 67% of the respondents currently own crypto assets.\par \par \uc2 While one in five crypto holders are women, the study profiles the average Singaporean crypto holder as a \u8220\'20\'1C29-year-old male with an average annual household income of about 51,968 Singapore dollars ($38,456) a year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Regarding the distribution of crypto assets held by Singaporean investors, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the native cryptocurrency of the Ethereum blockchain, takes a clear lead with 78% as the most popular cryptocurrency, while 69% of crypto holders own Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) follow the top two at 40% and 31%, respectively. One in four investors hold {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ), according to the survey.\par \par \uc2 The report reveals that people\u8217\'20\'19s interest in crypto increased partly due to the COVID-19 pandemic, as 67% of crypto holders invested more during the pandemic to hedge against inflation or invest their increased disposable incomes due to lockdowns.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/singapore-grants-first-regulatory-in-principle-approval-to-crypto-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Singapore grants first regulatory in-principle approval to crypto exchange}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a lack of knowledge and understanding is the leading factor deterring non-crypto owners from investing in the assets class. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of crypto markets, the risky nature of crypto investments and the lack of regulatory oversight were also noted as barriers to investing.\par \par \uc2 Another study with a smaller sampling group recently revealed that 46% of Singaporeans plan to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/43-of-singaporeans-own-crypto-according-to-independent-reserve-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy digital assets in the next 12 months}}}\uc2 . With a zero capital gains tax on cryptocurrency income, Singapore {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-bitmain-ceo-jihan-wu-regulatory-crackdown-may-be-good-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 established itself as a hub}}}\uc2  for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2020-s-5-countries-friendliest-to-crypto-and-blockchain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto and blockchain in the Asia Pacific region}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYmY2MDA0NDUtN2RjOC00NDBmLWI3M2MtNjE4NTkxZGY3NzljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210816eh8g0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price slips under $46K, but analysts are betting on new Bitcoin all-time highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 435 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sees a further dip but BTC price action looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for traders.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw lows of under $45,600 on Sunday as a second installment of its resistance rejection played out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ea32123d-1eb1-42f3-84c3-18635735f10b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour price chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Analysts eye BTC attack on all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD giving up $46,000 overnight on Saturday after an earlier failed breakout.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-46k-support-after-failed-breakout-cardano-price-passes-2-20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , bulls had run out of steam during an attack on a major sell wall holding Bitcoin back from $50,000.\par \par \uc2 The U-turn sparked a more fragile mood for Sunday, with daily losses sitting at 4% at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis area is to me the major boss and hurdle to climb,\u8221\'20\'1D popular Twitter trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1426298953537048576"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2 , adopting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on higher timeframes.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD, he added, had almost completed preparation for a rematch of all-time highs in a zone above resistance at $50,000 and higher.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI still believe for now it will be a Short term LH on the micro before we go for that upper range.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Fellow trader, analyst and Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe likewise hinted about a longer-term moment of reckoning potentially appearing soon.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin is inside the higher timeframe resistance,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1426581885178630146"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  Saturday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNext week will be the important week, I think.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1426816943701602304"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance showed the $48,000 sellers are still firmly in place, with support amassing at $45,000 after the modest leg down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b25d1045-ce49-4d39-a110-93cedff185fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 15. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cardano cools major rally\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin had a conspicuous knock-on effect among major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-chart-triggers-sell-off-warning-after-price-explodes-by-54-in-one-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP chart triggers sell-off warning after price explodes by 54% in one week}}}\par \par \uc2 While many in the top 50 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization either canceled out or saw weak 24-hour gains, the top five all lost in step with BTC.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token, the standout along with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  as the weekend began, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-chart-triggers-sell-off-warning-after-price-explodes-by-54-in-one-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 came off multi-month highs}}}\uc2  to circle $2.10.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWould I be buying Cardano here? No,\u8221\'20\'1D van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1426672480052150274"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned}}}\uc2  prior to the dip.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDo I expect Cardano to be gaining value in the coming months/years? Yes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Market participants continue to expect altcoin opportunities to increase in the coming months, with a focus on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-3-metrics-suggest-there-s-still-time-for-another-defi-summer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance tokens}}}\uc2  in particular.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvM2U2YjJmNTYtODRjYy00NGNkLWEzMGMtODdiY2E4MGVkMjRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210816eh8f0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price slips under $46K but analysts are betting on new Bitcoin all-time highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 434 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sees a further dip but BTC price action looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for traders.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw lows of under $45,600 on Aug. 15 as a second instalment of its resistance rejection played out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/ea32123d-1eb1-42f3-84c3-18635735f10b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour price chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Analysts eye BTC attack on all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD giving up $46,000 overnight on Saturday after an earlier failed breakout.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-46k-support-after-failed-breakout-cardano-price-passes-2-20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , bulls had run out of steam during an attack on a major sell wall holding Bitcoin back from $50,000.\par \par \uc2 The U-turn sparked a more fragile mood for Sunday, with daily losses sitting at 4% at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 "This area is to me the major boss and hurdle to climb," popular Twitter trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1426298953537048576"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2 , adopting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on higher timeframes.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD, he added, had almost completed preparation for a rematch of all-time highs in a zone above resistance at $50,000 and higher.\par \par \uc2 "I still believe for now it will be a Short term LH on the micro before we go for that upper range."\par \par \uc2 Fellow trader, analyst and Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe likewise hinted about a longer-term moment of reckoning potentially appearing soon.\par \par \uc2 "Bitcoin is inside the higher timeframe resistance," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1426581885178630146"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  Saturday.\par \par \uc2 "Next week will be the important week, I think."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1426816943701602304"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance showed the $48,000 sellers still firmly in place, with support amassing at $45,000 after the modest leg down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b25d1045-ce49-4d39-a110-93cedff185fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 15. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Cardano cools major rally\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin had a conspicuous knock-on effect among major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-chart-triggers-sell-off-warning-after-price-explodes-by-54-in-one-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP chart triggers sell-off warning after price explodes by 54% in one week}}}\par \par \uc2 While many in the top-fifty cryptocurrencies by market cap either canceled out or saw weak 24-hour gains, the top five all lost in step with BTC.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token, the standout along with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  as the weekend began, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-chart-triggers-sell-off-warning-after-price-explodes-by-54-in-one-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 came off multi-month highs}}}\uc2  to circle $2.10.\par \par \uc2 "Would I be buying Cardano here? No," Van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1426672480052150274"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned}}}\uc2  prior to the dip.\par \par \uc2 "Do I expect Cardano to be gaining value in the coming months/years? Yes."\par \par \uc2 Market participants continue to expect altcoin opportunities to increase in the coming months, with a focus on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-3-metrics-suggest-there-s-still-time-for-another-defi-summer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi tokens}}}\uc2  in particular.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvM2U2YjJmNTYtODRjYy00NGNkLWEzMGMtODdiY2E4MGVkMjRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210815eh8f0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/13: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, SOL, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,017 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The sharp rebound in Bitcoin and most major altcoins proves that traders are buying aggressively on every minor dip.\par \par \uc2 A KPMG report titled \u8220\'20\'1CPulse of Fintech H1 2021,\u8221\'20\'1D shows that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-and-blockchain-investments-have-already-doubled-2020-kpmg-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total investment in the blockchain and cryptocurrency sector}}}\uc2  in the first half of this year has risen to $8.7 billion, which is more than double the $4.3 billion worth of deals done in 2020.\par \par \uc2 KPMG global fintech co-leader Anton Ruddenklau said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCryptocurrency and blockchain are exploding globally. I think for the rest of this year at least, crypto will be a very hot ticket for investors.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Separate research by blockchain market intelligence Blockdata also shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/55-of-world-s-top-100-banks-reportedly-have-crypto-and-blockchain-exposure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 55 out of the top 100 banks}}}\uc2  by assets under management have directly or through subsidiaries invested in crypto and blockchain firms.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/539b884b-0459-4426-b1de-5265cda5d337.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bittrex Global CEO Stephen Stonberg told Cointelegraph that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-is-no-longer-in-the-early-adoption-stage-bittrex-global-ceo-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto industry has gone mainstream}}}\uc2  and is past the stage of early adoption. \u8220\'20\'1CWhat\u8217\'20\'19s more interesting to see is the growth and acceleration of institutional adoption of cryptocurrencies. Almost all major institutions have invested in cryptocurrencies or plan to invest in cryptocurrencies,\u8221\'20\'1D Stonberg added.\par \par \uc2 Stonberg added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat\u8217\'20\'19s more interesting to see is the growth and acceleration of institutional adoption of cryptocurrencies. Almost all major institutions have invested in cryptocurrencies or plan to invest in cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will the strong institutional inflow into the crypto sector start the next leg of the uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) below the 200-day simple moving average ($45,218) on Aug 12 but they have not been able to sustain the lower levels. The bulls have pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA today, indicating buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/98244b73-dd2c-4811-863e-ca9a59da029a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the resistance line of the wedge, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $51,500. This level may act as resistance but if bulls do not give up much ground, the uptrend may reach $60,000.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($41,743) and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line of the wedge, the bears will smell an opportunity. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could open the doors for a further decline to the critical support at $36,670.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dropped to the breakout level at $3,000 on Aug. 12 but the bears could not capitalize on the opportunity. The bulls purchased the dip and are attempting to resume the up-move today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/b43e2dbb-da48-44a1-8fef-b41e63f200fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,784) and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers propel the price above $3,274, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $3,587.06 and then to $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $3,274, the pair may again drop to $3,000 and consolidate between these two levels for a few more days. A breakdown and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then drop to $2,450.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 12, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The buyers purchased at lower levels and are currently attempting to resolve the uncertainty in their favor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a89e1ac2-07b0-4f32-baf5-0e96731d31b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above $408.72, the up-move could reach the overhead resistance at $433. The bears may again pose a stiff challenge at this level and if the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($347).\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off this support will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above $433. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could start its journey to $520 and later to $600. The bears will have to pull the price back below $340 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) candlestick on Aug. 11 shows that bears tried to stall the rally near the overhead resistance at $1.94. That was followed by an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 12 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/cd83d3e0-cb49-4d36-862c-0ff79faf93e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have thrust the price above the overhead resistance today, which opens the gates for a rally to the all-time high at $2.47. However, the RSI has risen above 86, indicating that the rally is overextended in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could witness selling at higher levels and may enter a minor correction or consolidation in the next few days. A break and close below $1.94 could result in a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($1.51).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls defend the breakout level at $1.94, it will suggest that traders are not booking profits. That will enhance the prospects of a retest of the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the downtrend line of the descending channel and surged to the overhead resistance at $1.07 on Aug. 11 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back inside the channel on Aug. 12 but the correction was short lived.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c25c729c-3a69-4a71-bea6-1212e4045854.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have again pushed the price above the channel today and are attempting to clear the stiff hurdle at $1.07. If the price breaks and closes above $1.07, the XRP/USDT pair could start its journey to $1.26 and then to $1.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $1.07, the bears will again try to pull the pair back into the channel. If they manage to do that, the next stop could be the 20-day EMA ($0.80).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to drive the pair above $1.07. Alternatively, a break and close below $0.75 will signal advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 12. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that bears are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $0.29. Lower levels attracted buying from the bulls who are trying to propel the price above the overhead resistance today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/f0dc2d22-1d5c-4710-a410-14958d1219e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.23) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. A breakout and close above $0.29 could clear the path for a rally to $0.35 and then $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will have another go at $0.29. A break and close below $0.21 could signal that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $21 on Aug. 11 but their joy was short lived as the bears pulled the price back below the level on Aug. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/80ab1280-174d-49a6-9f50-21303196d11c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain the price below $21 again attracted buying and the bulls are currently attempting to thrust the price above $22.45. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $26.50.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the $26.50 level aggressively as the 200-day SMA ($27.23) is placed just above it. If the bulls do not cede much ground, it will indicate that buyers are not booking profits aggressively as they anticipate the rally to continue. A breakout and close above $26.50 may signal an end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($18.70), the pair could slide to $16.93.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $30 on Aug. 12 but the bears could not sink the price below the immediate support at the 200-day SMA ($26.18). This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/63621cbf-8e1e-42ab-bcf9-f186c1212bc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has rebounded today and the buyers are again trying to thrust the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $30. If they can pull it off, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to $37.\par \par \uc2 If bulls arrest the subsequent decline above $30, it will increase the likelihood of a retest of the all-time high at $45. The rising 20-day EMA ($24.80) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the large range between $13 and $30 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/opensea-trading-volume-explodes-76-240-ytd-amid-nft-boom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OpenSea trading volume explodes 76,240% YTD amid NFT boom}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) candlestick on Aug. 11 and 12 shows that bears aggressively defended the overhead resistance at $44. However, the sellers could not pull the price below the support at $38.10, indicating buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/d58f9f74-30ea-4a86-949e-b5f07ede79de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have again pushed the price to the overhead resistance at $44 today. A breakout and close above this level could open the gates for a rally to the psychological resistance at $50, followed by a retest of the all-time high at $58.38.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($36.77). A breakdown and close below this support will suggest that the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been struggling to push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $180 for the past two days. This suggests that bears are attempting to stall the relief rally in the zone between $180 and the 200-day SMA ($191).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/8a96d409-b367-463c-a52b-dac4f4ff2e7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone, the bears will try to pull the LTC/USDT pair down to the 20-day EMA ($151). A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains positive. A breakout and close above the 200-day SMA will signal that the downtrend may have ended.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rally to $225 where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge. After that, if bulls flip the 200-day SMA to support, it will indicate the start of a new uptrend. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $150.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "